<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">MAT-POGORO</book>
  <para style="h">MATAYU</para>
  <para style="toc1">Shisoweru Shiwagira shakalembiti Matayu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Matayu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mat</para>
  <para style="mt2">SHISOWERU SHIWAGIRA SHAKALEMBITI</para>
  <para style="mt1">MATAYU</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGOLERU</para>
  <para style="ip">Shisoweru Shiwagira shakalembiti Matayu ndo muwamu mwa vitabu vyamsheshi Mulipatanu lyasyayi vyaviyowelera makaliru ga Yesu Kristu. Kila shimu shishemwa “Injili” mana yakuyi “Shisoweru Shiwagira.” Vitabu avi vilembitwi na Matayu na Mariku na Luka na Yohani. Wasomi wavimana ndiri tarehi ya kulembwa Shisoweru Shiwagira sha Matayu, pamonga shilembwa shinja sha sitini pakiwukiti Yesu. Na viraa wavimana ndiri koshi kwashilembitwi, kumbiti wavuwa walihola kuwera pamonga shilembwa Palestina ama mlushi lwa Yerusalemu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mlemba gwa shitabu ashi ndo Matayu yakaweriti mtola kodi pamberi pa Yesu kumshema kaweri mfundwa, viraa kamanikana kwa litawu lya Lawi. Matayu kaweriti yumu gwawu pakati pa wantumintumi walii kuminambili na kawalembiriti wasoma wa Shiyawudi. Ayi ilanguziya nakaka nentu mawuyiru sitini kwa malembu ga Shisoweru shigona. Kafiriti kulanguziya kuwera Yesu kaweriti Mlopola, Mlungu kamsyagula handa Mkombola na yomberi ndo yakatungitwi. Viraa Matayu kalembiti gavuwa kuusu ufalumi wa Mlungu. Wayawudi wamtumbira Mlopola hakizi kuwera mfalumi gwa ufalumi wa pasipanu. Matayu kaloliti weri kuusu njimiru ayi kwa kuyowelera ufalumi wa shirohu wa Mlungu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Shisoweru Shiwagira shakalembiti Matayu ndo shitabu shiherepa kwanjira Lipatanu lya Syayi toziya ya mawuyiru gakuyi goseri ga Shisoweru Shiwagira shigona. Shitabu ashi shikolaniziya mapatanu mawili. Wasoma viraa wankutakula kuwera Matayu kajeriti kufata mfanu handa yaviwera vitabu vya Musa, vyeni ndo vitabu muhanu vya kwanja Mulipatanu ligona. Mabweru ga Yesu kulugongu, shipandi sha 5 mpaka sha 7 gaweza kulinganiziwa na Mlungu ntambu yakampananiti Musa malagaliru galii, Maholu 19:3-23:33.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yagaweramu</para>
  <para style="io">Matayu kanja Shisoweru Shiwagira pakalonga kuusu kwiwuka kwa Yesu Kristu na kwanja kwa utenderu wakuyi, shipandi sha 1-4.</para>
  <para style="io">Shakapanu Matayu kalinginiziya utenderu wa Yesu na mafunda gakuyi gavuwa, shipandi sha 5-25.</para>
  <para style="io">Shipandi sha upeleru wa shitabu sha Matayu, Mlandu mkulu muutenderu wa Yesu gutakulira kuhowa kwakuyi na kuzyuka kwakuyi, shipandi sha 26-28.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1" />
  <para style="s">Lukolu lwa Yesu Kristu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 3:23-38">Luka 3:23-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1" />Yesu Kristu kaweriti mwiwuka gwa Dawudi na mwiwuka gwa Aburahamu. Ayi ndo walanga ya lukolu wakuyi,<verse eid="MAT 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2" />Aburahamu kamwiwuliti Isaka na Isaka kamwiwuliti Yakobu na Yakobu kamwiwuliti Yuda na walongu wakuyi, <verse eid="MAT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3" />Yuda kamwiwuliti Peresi na Zera mawu gwawu kaweriti Tamari na Peresi kamwiwuliti Hesironi na Hesironi kamwiwuliti Rami, <verse eid="MAT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4" />Rami kamwiwuliti Aminadabu na Aminadabu kamwiwuliti Nashoni na Nashoni kamwiwuliti Salimoni <verse eid="MAT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5" />na Salimoni kamwiwuliti Boazi mawu gwakuyi kaweriti Rahabu, Boazi na Ruti waweriti walera wa Obedi, Obedi kamwiwuliti Yese.<verse eid="MAT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6" />Na Yese kamwiwuliti Mfalumi Dawudi na Dawudi kamwiwuliti Selemani mawu gwakuyi kaweriti mdala gwa Uriya, <verse eid="MAT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7" />Selemani kamwiwuliti Rehobowamu na Rehobowamu kamwiwuliti Abiya na Abiya kamwiwuliti Asa. <verse eid="MAT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8" />Asa kamwiwuliti Yehoshafati na Yehoshafati kamwiwuliti Uziya <verse eid="MAT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9" />na Uziya kamwiwuliti Yosamu na Yosamu kamwiwuliti Ahazi na Ahazi kamwiwuliti Hezekiya. <verse eid="MAT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10" />Hezekiya kamwiwuliti Manasi na Manasi kamwiwuliti Amoni na Amoni kamwiwuliti Yosiya <verse eid="MAT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11" />na Yosiya kamwiwuliti Yekoniya na walongu wakuyi. Ashi shiweriti shaka sha Wayawudi pawawajegiti kugenda muuhamisiwu Babiloni.<verse eid="MAT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12" />Pa Wayawudi kuwatola kugenda muuhamisiwu Babiloni, Yekoniya kamwiwuliti Sheyatieli na Sheyatieli kamwiwuliti Zerubabeli, <verse eid="MAT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13" />Zerubabeli kamwiwuliti Abiyudi na Abiyudi kamwiwuliti Eliyakimu na Eliyakimu kamwiwuliti Azori. <verse eid="MAT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14" />Azori kamwiwuliti Sadoki na Sadoki kamwiwuliti Akimu na Akimu kamwiwuliti Eliwudi. <verse eid="MAT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15" />Eliwudi kamwiwuliti Eleyazari na Eliyazari kamwiwuliti Matati na Matati kamwiwuliti Yakobu. <verse eid="MAT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16" />Yakobu kamwiwuliti Yosefu mpalu gwa Mariya, mawu gwa Yesu, yawamshema Kristu.<verse eid="MAT 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17" />Su kuweriti na viyiwuku kumi na msheshi kwanjira Aburahamu mpaka Dawudi na viyiwuku kumi na msheshi kwanjira Dawudi mpaka Wayawudi pawawalopoliti kugenda Babiloni na viyiwuku kumi na msheshi kwanjira pawawatoliti lopola mpaka shaka sha Kristu.<verse eid="MAT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwiwuka kwa Yesu Kristu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 2:1-7">Luka 2:1-7</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18" />Hangu ndo Yesu Kristu ntambu yakiwukiti, Mariya mawu gwakuyi Yesu kaweriti kahetitwi na Yosefu. Kumbiti pamberi pa kulikala pamuhera gambira mpalu na mdala, kawonikaniti kana yinda kwa uwezu wa Rohu Mnanagala. <verse eid="MAT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19" />Yosefu mpalu gwakuyi kaweriti kamfiriziya Mlungu, kafiriti ndiri kumlanguziya kwa wantu kuwera kana vidoda, su kafiriti kumleka kwa bada. <verse eid="MAT 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20" />Pakaweriti kankali kankulihola hangu, malayika kamulawira mukulota na kumgambira, “Yosefu mwana gwa Dawudi, nagutira kumtola Mariya kaweri mdala gwaku. Mana kana yinda kwa uwezu wa Rohu Mnanagala. <verse eid="MAT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21" />Hakamwiwuli mwana mpalu, nagwenga hagumshemi Yesu, toziya yomberi ndo hakawalopoli wantu kulawa muvidoda vyawu.”<verse eid="MAT 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22" />Vinu, vyoseri avi vilawira su viweri nakaka visoweru vyakatakuliti Mtuwa kupitira mbuyi gwa Mlungu, <verse eid="MAT 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23" />“Luyenja hakaweri na yinda, hakamwiwuli mwana mpalu na womberi hawamshemi litawu lyakuyi Imanuweri.” Mana yakuyi, “Mlungu kapamuhera na twenga”.<verse eid="MAT 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24" />Su, Yosefu pakimkiti mumpota katenditi ntambu yakagambiritwi na malayika uli, kamtola mdala gwakuyi. <verse eid="MAT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25" />Kumbiti Yosefu waliwoniti ndiri na Mariya mpaka pakamwiwuliti mwana mpalu. Yosefu kamupananiti mwana litawu Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2" />
  <para style="s">Wahenga kulawa Kusika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1" />Yesu kiwukiti mumji gwa Betirehemu, muliboma lya Yudeya, shaka Herodi pakaweriti mfalumi. Kamkamu hera pakiwukiti kala, wantu wana malifa ga ntondu wiziti kulawa kwagulawa mshenji kwa kutali wasokiti Yerusalemu, <verse eid="MAT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2" />wakosiyiti, “Kakoshi mwana, Mfalumi gwa Wayawudi yakiwukiti? Tuyiwona ntondu yakuyi kulawa kwagulawa mshenji, na twiza kumguwira yomberi.”<verse eid="MAT 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3" />Mfalumi Herodi pakapikaniriti aga, kalisheriti, yomberi pamuhera na woseri yawalikala Yerusalemu. <verse eid="MAT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4" />Su kawashemiti watambika wakulu woseri pamuhera na wafunda wa Malagaliru na kuwakosiya, “Kristu Mlopola kiwuka koshi?”<verse eid="MAT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5" />Womberi wamwankula, “Kiwuka mumji gwa Betirehemu, muliboma lya Yudeya. Hangu ndo ntambu yawalembiti wambuyi wa Mlungu,<verse eid="MAT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6" />‘Gwee Betirehemu isi ya Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:6">Gwenga gwa mdidini ndiri mulushi lumanikana lwa Yudeya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:6">Toziya kwa gwenga hakalawili mlongoziya njira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:6">Yakawalongoziya wantu wangu Israeli.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7" />Su Herodi kawashemiti kwa bada wahenga yawalawiti kwagulawa mshenji, kawakosiyiti shaka sheni ntondu payiwalawiriti. <verse eid="MAT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8" />Shakapanu kawagambiriti wagendi Betirehemu pakalonga, “Mgendi mwakaloli weri visoweru vya mwana ayu, pamvimana kala munjegeli visoweru su naneni hang'endi kumguwira.”<verse eid="MAT 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9" />Pawampikaniriti kala mfalumi, wamana ntondu walii wagenditi. Su ntondu ilii yawayiwoniti kwagulawa mshenji iwalonguleliti mpaka igenda kugoloka pahala palii pakaweriti mwana. <verse eid="MAT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:10" />Pawayiwoniti ntondi ilii wanemeleriti nentu. <verse eid="MAT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11" />Su, wingiriti mnumba, wamwoniti mwana ulii pamuhera na Mariya mawu gwakuyi, wasuntama pasi na wamguwira. Shakapanu wavugula na kumupanana mafupu gawu ga zahabu na ubani na manemane.<verse eid="MAT 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12" />Mlungu kawabeliziyiti mumpota nawamwuyira Herodi, su wawuyiti kuisi kwawu kwa njira yamonga.<verse eid="MAT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutugira Misri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13" />Pawawukiti kala wahenga walii, malayika kamlawiriti Yosefu mukulota, kamgambiriti, “Gwimuki! Gumtoli mwana pamuhera na mawu gwakuyi, mtugili Misri. Mulikali kulii mpaka panikugambira, toziya Herodi kafira kumlaga mwana ayu.”<verse eid="MAT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14" />Su, Yosefu kimukiti, kamtola mwana pamuhera na mawu gwakuyi, kawukiti pashiru kugenda Misri. <verse eid="MAT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15" />Kalikaliti kulii mpaka pakahowiti Herodi. Mlandu agu gutendikiti su shisoweru shakatakuliti Mtuwa kwa njira ya mbuyi gwa Mlungu shitendeki, “Nimshemiti mwana gwangu kulawa Misri.”<verse eid="MAT 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wana wadidini wankulagua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16" />Shakapanu Herodi pakavimaniti wahenga walii yawalawiti kwagulawa mshenji wamzyanga, kakalariti nentu. Kalagaliriti wanonu woseri wapalu mumji gwa Betirehemu na mumpeku mwakuyi yawawera na umuli wa vinja viwili na pasi pawu walagwi. Katenditi hangu kulawirana na shilii shakamaniti kulawa kwa wahenga walii wamana ntondu.<verse eid="MAT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17" />Hangu ndo ntambu ya vitimiyiti visoweru vya umbuyi wa Mlungu kwa njira ya Yeremiya mbuyi gwa Mlungu,<verse eid="MAT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:18" />“Liziwu lipikanika aku Rama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">Shiwembu na kudaya kuvuwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">Raheri kankuwalilira wana wakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">Na kafira ndiri kunyamala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">Toziya woseri wahowa.”<verse eid="MAT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwuka Misri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19" />Herodi pakahowiti kala, malayika kamlawiriti Yosefu mukulota Misri kulii, <verse eid="MAT 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20" />kamgambira, “Gwimuki! Gumtoli mwana pamuhera na mawu gwakuyi muwuyi muisi ya Israeli toziya woseri yawafiriti kumlaga mwana, wahowa kala.” <verse eid="MAT 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21" />Su Yosefu kimuka, kamtola mwana pamuhera na mawu gwa mwana na wawuya Israeli.<verse eid="MAT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22" />Kumbiti Yosefu pakapikaniriti handa Arikerawu, mwana gwa Herodi kaweriti mfalumi gwa Yudeya pahala pakakolitimlima Herodi tati gwakuyi, katiliti kugenda kulii. Nayomberi, pawambereziyiti mukulota, su kagenditi wega zya Galilaya <verse eid="MAT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23" />na kalikaliti mlushi lwawalushema Nazareti. Hangu ndo ntambu yavitimiyiti visoweru vyakalongiti mbuyi gwa Mlungu, “Hawamshemi Mnazareti.”<verse eid="MAT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3" />
  <para style="s">Yohani Mbatiza ntambu yakabweriti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mariku 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luka 3:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yohani 1:19-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1" />Majuwa galii Yohani Mbatiza kalawiliti, kanjiti kubwera mushiwala sha Yudeya, <verse eid="MAT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:2" />“Mleki vidoda vyamtenda, toziya Ufalumi wa kumpindi wapakwegera!” <verse eid="MAT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3" />Yohani ayu ndo ulii mweni Isaya mbuyi gwa Mlungu kamtakuliti pakalongiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">“Liziwu lya muntu lipikanirika kushiwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">‘Mumtandiri kala Mtuwa njira yakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">Mumnyosheri njira zyakuyi!’ ”<verse eid="MAT 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4" />Yohani kavaliti nguwu yawasoniti kwa mibahira ya ngamiya na lufunga lwa lukuli mushunu mwakuyi na shiboga shakuyi shiweriti wanjombi na lwashi lwa kuntundu. <verse eid="MAT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5" />Su wantu kulawa Yerusalemu na kulawa wega zoseri zya Kuyudeya na mbwega zoseri za mump'eku mwa lushemba lya Yoridani. <verse eid="MAT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6" />Walonga vidoda vyawu na yomberi kawabatiziti mulushemba lwa Yoridani.<verse eid="MAT 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7" />Kumbiti pakawawoniti Mafalisayu wavuwa na Masadukayu wankumwizira su wabatizwi, kawagambiriti, “Mwenga wana wa njoka! Muntu gaa yakawagambireni muyitili maya ya Mlungu yayiza? <verse eid="MAT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8" />Mlanguziyi kwa vitendu handa mleka vidoda. <verse eid="MAT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9" />Namulihola na kulitakulira, ‘Tati gwetu ndo Aburahamu!’ Nikugambirani nakaka, Mlungu kaweza kugatenda mabuwi aga gaweri wana wa Aburahamu!<verse eid="MAT 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10" />“Su vinu liwagu litulwa kala kudumula mishigira ya mitera na kila mtera gwagulera ndiri mabwajubwaju gaherepa hagudumulwi na kugwasira mumotu. <verse eid="MAT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11" />Neni nunkuwabatiza kwa mashi kulanguziya kuwera mleka vidoda vyamtenditi. Kumbiti yakiza kumbeli kwaneni kawera na makakala kuliku neni, neni nfaa ndiri ata kupapa vilwatu vyakuyi. Yomberi hakakubatizani kwa Rohu Mnanagala na kwa motu. <verse eid="MAT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12" />Yomberi muliwoku lyakuyi kana luselu lwa kupetera, hakayijojiniri nganu na kuitula muluhanja lwakuyi, kumbiti hakatoli miwawi na kuipambira pamotu gwagutenda ndiri tiya.”<verse eid="MAT 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankubatizwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mariku 1:9-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luka 3:21-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13" />Shaka shilii Yesu kiziti kulawa Galilaya kasokiti palushemba lwa Yoridani, kamgenderiti Yohani su kambatizi. <verse eid="MAT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14" />Kumbiti Yohani kajeriti kumbelera pakalonga, “Yani gwenga gwankwiza kwa neni? Neni ndo nfiruwa kubatizwa na gwenga.”<verse eid="MAT 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15" />Su Yesu kamwankuliti, “Guleki hera iweri ntambu ira ayi vinu, hangu ndo ntambu iherepa kugatenda goseri gakafira Mlungu.” Palii Yohani kajimiriti.<verse eid="MAT 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16" />Kamkamu hera Yesu pawambatiziti kala, kalawiti mumashi, su kumpindi kwa Mlungu kuvuguka na kamwoniti Rohu gwa Mlungu pakiza pasi gambira ng'unda na kumkangira mulibega. <verse eid="MAT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17" />Liziwu kulawa kumpindi kwa Mlungu lilongiti, “Ayu ndo Mwana gwangu yanumfira nentu, nherepeziwa nayomberi.”<verse eid="MAT 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4" />
  <para style="s">Kujerwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mariku 1:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Luka 4:1-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1" />Shakapanu Rohu Mnanagala kamlonguziyiti Yesu kushiwala su kajerwi na Shetani. <verse eid="MAT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2" />Kaliyitindiri kwa mashaka alubayini pashiru na paluwala, shakapanu Yesu kaweriti na njala. <verse eid="MAT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3" />Su Shetani kamwiziriti, kamgambira, “Handa gwenga nakaka gwa Mwana gwa Mlungu, gugagalambuli mabuwi aga gaweri mabumunda.”<verse eid="MAT 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4" />Yesu kamwankuliti, “Malembu galonga, ‘Muntu hapeni kalikali kwa kuliya libunda hera, kumbiti kwa kila shisoweru shakatakula Mlungu.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5" />Shakapanu Shetani kamtoliti mpaka Yerusalemu, Mji Mnanagala na kamtuliti pashitwiku sha Numba nkulu ya Mlungu Nananagala, <verse eid="MAT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6" />kamgambiriti, “Handa gwenga nakaka gwa Mwana gwa Mlungu, gulyasi pasi, toziya malembu galonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:6">‘Mlungu hakawagambiri malayika wakuyi kuusu gwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:6">Hawakutoli mumawoku mwawu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:6">Nagulikwala mumabuwi’ ”<verse eid="MAT 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7" />Yesu kamgambiriti, “Kumbiti Malembu galonga viraa, ‘Nagumjera Mtuwa, Mlungu gwaku.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8" />Shakapanu Shetani kamtoliti mpaka pampindi nentu palugongu na kamlanguziyiti falumi zoseri zya pasipanu na ulunda wakuyi. <verse eid="MAT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9" />Kamgambiriti, “Hanikupanani gwenga goseri aga, handa pagusuntamala pasi na kunguwira neni.”<verse eid="MAT 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10" />Palii Yesu kamgambiriti, “Gugendi zyaku Shetani! Malembu galonga, ‘Hagumguwiri Mtuwa Mlungu gwaku na kumtendera yomberi gweka yakuyi!’ ” <verse eid="MAT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11" />Shakapanu, Shetani kamleka Yesu na wantumintumi wa kumpindi wa Mlungu wiziti kumtanga.<verse eid="MAT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kanjiti lihengu lyakuyi Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mariku 1:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luka 4:14-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12" />Yesu pakapikaniriti handa Yohani wamtula muligeleza, kagenditi mpaka Galilaya. <verse eid="MAT 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:13" />Kawukiti Nazareti, kagenditi Kafarinaumu, mji yaguweliti mump'eku mwa bahali ya genisareti, mumpaka mwa Zebuluni na Nafutari kalikala aku. <verse eid="MAT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14" />Hangu ndo ntambu yashitimiyiti shisoweru sha Mlungu shakatakuliti kwa njira ya Isaya mbuyi gwa Mlungu,<verse eid="MAT 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15" />“Isi ya Zebuluni na isi ya Nafutari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:15">Kuyigendera bahali, kumwambu kulushemba Yoridani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:15">Galilaya, isi ya wantu yawawera ndiri Wayawudi!<verse eid="MAT 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16" />Wantu yawakaliti muntiti</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:16">Wawona kulangala kukulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:16">Na woseri yawalikaliti muisi ya ntiti na shivinyiru sha kuhowa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:16">Kulangala Kuwalangalira.”<verse eid="MAT 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17" />Kwanjira shaka shilii Yesu kanjiti kubwera pakalonga, “Mleki vidoda, toziya Ufalumi wa kumpindi wapakwegera!”<verse eid="MAT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankuwashema walowasomba wamsheshi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mariku 1:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Luka 5:1-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18" />Yesu pakaweriti kankugendagenda kumbeku kulitanda lya Galilaya, kawawoniti walongu wawili yawaweriti walowasomba, Simoni yawamshema Peteru na mlongu gwakuyi Andereya, waweriti wankulowa wasomba mulitanda kwa wavu. <verse eid="MAT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19" />Yesu kawagambiriti, “Munfati, naneni haniwatendi mwenga muweri walowa wa wantu.” <verse eid="MAT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20" />Kamukamu hera wazilekiti navu zyawu, wamfatiti.<verse eid="MAT 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21" />Pakagenditi kulongolu kidogu, kawawoniti walongu wamonga wawili, Yakobu na Yohani, wana wa Zebedayu. Waweriti wa muuwatu pamuhera na tati gwawu Zebedayu wankuzinyawa navu zawu. Yesu kawashemiti, <verse eid="MAT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22" />palaa palii waguleka uwatu pamuhera na tati gwawu na wamfatiti.<verse eid="MAT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankufunda wantu na kuwaponiziya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:17-19">Luka 6:17-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23" />Yesu kagenditi mu Galilaya yoseri, kafunditi mnumba za Mlungu na kabweriti Shisoweru Shiwagira sha Ufalumi na Kaponiziyiti wantu yawawera na malweli ga ntambu zoseri. <verse eid="MAT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24" />Visoweru kuusu Yesu vyeniyiti muisi yoseri ya Siriya, su wantu woseri yawawera na malweli na yawalwala malweli ga ntambu zoseri na ntabiku, wantu yawawera na washamshera na wantu yawawera na visirika na wantu yawaweriti wahushu, wawajegiti kwa Yesu na kawaponiziyiti woseri. <verse eid="MAT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25" />Lipinga likulu lya wantu limfatiti kulawa Galilaya, isi zya miji kumi, Yerusalemu na Yudeya na kumwambu kulushemba Yoridani.<verse eid="MAT 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kankuwafunda wantu kulugongu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1" />Yesu pakagawoniti mapinga ga wantu, kakweniti kulugongu, kalivagiti pasi. Wafundwa wakuwi walivagiti pawamzyengeta, <verse eid="MAT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2" />na Yomberi kanjiti kuwafunda.<verse eid="MAT 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nemeli ya nakaka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:20-23">Luka 6:20-23</ref></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3" />“Mbaka ya woseri yawawera wahushu wa shirohu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:3">Toziya Ufalumi wa kumpindi ndo wawu!<verse eid="MAT 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4" />Mbaka kwa woseri yawawera na hinginiku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:4">Toziya Mlungu hakawazyangizyangi!<verse eid="MAT 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5" />Mbaka kwa woseri yawawera wapoli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:5">Toziya hawayihali isi.<verse eid="MAT 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6" />Mbaka kwa woseri yawawera na njala na yimiluwa ya kutenda gakafira Mlungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:6">Mlungu hakawayukutiziyi!<verse eid="MAT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7" />Mbaka kwa woseri yawawera na lusungu kwa wamonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:7">Mlungu hakawawoneri lusungu womberi!<verse eid="MAT 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8" />Mbaka kwa woseri yawamfira Mlungu kwa myoyu yawu yoseri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:8">Womberi hawamwoni Mlungu!<verse eid="MAT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9" />Mbaka kwa woseri yawajega ponga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:9">Mlungu hakawashemi wana wakuwi!<verse eid="MAT 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10" />“Mbaka kwa woseri yawatabika toziya yakutenda gakafira Mlungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:10">Ufalumi wa kumpindi ndo gwawu!<verse eid="MAT 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11" />“Mbaka mwenga wantu pawawigilanga na kuwazulumu na kuwatendera madoda ga ntambu zoseri toziya mwenga munjimila neni. <verse eid="MAT 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12" />Mwenga mnemeli na kusekelera toziya mafupu genu ndo makulu kumpindi kwa Mlungu. Hangu ndo ntambu yawalikaliti wambuyi wa makashu wa Mlungu pamberi pa mwenga.<verse eid="MAT 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Munu na langala</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mariku 9:50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34-35">Luka 14:34-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13" />“Mwenga mulifana gambira munu gwa pasipanu. Kumbiti munu pagwasa unoga wakuwi, kwahera njira yingi yakugutenda gunogi kayi. Hapeni gufayi, su hawagwasi kunja na wantu hawagutimbangi.<verse eid="MAT 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14" />“Mwenga ndo langala ya pasipanu! Lushi lwa walunyawiti mulugongu hapeni lulififi.<verse eid="MAT 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15" />“Kwahera wantu yawawasha shikoloboyi na kushigubikira na shiwiga, badala yakuwi hakashituli pampindi pa shintambi, su kulangala kwakuwi kulangali kwa kila muntu mnumba. <verse eid="MAT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16" />Ntambu ira ayi, langala ya mwenga ilangali mpaka kulongolu kwa wantu, su wagaloli matendu genu gaherepa, wamkwisi Tati gwenu yakawera kumpindi.<verse eid="MAT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagaliru ga Musa na Malembu ga wambuyi wa Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17" />“Namulihola handa niza kuwusiya Lilagaliru lya Musa na mafundu ga wambuyi wa Mlungu. Niza ndiri kugawusiya Malagaliru, kumbiti kutenda mafundu gawu gatendeki. <verse eid="MAT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18" />Nukugambirani nakaka, kumpindi na pasipanu pazipelera, kumbiti hapeni ata shisoweru shididini ama seemu ndidini yavilembitwi Mumalagaliru yiwusiwi, su mpaka mafundu goseri gatendeki. <verse eid="MAT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19" />Su yoseri yakamegi ata lilagaliru limu lididini na kuwafunda wamonga watendi viraa, ayu hakaweri mdidini muufalumi wa kumpindi kwa Mlungu. Kumbiti ulii yakabatira malagaliru na kuwafunda wamonga kutenda viraa, muntu ayu hakaweri mkulu muufalumi wa kumpindi kwa Mlungu. <verse eid="MAT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20" />Toziya nukugambirani, handa kumfiriziya Mlungu kwamwenga pakakanka ndiri ulii wa Mafalisayu na wafunda wa Malagaliru, hapeni mwingiri nakamu muufalumi wa kumpindi kwa Mlungu.<verse eid="MAT 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mafundu kuusu maya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 12:57-59">Luka 12:57-59</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21" />“Mpikaniriti ntambu ya wantu wagona wawagambiriti, ‘Nagulaga! Na yoseri yakalaga hawamtozi.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22" />Kumbiti vinu neni nukugambirani, yoseri yakawera na maya kwa mlongu gwakuwi hawamtozi, yakamzarawu mlongu gwakuwi hawamjegimushyotera motu. Na yakamshema mlongu gwakuwi, ‘Mzigizigi’ hakaweri muhatari ya kwingira mumotu gwa Jehanamu. <verse eid="MAT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23" />Su pagulaviya mafupu gaku pashitalawanda sha kutambikira na gulihola gwana ungondu na mlongu gwaku, <verse eid="MAT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24" />guleki mafupu gaku pashitalawanda sha kutambikira, guwuyi huti gwakatendi ponga na mlongu gwaku, su gwizi na gulaviyi mafupu gaku kwa Mlungu.<verse eid="MAT 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25" />“Gulikoli mawoku na mstaki gwaku kanongola pamuwera mwankali munjira kugenda mushyotera motu. Pagutenda ndiri hangu, mstaki gwaku hakakujegi kwa mtoza, nayomberi hakakujegi kwa wanjagila wakutatili mushibetubetu. <verse eid="MAT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26" />Nakaka nukugambira, hapeni gulawi mulii mpaka gulipi ligwala lya kumalalira.<verse eid="MAT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mafundu gawusu undiyandiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27" />“Mpikanira handa wantu wawagambiriti, ‘Nagutenda uhumba!’ <verse eid="MAT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28" />Su vinu neni nukugambirani, yoseri yakamlola mdala kwa kufira kutenda nayu undiyandiya, muntu ayu katenda kala uhumba mumoyu mwakuwi. <verse eid="MAT 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29" />Su, lisu lyaku lya kumliwu palitenda gutendi vidoda, gulikolopoli na kuliyasa kutali! Mbaka nentu kwasa shiwungu shimu sha nshimba yaku, kuliku nshimba yaku yoseri wayasi mumotu gwa Jehanamu. <verse eid="MAT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30" />Handa liwoku lyaku lya kumliwu litenda gutendi vidoda, gulidumuli na kulyasa kutali! Mbaka nentu gwenga kwasa shiwungu shimu munshimba yaku, kuliku nshimba yaku yoseri kwingira mumotu gwa Jehanamu.<verse eid="MAT 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mafundu yagausu kulekana</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:9">Matayu 19:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mariku 10:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luka 16:18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31" />“Itakulitwi kala viraa, ‘Yakamleka mdala gwakuwi ifiruwa kampanani malembu ga kumleka.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32" />Kumbiti neni nukugambirani, yakamupanana mdala gwakuwi malembu ga kumleka, tembera ndiri kwa shitwatira, kamtenda kaweri mndiyandiya, na muntu pakamyuga mdala yawampananiti malembu ga kumleka, katenda uhumba.”<verse eid="MAT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mafundu kuusu kulirapa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33" />“Kayi mpikanira handa wantu wagona wawagambiriti, ‘Naguleka kulirapa kwaku, kumbiti gutendi ntambu yagulirapa kwa Mtuwa.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34" />Kumbiti neni nukugambirani, nagulirapira kwa ntambu yoseri ilii. Nagulirapira kwa kumpindi, toziya ndo shibanta sha ufalumi sha Mlungu, <verse eid="MAT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35" />ama mupasipanu, mana ndo shibamta shakuwi sha kutulila magulu, ama kwa Yerusalemu toziya ndo lushi lwa Mfalumi mkulu. <verse eid="MAT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36" />Nagulirapira ata kwa mtuwi gwaku, toziya hapeni guwezi kutenda ata vilii yimu iweri neru ama ntiti. <verse eid="MAT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37" />Pagutakula ‘Yina’ su iweri ‘Yina’, pagutakula ‘Ndala’ su iweri ‘Ndala’. Shoseri shilii shagutakula kunja na ashi shilawa kwa ulii Shetani.<verse eid="MAT 5:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mafundu gasyayi gawusu kulikola mawoku</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:29-30">Luka 6:29-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38" />“Mpikaniriti ntambu yawatakulaga, ‘Lisu kwa lisu na linu kwa linu.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39" />Kumbiti neni nukugambirani, namumwuzilira muntu mdoda. Muntu pakakukoma lisaya lya kumliwu gumleki kakukomi viraa na lya kumshigi. <verse eid="MAT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40" />Muntu pakakujegera kushyotera motu kafira kalitoli lishati lyaku, gumlekeri viraa na likoti lyaku. <verse eid="MAT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41" />Na muntu pakakulazimisha kupapa shisanka shakuwi kilumita yimu, gushipapi kilumita mbili. <verse eid="MAT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42" />Muntu yakakuluwa gumpanani, nagumpanana shisogu muntu yakafira kukuwanda shintu.<verse eid="MAT 5:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwafira wangondu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:27-36">Luka 6:27-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43" />“Mpikanira ntambu yawatakuliti, ‘Guwafiri waganja waku na guwakalaliri wang'ondu waku.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44" />Kumbiti neni nukugambirani, muwafiri wang'ondu wenu na muwaluwili kwa Mlungu walii yawakuzulumani, <verse eid="MAT 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45" />su hamuweri wana wa Tati gwenu kakumpindi. Yomberi kawawalira mshenji wantu wadoda na wantu waheri na kawatowera viraa wantu woseri yawamfiriziya Mlungu na wantu yawamfiriziya ndiri Mlungu. <verse eid="MAT 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46" />Hashi, Mlungu hakakupanani mafupu ga ntambu gaa pamuwafira hera walii yawawafira mwenga? Ata watola kodi watenda viraa! <verse eid="MAT 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47" />Handa pamuwalamusiya hera walongu wenu, hashi, mtenda shitwatira sha hera hangu ndiri? Ata wantu yawamumana ndiri Mlungu watenda viraa! <verse eid="MAT 5:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48" />Muweri waheri ntambu yakawera muheri Tati gwenu kakumpindi!<verse eid="MAT 5:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6" />
  <para style="s">Ntambu ya kuwatanga wahushu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1" />“Mulikali weri namwiza kutenda matendu genu gagamfiriziya Mlungu kulongolu kwa wantu su mfira wakuloleni. Handa pamtenda hangu, Tati gwenu kakumpindi hapeni kawapanani mafupu.<verse eid="MAT 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2" />“Su, pagumpanana vintu muhushu nagulibwera, nagutenda gambira wafyangu ntambu yawatenda mnumba za Mlungu na munjira wantenda hangu su wantu wawakwisi. Nukugambirani nakaka, wantu awa wapata kala mafupu gawu goseri. <verse eid="MAT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3" />Kumbiti gwenga pagumpanana vintu muhushu, gutendi ntambu ayi ata ganja gwaku nakavimana shagutenda. <verse eid="MAT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4" />Shilii shagutenditi hashiweri muubada. Tati gwaku yakawona muubada, hakakupi lifupu.<verse eid="MAT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mafundu gawusu ntambu ya kumluwa Mlungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 11:2-4">Luka 11:2-4</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5" />“Pamluwa Mlungu namtenda gambira wafyangu! Womberi wafira kugoloka na kumluwa Mlungu pakati pa numba za Mlungu na pakati pa mbwega za njira su wantu wawaloli. Nukugambirani nakaka, womberi wapata kala mafupu gawu goseri. <verse eid="MAT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6" />Kumbiti gwenga pagumluwa Mlungu, gwingiri mushiwogu shaku, gutati mlyangu, shakapanu gumluwi Tati gwaku yakawoneka ndiri. Na Tati gwaku yakawona vintu vya muubada, hakakupanani lifupu.<verse eid="MAT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7" />“Pamumluwa Mlungu, nambotanga gambira wantu yawamumana ndiri Mlungu. Womberi walihola kuwera milungu yawu hayiwapikaniri toziya ya visoweru vyawu vivuwa. <verse eid="MAT 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8" />Namuwera gambira womberi. Tati gwenu kavimana kala galii gamfira pamberi pa kumluwa. <verse eid="MAT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9" />Su, hangu ndo ntambu yamfiruwa kumluwa Mlungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:9">‘Tati gwetu gwa kumpindi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:9">Litawu lyaku likwiswi.<verse eid="MAT 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10" />Ufalumi waku wizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:10">Shagufira shitendeki pasipanu gambira kumpindi.<verse eid="MAT 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11" />Gutupanani leru shiboga shetu sha kila lishaka.<verse eid="MAT 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12" />Gutulekiziyi vidoda vya twenga, ntambu yatuwalekeziyiti yawatutendiriti vidoda.<verse eid="MAT 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13" />Nagutwingiziya mukujerwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:13">Kumbiti gutulopoziyi kulawa kwa Mkondola ulii’ Toziya Ufalumi na likakala na uweru ndo vyaku mashaka goseri. Yina haa.<verse eid="MAT 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14" />“Toziya pamuwalekeziya wantu vidoda vyawu, Tati gwenu gwa kumpindi hakawalekiziyani mwenga. <verse eid="MAT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15" />Kumbiti pamuwalekeziya ndiri wantu vidoda vyawu, Tati gwenu hapeni kawalekiziyi mwenga vidoda vyenu.<verse eid="MAT 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mafundu gawusu kwoya kuliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16" />“Pamleka kuliya, namhinginika kusheni ntambu yawatenda wafyangu. Womberi wahinginika kusheni kwawu, su kila muntu kamloli handa koya kuliya. Nuwagambirani nakaka, womberi wapata kala mafupu gawu. <verse eid="MAT 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17" />Kumbiti gwenga pagoya kuliya, guliswagi mtuwi gwaku lipaki na gunawi sheni shaku, <verse eid="MAT 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18" />Su, muntu yoseri nakavimana handa gwoya kuliya, gumanikani hera na Tati gwaku yakawonekana ndiri. Na Tati gwaku yakawona shagutenda muubada, hakakupanani lifupu.<verse eid="MAT 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luwanja lwa kumpindi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 12:33-34">Luka 12:33-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19" />“Namulitulira luhanja pasipanu, wameyi na kutu vihalibisiya na vimpegu wabomolanga na kwiwa. <verse eid="MAT 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20" />Mlituliri luhanja lwenu kumpindi, kweni wamehi na kutu hapeni waluharibisii na vimpegu hapeni wabomolangi na kwiwa. <verse eid="MAT 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21" />Toziya palii paluwera luhanja lwaku, ndo haguweri moyu gwaku.<verse eid="MAT 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gulangala gwa nshimba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 11:34-36">Luka 11:34-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22" />“Lisu ndo limuliku lya nshimba. Handa lisu lyaku ndo likomu, nshimba yaku yoseri hayiweri muulangala. <verse eid="MAT 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23" />Handa lisu lyaku palilwala, nshimba yaku yoseri hayiweri muntiti. Su ulangala waguwera mngati mwaku ndo ntiti, su ayi ndo ntiti ya kulyogisiya nentu!<verse eid="MAT 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlungu na lunda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 16:13">Luka 16:13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24" />“Kwahera muntu yakaweza kuwatendera watuwa wawili, toziya hakamkalaliri yumu na kumfira yumonga, ama hakamjimiri yumu na kumbeza yumonga. Hapeni mumtenderi Mlungu na mpiya.<verse eid="MAT 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lyoga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 12:22-31">Luka 12:22-31</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25" />“Ndo mana nuwagambirani, namtira kuusu shiboga na shilandwa vyamfira su mulikali, ama hamvali shishi. Hashi, makaliru ndo shiboga hera ama nentu? Na nshimba hashi handa nentu ndiri ya nguwu? <verse eid="MAT 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26" />Muwaloli wampongu wa muntundu, wayala ndiri mbeyu na wabena ndiri, wala wahera luwanja loseri. Ata hangu, Tati gwenu gwa kumpindi kawaliyiziya! Hashi, mwenga mwamana ndiri kuliku wampongu awa? <verse eid="MAT 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27" />Ndo gaa muwamu mwenu yakawera na lyoga kaweza kwongera shaka sha kulikala pasipanu?<verse eid="MAT 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28" />“Ntambu gaa mulihola kuusu nguwu? Mloli uluwa wa muntundu ntambu yawukula, utenda ndiri lihengu pota na kupota. <verse eid="MAT 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29" />Kumbiti nuwagambirani, ata Mfalumi Selemani mweni na ulunda wakuwi woseri wamvalisiya ndiri nguwu ziherepa gambira uluwa awu. <verse eid="MAT 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30" />Payiwera, Mlungu kaluvalusiya luhamba lwa mlushi hangu lweni leru lwa palaa na shirawu lwaswa mumotu. Hashi, hakawatenderi mwenga nentu? Mwenga wantu mwana njimiru mdidini!<verse eid="MAT 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31" />“Su, namwera na lyoga, ‘Shiboga shangu hashilawi koshi? Ama hatulandi shishi? Ama hatuvali shishi?’ <verse eid="MAT 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32" />Vyoseri avi, wantu yawamumana ndiri Mlungu wavisakula. Tati gwenu gwa kumpindi kavimana kuwera mfira vintu vyoseri avi. <verse eid="MAT 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33" />Su, mtendi huti Ufalumi wa Mlungu na galii gakafira Mlungu na aga goseri hakakupanani nentu. <verse eid="MAT 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34" />Su, namwana lyoga kuusu shirawu, shirawu hailiholi yeni. Magaziwu ga lishaka limu gankuwatosha kwa lishaka ali.<verse eid="MAT 6:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7" />
  <para style="s">Kuwatoza wamonga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:37-42">Luka 6:37-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1" />“Namuwalunda wamonga, su namwiza na mwenga kulundwa na Mlungu. <verse eid="MAT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2" />Mlungu hakawalundi mwenga ntambu yamuwalunda wamonga, na shipimu shiraa shilii shamuwapimira wamonga, Mlungu hakakupimirani mwenga. <verse eid="MAT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3" />Iwera hashi gushiwona shibandu mlisu mwa mlongu gwaku na palaa panu guwona ndiri shipingiri shashiwera mlisu lyaku? <verse eid="MAT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4" />Ama guweza hashi kumgambira mlongu gwaku, ‘Mlongu, guleki nukuwusiyi shibandu mlisu mwaku,’ na gumweni gwenga gwanashi shipingiri mlisu mwaku? <verse eid="MAT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5" />Gwamfyangu gwenga! Guwusii huti shipingiri shashiwera mlisu mwaku, shakapanu haguwezi kushiwona weri na kushiwusiya shibandu shashiweriti mulisu lya mlongu gwaku.<verse eid="MAT 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6" />“Namuwapanana wang'ang'a vintu vinanagala, hawizi kuwagalambukira na kuwakwalambula. Namwawasangira wamtumbi lulu zyenu hawizi kuzitimbanga.<verse eid="MAT 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Guluwi na gusakuli na gutendi hodi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 11:9-13">Luka 11:9-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7" />“Mluwi na mwenga hampati, msakuli na mwenga hamwoni na mtendi hodi, namwenga hamvugulirwi. <verse eid="MAT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8" />Toziya, yoseri yakaluwa hakapati na yoseri yakasakula hakawoni na ligomi livugulwa kwa kila muntu yakatenda hodi. <verse eid="MAT 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9" />Hashi, kwana muntu yoseri mwana pakamluwa tati gwakuwi libumunda, hakampanani libuwi? <verse eid="MAT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10" />Ama pakamluwa somba, hakampanani njoka? <verse eid="MAT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11" />Handa mwenga yamuwera wadoda, muvimana kuwapanana vintu viherepa wana wenu. Nakaka Tati gwenu gwa kumpindi hakatendi nentu, hakawapanani viheri kwa walii yawamluwa!<verse eid="MAT 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12" />“Muwatenderi wantu ntambu yamfira kutenderuwa, aga ndo mafundu ga Malagaliru ga Musa na mafundu ga wambuyi wa Mlungu.<verse eid="MAT 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">ligomi libabanika</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 13:24">Luka 13:24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13" />“Mwingiri kwa kupitira ligomi libabanika, toziya ligomi lyalilonguziya muwuharabisiya ndo likulu na njira yailonguziya kulaa aku ndo yalaisi na kwana wantu wavuwa yawaigendera njira ayi. <verse eid="MAT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14" />Kumbiti ligomi lya ukomu ndo libabanika na njira ya kugendera aku ndo ikamala na kwana wantu wadidini yawayiwona njira ayi.<verse eid="MAT 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mtera na mabwajubwaju yakuwi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:43-44">Luka 6:43-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15" />“Mlikali weri na wambuyi wa mpayu, womberi wiza kwa mwenga pawawoneka gambira kondolu kwa kunja, kumbiti mngati nakaka walifana na wang'ang'a wakalipa wa muntundu. <verse eid="MAT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16" />Hamuwamani womberi ntambu yawatenda. Mbigiri hapeni ileri mapera na miyembi hapeni ileri zyabibu. <verse eid="MAT 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17" />Su, mtera guherepa gulera mabwajubwaju maherepa na mtera gudoda gulera mabwajubwaju gadoda. <verse eid="MAT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18" />Mtera guherepa hapeni guleri mabwajubwaju gadoda, wala mtera gudoda hapeni guleri mabwajubwaju maherepa. <verse eid="MAT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19" />Na mtera gwoseri yagulera ndiri mabwajubwaju maherepa hawagudumuli na kugupambira pamotu. <verse eid="MAT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20" />Su hamuwamani wambuyi wa mpayu, ntambu yawatenda.”<verse eid="MAT 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nuwamana ndiri mwenga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 13:25-27">Luka 13:25-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21" />“Kila muntu ndiri yakanshema ‘Mtuwa, Mtuwa,’ hakingiri Muufalumi wa kumbindi, kumbiti woseri hera yawatenda ntambu yakafira Tati gwangu gwa kumpindi. <verse eid="MAT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22" />Lishaka lya kulundwa palisoka, wantu wavuwa hawang'ambiri, ‘Mtuwa, Mtuwa! Kwa litawu lyaku tubweriti ujumbi wa Mlungu, kwa litawu lyaku tuwusiyiti washamshera wavuwa na kutenda mauzauza gavuwa!’ <verse eid="MAT 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23" />Shakapanu hanuwagambiri womberi, ‘Nuwamana ndiri mwenga. Muwuki kwaneni, mwenga ndo wantu yamtenda vidoda!’<verse eid="MAT 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wanyawa numba wawili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:47-49">Luka 6:47-49</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24" />“Su, kila muntu yakapikanira visoweru vyangu na kuvitenda, kalifana na muntu kana luhala yakanyawa numba yakuwi pampindi pa litalawu. <verse eid="MAT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25" />Nvula itowa, nshemba zimema ng'enang'ena na liyega livuma kwa makakala liikoma numba ilii. Kumbiti iguwa ndiri toziya inyawitwi pampindi pa litalawu.<verse eid="MAT 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26" />“Kumbiti muntu yoseri yakapikanira visoweru vyangu avi pota na kuvijimira kalifana na muntu yakanyawa numba yakuwi pamuhanga. <verse eid="MAT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27" />Nvula itowa, nshemba zimema ng'enang'ena, lyega livuma kwa makakala na liikoma numba ilii na iguwa. Na kuguwa kwakuwi kuweriti kukulu!”<verse eid="MAT 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uwezu wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28" />Yesu pakamaliriti kutakula vitwatira avi, lipinga likulu lya wantu walikangashiti ntambu yakafunditi. <verse eid="MAT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:29" />Kaweriti ndiri gambira Mfunda gwa Malagaliru, kumbiti kafunditi kwa uwezu.<verse eid="MAT 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kankumponiziya muntu kana ugumbula</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mariku 1:40-45</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luka 5:12-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1" />Yesu pakaseleriti kulawa kuligongu, lipinga likulu lya wantu limfatiti. <verse eid="MAT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2" />Su, kiziti muntu yumu kana ungumbula, kamsuntamira Yesu na kutakula, “Mtuwa, pagufira, guweza kumpunga neni!”<verse eid="MAT 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3" />Yesu kanyosha liwoku lyakuwi na kamshinkula na kumgambira, “Nfira! Gupungwi.” Palaa palii muntu ulii kawera mkomu. <verse eid="MAT 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4" />Shakapanu Yesu kamgambira yomberi, “Gupikaniri! Nagumgambira muntu yoseri, kumbiti gugendi gwakalilanguziyi kwa mtambika gwa numba ya Mlungu, gulaviyi tambiku ntambu yakalagiliriti Musa su kila muntu kavimani handa gupona.”<verse eid="MAT 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankumponiziya ntumintumi gwa ofisa gwa Rumi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 7:1-10">Luka 7:1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5" />Yesu pakaweriti kankwingira lushi lwa Kafarinaumu, ofisa gwa Rumi kaliwoniti na yomberi na kaluwa utanga pakalonga, <verse eid="MAT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6" />“Mtuwa, ntumintumi gwangu kagonja kalwala, ulweri wa kuleweleka na kalwala nentu.”<verse eid="MAT 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7" />Yesu kamgambira, “Hanizi kumponiziya.” <verse eid="MAT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8" />Ofisa ulii kamwankula, “Ndala Mtuwa, gufiruwa ndiri gwingiri mnumba mwangu. Kumbiti gutakuli hera shisoweru na ntumintumi gwangu hakaponi. <verse eid="MAT 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9" />Toziya ata neni namuntu gwa pasi pa uwezu wa wamonga, nanawu wanjagila yanuwalagalira kutenda. Numulagalira yumu, ‘Gugendi!’ Na yomberi kagenda na panumlagalira yumonga, ‘Gwizi!’ Na yomberi kizaga na numulagalira ntumintumi gwangu, ‘Gutendi ashi!’ Na yomberi katendaga.”<verse eid="MAT 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10" />Yesu pakapikaniriti aga, kalikangashiti na kawagambira wantu yawamfatiti, “Nakaka nuwagambirani, numwoniti ndiri muntu yoseri mu Israeli yakawera na njimiru gambira muntu ayu. <verse eid="MAT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11" />Nukugambirani handa wantu wavua hawizi kulawa kwagulawa mushenji na kwaguzyeta mushenji na hawalivagi pamuwera na Aburahamu na Isaka na Yakobu pamsambu Muufalumi wa kumpindi. <verse eid="MAT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12" />Kumbiti walii yawafiruwitwi kuwera Muufalumi hawawasi muntiti, aku hawalili na kugayagaya menu.” <verse eid="MAT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13" />Shakapanu Yesu kamgambira ofisa ulii, “Gugendi ukaya na ntambu yagujimira haitendeki kwaku.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 8:13">Na ntumintumi gwa afisa ulii kaponiti shaka shilaa shilii.<verse eid="MAT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankuwaponiziya wantu wavuwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mariku 1:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luka 4:38-41</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14" />Yesu kafikiti ukaya kwa Peteru, kamwona mawu mganafu gwa Peteru kagonja mulisaga, kapyupa nentu. <verse eid="MAT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15" />Su, Yesu kamshinkula liwoku lyakuwi na kupyupa kumleka, kagoloka na kanjiti kumtendera.<verse eid="MAT 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16" />Payiweriti pamihi, wamjegeriti wantu wavuwa yawaweriti wabegiziwa na washamshera. Yesu kawawinga washamshera kwa kulonga shisoweru na kawaponiziya woseri yawaweriti wankulwala. <verse eid="MAT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17" />Katenditi hangu su galii gakatakuliti Isaya mbuyi gwa Mlungu gaweri nakaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 8:17">“Yomberi kawutola utepeku wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 8:17">Kagatola malweri getu.”<verse eid="MAT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wasagulitwi kuwera wantumintumi wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 9:57-62">Luka 9:57-62</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18" />Yesu pakawoniti shipinga sha wantu shimzyengeta, kawagambiriti wafundwa wakuwi waloki kumwambu kulitanda. <verse eid="MAT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19" />Mfunda gwa Malagaliru kamgendera, kamgambira, “Mfunda, neni nakala kugenda na gwenga koseri kwagugenda.”<verse eid="MAT 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20" />Yesu kamwankula, “Vibweta wana mpanga na wampongu wawera na vitukulu, kumbiti Mwana gwa Muntu kahera pahala pa kugonja na kwoyera.”<verse eid="MAT 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21" />Muntu yumonga yakaweriti mfundwa kamgambira, “Mtuwa, gundeki uti, ng'endi nukamsiri tati gwangu.”<verse eid="MAT 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22" />Yesu kamwankula, “Gunfati, guwaleki yawahowiti shirohu wawasiri yawahowiti shirohu wawu.”<verse eid="MAT 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankulikalipira lyega</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mariku 4:35-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luka 8:22-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23" />Yesu kakweniti muuwatu na wafundwa wakuwi wagenditi pamuhera nayomberi. <verse eid="MAT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24" />Pala palii lihega lyana likakala lilawira mulitanda na mankapala ganja kugubikira uwatu. Yesu mweni kaweriti kankugonja mpota. <verse eid="MAT 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25" />Wafundwa wamgendera na wamwimusiya pawatakula, “Mtuwa, gutulopoziyi twankuhowa!”<verse eid="MAT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26" />Yesu kawagambira, “Iwera hashi mwana lyoga? Hee mwawantu mwenga mwana njimiru ndidini!” Su, kagoloka na kalikalapira lyega na mankapala ga litanda ganyamala na kuweriti na kunyamalira kukulu.<verse eid="MAT 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27" />Kila muntu kalikangasha. Womberi walonga “Ata lyega na mankapala ga mashi gamjimira!”<verse eid="MAT 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankuwaponiziya wantu wawili yawawera na washamshera</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mariku 5:1-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luka 8:26-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28" />Yesu pakasokiti lushi lwa Gadara, kumwambu kulitanda, kaliwoniti na wantu wawili yawalawiti mumapumba ga mpanga. Wantu awa waweriti na washamshera na waweriti wankutiluwa na wantu na kwahera muntu yakaweza kugenda munjira ilii. <verse eid="MAT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29" />Su womberi wabotanga, “Hashi, Gufira shishi kwa twenga, gwenga Mwana gwa Mlungu? Hashi, gwiza kutubeziya pamberi pa shaka shetu?”<verse eid="MAT 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30" />Pakwegera na pahala palii, kuweriti na lipinga likulu lya wamtumbi wankulolelua. <verse eid="MAT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31" />Su, washamshera wamluwa Yesu, “Handa pagutulaviya, su gutujimiliri tuwaingiri wamtumbi walii.”<verse eid="MAT 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32" />Yesu kawagambira, “Mgendi!” Su wawalawa wantu awa na wawingira wamtumbi. Lipinga lyoseri lya wamtumbi liseleriti paluseleru lukalipa na lilidiba mumashi.<verse eid="MAT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33" />Walolera wa wamtumbi watugiti na wagenditi mlushi, kulii watakuliti vitwatira vyoseri na ntambu yavirawiriti kwa wantu yawaweriti na washamshera. <verse eid="MAT 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34" />Su, wantu woseri walawiti mlushi lulii na wagenditi kuliwona na Yesu na pawamwoniti Yesu, waluwa kawuki muisi yawu.<verse eid="MAT 8:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kankumponiziya muntu yakalewelekiti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mariku 2:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luka 5:17-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1" />Yesu kakweniti muuwatu na kalokiti litanda na kuwuya mlushi lwakuwi. <verse eid="MAT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2" />Wantu wamu wamjegiti muntu yakalewelekiti nshimba, wamgonjeka mulisaga. Yesu pakawoniti njimiru yawu, kamgambira muntu yakalewelekiti, “Naguwera na lyoga mwana gwangu! Gulegiziwa vidoda vyagutenditi.”<verse eid="MAT 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3" />Wafunda wamu wa Malagaliru wanja kulitakulira weni, “Muntu ayu kankumwigilanga Mlungu!”<verse eid="MAT 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4" />Yesu kagamaniti maholu gawu, su kawagambira, “Iwera hashi mwankulihola vitwatira vidoda? <verse eid="MAT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5" />Hashi, shizotopa ng'anji shii, ‘Kutakula vidoda vyagutenditi vilekiziwa,’ ama kutakula, ‘Gugoloki na gugendigendi’? <verse eid="MAT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6" />Hanuwalanguziyi kuwera Mwana gwa Muntu kana uwezu pasipanu wa kuwalekeziya wantu vidoda vyawatenda.” Su kamgambira muntu yakalewelekiti, “Gugoloki, gutoli lisaga lyaku na gugendi ukaya kwaku.”<verse eid="MAT 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7" />Muntu yakalewelekiti kagoloka na kagenda ukaya kwakuwi. <verse eid="MAT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8" />Lipinga lya wantu pawawoniti vitwatira vyavilawiliti, walikangashiti na wamkwisiti Mlungu yakawayupiti wantu uwezu wa ntambu ayi.<verse eid="MAT 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankumshema Matayu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mariku 2:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luka 5:27-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9" />Yesu kawukiti pahala paliya, na pakaweriti kankugendagenda, kamwoniti mtola kodi yawamshema Matayu, kalivaga palihengu lyakuwi. Yesu kamgambira, “Gunfati.” Matayu kagoloka na kamfata.<verse eid="MAT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10" />Yesu pakaweriti ukaya kwa Matayu kankuliya shiboga, watola kodi wavuwa na watenda vidoda wiziti kuliya shiboga pamuhera na Yesu na wafundwa wakuwi. <verse eid="MAT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11" />Mafalisayu wamu pawawoniti aga, wawakosiya wafundwa wakuwi, “Iwera hashi mfunda gwenu kankuliya shiboga pamuhera na watola kodi na yawatenda vidoda?”<verse eid="MAT 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12" />Yesu kawapikaniriti na kawankula, “Wantu wakomu wamfira ndiri mganga, kumbiti walweli hera ndo wamfira mganga. <verse eid="MAT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13" />Mlungu kalonga, Mgendi mwakalifundi Lilembu ali linanagala lyana mana gaa, ‘Neni ntakula nfira lusungu, nfira ndiri tambiku.’ Niza ndiri kuwashema wantu yawalihola wankumfiriziya Mlungu, kumbiti yawatenda vidoda.”<verse eid="MAT 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Likosiwu kuusu kuleka kuliya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mariku 2:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luka 5:33-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14" />Shakapanu wantumintumi wa Yohani Mbatiza wamgenderiti Yesu, wamkosiya, “Iwera hashi, twenga pamuhera na Mafalisayu tuleka kuliya, kumbiti wafundwa waku waleka ndiri kuliya shiboga?”<verse eid="MAT 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15" />Yesu kawankula, “Hashi, mulihola kuwera wahenga pawawera mumsambu gwa ndowa wahinginika pawawera na mpalu gwa ndowa? Nakaka hapeni wahinginiki! Kumbiti lishaka lyankwiza pawamuwusiya mpalu gwa ndowa, ndo womberi hawaleki kuliya.<verse eid="MAT 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16" />“Kwahera muntu yakasona shiraka sha nguwu ya syayi munguwu ngona toziya shiraka ashi hashidegi nguwu ngona na padegekiti palii hapongereki. <verse eid="MAT 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17" />Ama kwahera muntu yoseri yakaweza kulekera divayi ya syayi mumihaku ya lukuli lugona, pakatenda hangu mihaku igona haipantiki na divayi hayitiki. Kumbiti divayi ya syayi ilekerwa mumihaku ya lukuli ya syayi na vyoseri havitulwi weri.”<verse eid="MAT 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muhinga gwa afisa na mdala yakashinkuliti nguwu ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mariku 5:21-43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luka 8:40-56</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18" />Yesu pakaweriti kankutakula aga, ofisa gwa Shiyawudi kamwiziriti, kamsuntamalira na kamgambira, “Muhinga gwangu kahowa vinuvinu, kumbiti shondi shondi, gwizi gumtuliri liwoku lyaku nayomberi hakaweri mkomu.”<verse eid="MAT 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19" />Yesu kawuka pamuhera na wafundwa wakuwi, wamfatiti ofisa.<verse eid="MAT 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20" />Mdala yakaweriti mlweri gwa kusuma mwazi kwa mivinja lilongu na mbili, kamwiziriti Yesu kumbeli na kuyishinkula nguwu yakuwi. <verse eid="MAT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:21" />Kalihola mumoyu mwakuwi, “Handa panshinkula nguwu, haweri mkomu.”<verse eid="MAT 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22" />Su, Yesu kagalambuka kamwona, kamgambira, “Mhinga gwangu, nagwana lyoga! Njimiru yaku ikuponiziya.” Pala palii mdala ulii kapona kusuma mwazi.<verse eid="MAT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23" />Shakapanu Yesu kingira mnumba mwa ofisa ulii. Pakawawoniti wagomba luperembi lwa kudaya na wantu wavua wankudaya, <verse eid="MAT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24" />kalonga, “Kila muntu kalawi kunja! Muhinga ayu kahowa ndiri, kumbiti kagonja hera!” Womberi wamseka Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25" />Su, pawawawusiyiti wantu kulawa kunja, Yesu kingiriti mnumba kwa muhinga yakahowiti na kamkola liwoku lyakuwi na yomberi kagoloka. <verse eid="MAT 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26" />Vitwatila avi vieniyiti pa isi yoseri ilii.<verse eid="MAT 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankuwaponiziya wanalwisi wawili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27" />Yesu kawukiti pahala paliya na pakaweriti kankugendagenda, wanalwisi wawili wanjiti kumfata. Womberi wabotanga, “Gutuwoneri lusungu Mwana gwa Dawudi!”<verse eid="MAT 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28" />Yesu pakingiriti mnumba, wanalwisi wawili wamgendera, nayomberi kawakosiya, “Hashi, mjimira handa neni nana uwezu wa kuwaponiziya?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 9:28">Womberi wamwankula, “Yina mtuwa!”<verse eid="MAT 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29" />Shakapanu Yesu kagashinkula masu gawu, kalonga, “Na iweri kwa mwenga ntambu yamjimira!” <verse eid="MAT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30" />Na masu gawu gawera makomu. Su Yesu kawalagalira, “Namumgambira muntu yoseri shitwatila ashi!”<verse eid="MAT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31" />Kumbiti womberi wawuka na wabwera visoweru vya Yesu pa isi ilii yoseri.<verse eid="MAT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankumponiziya bebi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32" />Wantu pawaweriti wankugenda zawu, wantu wamonga wamjegera Yesu muntu yakaweriti bebi toziya kaweriti na washamshera. <verse eid="MAT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33" />Katepu hera shamshera pawamlaviyiti, muntu ulii kanja kutakula. Wantu woseri walikangashiti nentu pawalonga, “Hatweni woni shitwatila gambira ashi mu Israeli!”<verse eid="MAT 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34" />Kumbiti Mafalisayu walonga, “Mkulu gwa washamshera ndo yakamupiti Yesu likakala lya kuwalaviya washamshera.”<verse eid="MAT 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankuwawonera lusungu wantu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35" />Yesu katyangiriti lushi zoseri na vijiji vyoseri. Kafunditi munumba za Mlungu, na kabweriti Shisoweru Shiwagira sha Ufalumi wa Mlungu, na kuwaponiziya wantu malweri ga ntambu zoseri. <verse eid="MAT 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36" />Su, pakawawoniti vipinga vipinga vya wantu, moyu gwakuwi gumemiti lusungu, toziya waweriti watoka na wanalyoga gambira kondolu wahera mlolera. <verse eid="MAT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37" />Su kawagambira wafundwa wakuwi, “Mabenu gavuwa, kumbiti watenda lihengu lya kubena wavua ndiri. <verse eid="MAT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38" />Su, mumluwi yakana mabenu hakajegi watenda lihengu wabeni viboga vyakuwi.”<verse eid="MAT 9:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10" />
  <para style="s">Wantumintumi lilongu na mbili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mariku 3:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luka 6:12-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1" />Yesu kawashemiti wafundwa wakuwi lilongu na mbili, kawapanana uwezu wa kuwalaviya washamshera na kuwaponiziya wantu malweri na kila ulweri. <verse eid="MAT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2" />Aga ndo matawu gawu wantumintumi lilongu na mbili. Gwa kwanja ndo Simoni yawamshemiti Peteru na mlongu gwakuwi Andereya, Yakobu na mlongu gwakuwi Yohani wana wa Zebedayu, <verse eid="MAT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3" />Filipu na Baritulumayu, Tomasi na Matayu yakaweriti mtola kodi, Yakobu mwana gwa Alifayu na Tadeyi, <verse eid="MAT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4" />Simoni Mkanani na Yuda Isikariyoti, ndo mweni yakamgalambukiti Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankuwalagalira wantumintumi lilongu na mbili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mariku 6:7-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luka 9:1-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5" />Yesu kawatumiti awa lilongu na wawili na kawapananiti malagaliru aga, “Namgenda kwa wantu wa isi zimonga, ama namwingira pakati pa lushi lwa Wasamariya. <verse eid="MAT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6" />Kumbiti mgendi kwa wantu wa Israeli yawagamiliti gambira kondolu. <verse eid="MAT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7" />Mgendi na mbweri, ‘Ufalumi wa kumpindi wapakwegera.’ <verse eid="MAT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8" />Mponiziyi walweli, muwazyukisiyi yawahowiti, muwapungi woseri yawalwala ugumbula na muwawusiyi washamshera. Wawapanana hera, su mwenga mtendi pota kuluwa shibena mgongu. <verse eid="MAT 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9" />Namtola zahabu, ama mpiya, ama magwala ga shaba mumihaku mwenu, <verse eid="MAT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10" />namtola muhaku gwa kuluwira munjira, ama likoti lyamonga, ama vilwatu, ama luhonga. Toziya watendalihengu wafiruwa wapati vyawafira.<verse eid="MAT 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11" />“Pamwingira pakati pa lushi loseri ama shijiji, msakuli amu muntu yoseri yakafira kuwashemera na mlikali pamuhera nayomberi mpaka pamwuka pahala palii. <verse eid="MAT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12" />Pamwingira mnumba mtakuli, ‘Ponga iweri na mwenga.’ <verse eid="MAT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13" />Handa wenikaya wa numba ilii wawashemerani, su ponga ya kulamsiya kwa mwenga haikali, kumbiti wafira ndiri kuwashemera, kulamsiya kwenu kwa ponga hakukuwuyirani maweni. <verse eid="MAT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14" />Handa numba yoseri ama lushi loseri halulemi kuwashemera mwenga ama kuwapikinira mwenga, su muwuki pahala paliya na mupunti lidiku mumagulu mwenu. <verse eid="MAT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15" />Nuwagambirani nakaka handa lishaka lya kutozwa, Mlungu hakawawoneri lusungu wantu wa Sodoma na Gomora kuliku wantu wa lushi alu!”<verse eid="MAT 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ubaya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:9-13">Mariku 13:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:12-17">Luka 21:12-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16" />“Mpikaniri! Neni nuwalagalira mwenga gambira kondolu kugenda pakati pa wamaminyi. Muweri na luhala gambira njoka na mwawananaga gambira ng'unda. <verse eid="MAT 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17" />Mlikali weri, toziya wantu hawawawingani mwenga na hawawajegeni mushyotera motu na hawawasyatangi ntomondu munumba za Mlungu. <verse eid="MAT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18" />Toziya ya neni hamjegwi palongolu pa wakolamlima na wafalumi, mpati kuwagambira Visoweru Viwagira na kuwagambira wantu wa isi zimonga. <verse eid="MAT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19" />Su, pawawajegani mwenga pashyotera motu, namuwera na lyoga handa hamtakuli shishi ama hamlongi hashi, shaka pashisoka, hampati sha kuyowera. <verse eid="MAT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20" />Toziya visoweru vyamgenda kuyowera vya mwenga ndiri, kumbiti havizi kulawa kwa Rohu gwa Tati gwenu yakatakula kupitila mwenga.<verse eid="MAT 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21" />“Mlongu hakamgalambuki mlongu gwakuwi kalagwi na tati hakamgalambuki mwana gwakuwi na wana hawawatenduwi walera wawu na kuwalaga. <verse eid="MAT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22" />Wantu woseri hawawakalalireni mwenga toziya ya litawu lyaneni. Kumbiti ulii yakahepelera mpaka upeleru, ndo hakalopoziwi <verse eid="MAT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23" />Wantu pawawapunja pakati pa lushi lumu, mtugili lushi lumonga. Nuwagambirani nakaka, hapeni mumalili lihengu lyenu mulushi zoseri za israeli pamberi pa kwiza Mwana gwa Muntu.<verse eid="MAT 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24" />“Kwahera mfundwa yakawera mkulu kuliku mfunda gwakuwi, ama ntumintumi kuwera mkulu kuliku mtuwa gwakuwi. <verse eid="MAT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25" />Itosha kwa mfundwa kuwera gambira mfunda gwakuwi na ntumintumi kuwera gambira mtuwa gwakuwi. Payiwera mtuwa gwa kaya wamshema Belizebuli, su wenikaya hawashemwi ata matawu gadoda nentu!”<verse eid="MAT 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakafiruwa kutiluwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 12:2-7">Luka 12:2-7</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26" />“Su, namuwatira wantu. Shoseri shashigubikitwi hashigubutulwi, na shashiwera muubada, hashimaniki. <verse eid="MAT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27" />Shanuwagambirani mwenga muluwindu, mpaka mushitakuli muulangala, na shilii shampikinira muubada mfiruwa gushibwera pampindi pa shitwiku. <verse eid="MAT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28" />Namuwatira woseri yawalaga nshimba, kumbiti waweza ndiri kuilaga rohu, mbaka nentu mumtiri Mlungu yakaweza kulaga vyoseri nshimba pamuhera na rohu mumotu gwa Jehanamu. <verse eid="MAT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29" />Wampongu wawili wawawuza kwa ligwala limu, kumbiti ata yumu gwawu hapeni katuluki pasi pota kufira Tati gwenu. <verse eid="MAT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30" />Kumbiti kwa mwenga, ata viri zya mumituwi yenu zoseri ziwalangua kala. <verse eid="MAT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31" />Su namtira, mwenga mwana mana nentu kuliku wampongu wavua!”<verse eid="MAT 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kujimira na kumlema Kristu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 12:8-9">Luka 12:8-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32" />“Wantu woseri yawanjimira paweru handa waneni, hantendi viraa avi kulongolu kwa Tati ka kumpindi. <verse eid="MAT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33" />Kumbiti yoseri yakanema neni palongolu pa wantu, naneni hanumlemi kulongolu kwa Tati gwangu gwa kumpindi.<verse eid="MAT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulekana</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 12:51-53">Luka 12:51-53</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:26-27">Luka 14:26-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34" />“Namulihola kuwera niza kujega ponga pasipanu. Ndala, niza ndiri kujega ponga, kumbiti ligomi. <verse eid="MAT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35" />Niziti kuwatenda wana wawagalambuki watati wawu, wahinga wawagalambuki wamawu wawu, wanahonga wawagalambuki wamawu nahonga wawu, <verse eid="MAT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36" />na wangondu wa muntu ndo wantu wa kaya yaku mweni.<verse eid="MAT 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37" />“Walii yawamfira tati gwawu ama mawu gwawu kuliku neni, hapeni waweri wafundwa waneni, walii yawawafira wantemba wawu ama wahinga wawu kuliku neni hapeni waweri wafundwa wangu. <verse eid="MAT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38" />Muntu yakatola ndiri lupingika lwakuwi na kunfata neni, hapeni kaweri mfundwa gwangu. <verse eid="MAT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39" />Woseri yawagabatilira makaliru gawu, hagawahowiziyi, kumbiti woseri yawagahoziya makaliru gawu toziya yaneni, hawagalopoziyi.<verse eid="MAT 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lifupu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:41">Mariku 9:41</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40" />“Yoseri yakawashemerani, kashemera neni na yakanshemera neni, kamshemera ulii yakamtumiti. <verse eid="MAT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41" />Yakamshemera mbuyi gwa Mlungu toziya ndo mbuyi gwa Mlungu, hakanki lifupu lya mbuyi gwa Mlungu. Na yakamshemera muntu muheri toziya ndo muntu muheri, hakanki lifupu lya muntu muheri. <verse eid="MAT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42" />Nuwagambirani nakaka, yoseri yakampanana yumu gwawu gwa wadidika awa yawanfata neni lwindi lwa mashi gazizimira toziya ndo mfundwa gwa neni, nakaka hakapati lifupu lyakuwi.”<verse eid="MAT 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11" />
  <para style="s">Wajumbi kulawa kwa Yohani Mbatiza</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 7:18-35">Luka 7:18-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1" />Yesu pakamalaliti kuwalagalira wafundwa lilongu na mbili, kawukiti pahala paliya na kagenditi kufunda na kubwera lushi zya pakwegera palii.<verse eid="MAT 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2" />Yohani Mbatiza pakapikaniriti vitwatira vya Kristu vyakatenda, yomberi kawatumiti wafundwa wakuwi kwa Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3" />Womberi wamkosiya Yesu, “Hashi, gutugambiri gwenga gwa yumu yakatakulitwi na Yohani, ama tumuheperi gwingi?”<verse eid="MAT 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4" />Yesu kawankula, “Mgendi mwakamgambiri Yohani vitwatira vyampikinira na kuviwona, <verse eid="MAT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5" />wanalwisi wawona na wavibyeketu wagendagenda, woseri yawalwala ungumbula wapungwa na wanamajogu wapikanira na wahowiti wankuzyukisiwa na Visoweru Viwagira vibwelwa kwa wahushu. <verse eid="MAT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6" />Mbaka kwa wantu woseri yawawera ndiri na lyoga na neni!”<verse eid="MAT 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7" />Wafundwa wa Yohani pawawukiti, Yesu kanjiti kuwagambira lipinga lya wantu, “Hashi, pamgenditi kumlola Yohani kushiwala, mgenditi kulola shishi? Visoweru vya Yohani, mgenditi kulola shishi? Hashi mgenditi kulola lyega lyankutikisiya luhamba? <verse eid="MAT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8" />Su, mgenditi kulola shishi? Mgenditi kumlola muntu yakavaliti nguwu iherepa? Wantu yawavala nguwu ziherepa walikala munumba zya wafalumi! <verse eid="MAT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9" />Mung'ambiri, mgenditi kulola shishi? Mgenditi kumlola mbuyi gwa Mlungu? Yina nakaka, kumbiti mwona vitwatira vivuwa kuliku mbuyi gwa Mlungu. <verse eid="MAT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10" />Yohani ndo yumu yawamlembiti Mumalembu mananagala, ‘Mlungu kalonga, hanumtumi mjumbi gwangu hakakulonguleri na kukunyawira njira.’ <verse eid="MAT 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11" />Nukugambirani nakaka handa Yohani Mbatiza ndo mkulu kuliku muntu yoseri yakalikala. Kumbiti muntu yakawera mdidini Muufalumi wa kumpindi ndo mkulu kuliku Yohani. <verse eid="MAT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12" />Kwanjira shaka Yohani Mbatiza pakabweriti ujumbi wakuwi mpaka leru, ufalumi wa kumpindi wantu wankwingira kwa makakala na wantu yawawera na makakala ndo hawawingiri. <verse eid="MAT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13" />Mpaka shaka sha Yohani, wambuyi woseri wa Mlungu na Malagaliru ga Musa galembwa kuusu Ufalumi. <verse eid="MAT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14" />Handa pamuweza kujimira ujumbi wawu, Yohani ndo Eliya mekizi. <verse eid="MAT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15" />Yakana makutu su kapikaniri!<verse eid="MAT 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16" />“Su, nuwafananiziyi na shishi wantu wa mashaka aga? Walifana gambira wana yawalikala pahala pa soku. Wawera pawaligambiziyana na shipinga shimonga. <verse eid="MAT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17" />Tuwagombirani msambu gwa ndowa, kumbiti mviniti ndiri! Twimba lwimbu lwa kudaya, kumbiti mlira ndiri. <verse eid="MAT 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18" />Yohani pakiziti, koya kuliya na kalanda ndiri divayi na kila muntu kalonga, ‘Yomberi kana shamshera!’ <verse eid="MAT 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19" />Mwana gwa Muntu pakiziti, kaliya na kalanditi divayi na kila muntu katakuliti, ‘Mumloli muntu ayu! Kana lwaliya na mlowera na ndo ganja gwa watola kodi na yawawera na vidoda!’ Luhala lwa Mlungu lwankulanguziya kuwera iherepa kulawirana na gakatendaga.”<verse eid="MAT 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lushi zazijimira ndiri</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 10:13-15">Luka 10:13-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20" />Shakapanu Yesu kanjiti kuzilawumu lushi zakatenditi mauzauza guvuwa, wantu wakuwi wafira ndiri kugalambuka kulawa muvidoda vyawatenda. <verse eid="MAT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21" />“Shondi Kolazini! Shondi Betisayida! Handa mauzauza aga yagatendikiti kwaku megatendikiti Tiru na Sidoni, wantu wakuwi mewavali kala malobota na kulipakaziya livu, kulilanguziya kuwera waleka vidoda vyawatenda. <verse eid="MAT 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22" />Nukugambirani nakaka kuwera mulishaka lya Mlungu lya kutozwa, hakawawoneri lusungu nentu wantu wa lushi lwa Tiru na Sidoni kuliku mwenga. <verse eid="MAT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23" />Nagwenga Kafarinaumu! Hashi, gufira kulikweniziya gumweni kumpindi kwa Mlungu? Hawakusulusiyi mpaka mulirindi lyalihera upeleru! Handa mauzauza yagatendikiti kwa gwenga, megatendeki ku Sodoma, lushi alu meluweri mpaka leru! <verse eid="MAT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24" />Nukugambirani kuwera mulishaka lya kutozwa Mlungu hakawawoneri lusungu nentu wantu wa Sodoma kuliku mwenga!”<verse eid="MAT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwizi kwa Neni mwoyeri</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 10:21-22">Luka 10:21-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25" />Shaka shilii Yesu katakuliti, “Tati, Mtuwa gwa kumpindi na pasi panu! Mayagashii toziya guwalanguziya wadidika vitwatira vyaguwafifiti yawawera na luhala na yawawera na mahala. <verse eid="MAT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26" />Yina Tati, hangu ndo ntambu yagufiriti vilawiri.<verse eid="MAT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27" />“Tati gwangu kanupa vintu vyoseri. Kwahera yakammana Mwana ira Tati na kwahera yakammana Tati ira Mwana na goseri galii gakafira kumgambira Mwana, su kamgambira.<verse eid="MAT 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28" />“Mwizi kwaneni woseri mwenga yamtokiti kupapa visanka vizotopa na neni hanuwatendi moyeri. <verse eid="MAT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29" />Mjimili vilii vyanuwapanani mwenga na mulifundi kulawa kwaneni, toziya neni namupoli na mnanagala mu rohu na mwenga hamwoyeri. <verse eid="MAT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:30" />Toziya shilii shanuwalagaliriti ndo shiherepa kwa mwenga na shanuwapanani mpapi ndo shizotopa ndiri.”<verse eid="MAT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12" />
  <para style="s">Likosiwu kuusu lishaka lya Kwoyera</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mariku 2:23-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luka 6:1-5</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1" />Shaka shilii Yesu kaweriti kankugendagenda kupitira mumalambu ga nganu lishaka lya Kwoyera. Wafundwa wakuwi waweriti na njala, su wanjiti kubenanga mikunguwi ya nganu na waliya mpunji. <verse eid="MAT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2" />Mafalisayu pawawoniti hangu, wamgambira Yesu, “Guloli, wafundwa waku watenda shitwatira ashi shashibeliritwi kushitenda mulishaka lya Kwoyera.”<verse eid="MAT 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3" />Yesu kawankula, “Hashi, mwenibetuli ntambu yakatenditi Dawudi pamuhera na wayaguwi pawaweriti na njala? <verse eid="MAT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4" />Yomberi kingiriti Mnumba ya Mlungu pamuhera na wayaguwi waliya mabumunda gawamtambikiriti Mlungu, ata hangu ileweleritwi mu Lilagaliru kwa womberi kuliya mabumunda galii, ira watambika wa Numba ya Mlungu gweka yawu wafiruwa kugaliya. <verse eid="MAT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5" />Ama mwenibetuli Mumalagaliru ga Musa kuwera kila lishaka lya kwoyera, wakulu wa Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu watenda ndiri malagaliru ga kwoyera, kumbiti walihola ndiri kuwera watenda kosa? <verse eid="MAT 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6" />Nukugambirani mwenga kuwera panu kwana mkulu kuliku Numba nkulu ya Mlungu. <verse eid="MAT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7" />Malembu mananagala galembwa, ‘Nfira lusungu na nfira ndiri tambiku.’ Handa muvimana nakaka kuwera mana ya visoweru avi, mekawatozi ndiri wantu yawahera likosa, <verse eid="MAT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8" />su Mwana gwa Muntu ndo Mtuwa gwa lishaka lya kwoyera”<verse eid="MAT 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muntu yakana liwoku lyalilewelekiti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mariku 3:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luka 6:6-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9" />Yesu kawukiti palii na kagenditi kwingira munumba ya Mlungu. <verse eid="MAT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10" />Kuweriti na muntu yakaweriti na liwoku lyalilewelekiti. Su wantu wamkosiyiti Yesu, “Hashi, iherepa kumponiziya muntu mulishaka lya Kwoyera?” Womberi wamkosiyiti hangu su wapati kumsitaki.<verse eid="MAT 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11" />Yesu kawankula, “Handa kwana yumu gwenu kana kondolu na kaguwiriti mulirindi mulishaka lya Kwoyera? Hashi, hakamkoli ndiri na kumlaviya?” <verse eid="MAT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12" />Na muntu kana mana nentu kuliku kondolu! Su Lilagaliru lyetu litulekeziya kutenda gaherepa mulishaka lya kwoyera. <verse eid="MAT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13" />Shakapanu Yesu kamgambira muntu ulii yakalewelekiti liwoku, “Gutalipisiyi liwoku lyaku.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 12:13">Yomberi katalipisiya liwoku na liwera likomu gambira liwoku limonga. <verse eid="MAT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14" />Su Mafalisayu walawa kunja na waligambiziyana ntambu ya kumlaga Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ntumini yakasyagulitwi na Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15" />Yesu pakapikaniriti shitwatira shilii, kawuka pahala paliya na lipinga likulu lya wantu limgenderiti. Kawaponiziya woseri yawaweriti walweli, <verse eid="MAT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16" />na kawalewelera nawamgambira muntu yoseri kuusu mweni. <verse eid="MAT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17" />Katenditi aga su katendi galii gakatakuliti Isaya mbuyi gwa Mlungu gaweri ganakaka,<verse eid="MAT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18" />“Ayu ndo ntumintumi gwangu, yanumsyaguriti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:18">Yumu yanumfira na kupitira mweni ndo nherepeziwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:18">Hanumjegi Rohu gwangu kwakuwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:18">Na hambweri utoza wangu kwa isi zimonga.<verse eid="MAT 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19" />Hapeni kaweri na ukakatala, ama kubotanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:19">Ama liziwu lyakuwi kupikana mu mitaa.<verse eid="MAT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20" />Hapeni kalumegi ludenki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:20">Ama lutambi lutuma lyosi hapeni kaluzimi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:20">Mpaka kavitendi vilii vyavimfiriziya Mlungu vitendi lihengu,<verse eid="MAT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21" />Na kupitira yomberi wantu woseri hawaweri na litumbiru.”<verse eid="MAT 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na mkulu gwa washamshera</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 3:20-30">Mariku 3:20-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luka 11:14-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22" />Shakapanu wantu wamu wamjegiriti Yesu muntu yakaweriti kana lwisi viraa bebi toziya kaweriti na shamshera. Yesu kamuponiziyiti muntu ulii, su kaweziti kutakula na kuwona. <verse eid="MAT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23" />Lipinga lya wantu lilikangasha ntambu yakatenditi Yesu. Womberi wakosiya, “Hashi, iwezekana ayu kuwera Mwana gwa Dawudi?”<verse eid="MAT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24" />Mafalisayu pawapikaniriti aga, wawankula, “Yomberi kawawinga washamshera hera toziya mkulu gwa washamshera Belizebuli kamupiti makakala kutenda hangu.”<verse eid="MAT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25" />Yesu kavimaniti galii gawalihola, su kawagambira, “Ufalumi woseri waupalanganikiti muvipinga vipinga na kulikomanga weni, hapeni ulikali shaka shitali. Na lushi lwoseri ama kaya yayipalanganika muvipinga vipinga na kulikomanga yeni haiguwi. <verse eid="MAT 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26" />Handa shipinga shimu pashilikomanga na shipinga shimonga muufalumi wa Shetani, toziya vipalanganika kala muvipinga na ufalumi awu hauguwi! <verse eid="MAT 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27" />Mwenga mlonga handa nuwawinga washamshera toziya Belizebuli kanupiti makakala ga kutenda hangu. Hashi, ndo gaa yakawapanani wafata wenu makakala ga kuwawinga washamshera? Su wafata wenu hawaweri watoza wenu! <verse eid="MAT 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28" />Kumbiti paiwera nankuwawinga washamshera kwa likakala lya Rohu gwa Mlungu, muvimana handa Ufalumi wa Mlungu usoka kala kwa mwenga.<verse eid="MAT 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29" />“Kwahera muntu yakaweza kwingira mnumba ya muntu kana likakala na kumpoka ulunda wakuwi, mpaka kamtawi huti muntu yakawera na likakala, shakapanu hakawezi kumpoka ulunda wakuwi.<verse eid="MAT 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30" />“Yoseri yakawera pamuhera ndiri na neni, kalekanira na neni na yoseri yakantyanga ndiri kujojinira ndo nakaka kankupalasiya. <verse eid="MAT 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31" />Na nuwagambirani kuwera wantu wankulekiziwa vidoda na vintu vidoda vyawatakula, kumbiti muntu yoseri yakamwigilanga Rohu Mnanagala hapeni kalekiziwi. <verse eid="MAT 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32" />Muntu yoseri yakamwigilanga Mwana gwa Muntu hakalekiziwi, kumbiti muntu yoseri yakamwigilanga Rohu Mnanagala hapeni kalekiziwi mashaka goseri.”<verse eid="MAT 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mtera na mabwajubwaju gakuwi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:43-45">Luka 6:43-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33" />“Mgutendi mtera guweri guherepa na mabwajubwaju gakuwi hagaherepi ama mgutendi mtera guweri gudoda na mabwajubwaju gakuwi hagaweri madoda toziya mtera gumanikana kulawirana na mabwajubwaju gakuwi. <verse eid="MAT 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34" />Mwenga ndo mleru gwa njoka! Muweza hashi kutakula vitwatira viheri shaka mwenga mwawadoda? Muntu katakula galii gamemiti mumoyu mwakuwi. <verse eid="MAT 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35" />Muntu muheri kalaviya vitwatira viheri kulawa mumoyu mwakuwi, kumbiti muntu mdoda kalaviya vitwatira vidoda mumoyu mwakuwi.<verse eid="MAT 12:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36" />“Su mwana unakaka kuwera mulishaka lya kutoza kila muntu hakawankuli kila shisoweru shakatakuliti. <verse eid="MAT 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37" />Visoweru vyaku havikutozi kuwera gumfiriziya Mlungu ama gwamuntu mdoda.”<verse eid="MAT 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kufira mauzauza kulawa kumpindi kwa Mlungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:11-12">Mariku 8:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29-32">Luka 11:29-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38" />Wafunda wamu wa Malagaliru na Mafalisayu wamu wamgambira Yesu, “Mfunda tufira gutulanguziyi mauzauza kulawa kumpindi kwa Mlungu.”<verse eid="MAT 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39" />Yesu kawankula, “Shiyiwuku shikondola na shashihera uwaminika kulongolu kwa Mlungu! Mfira mauzauza, kumbiti hapeni mpananwi liuzauza lyoseri lilii ira hampananwi liuzauza lya Yona mbuyi gwa Mlungu. <verse eid="MAT 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40" />Ntambu ira ayi Yona kalikaliti mashaka matatu paliwala na pashiru mumtima gwa somba, su Mwana gwa Muntu hakalikali vira mashaka matatu paliwala na pashiru mngati pasi pa isi. <verse eid="MAT 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41" />Mulishaka lya kutoza, wantu wa Ninawi hawagoloki pamuhera na shiyiwuku ashi na womberi hawashitozi. Toziya wantu wa Ninawi walekiti vidoda vyawatenditi pawampikaniriti Yona pakabwera, kumbiti panu kwana shitwatila shikulu kuliku Yona. <verse eid="MAT 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42" />Malikiya gwa kusika hakalawili shaka shiyiwuku ashi pashitozwa na yomberi hakashitozi. Toziya mweni kagenditi mwanja kulawa kutali, kiziti kuvipikinira visoweru vya luhala lwa mfalumi Selemani, kumbiti panu kwana mkulu kuliku Selemani!”<verse eid="MAT 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwuya kwa washamshera</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 11:24-26">Luka 11:24-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43" />“Shamshera pakamlawa muntu, kagenda kuyerayera kushiwala pakasakula pahala pa kwoyera. Handa pakapata ndiri, <verse eid="MAT 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:44" />hakalitakuziyi mweni, ‘Hambuyi mnumba mwangu mwandawiti.’ Su pakawuya na kwona numba yahera shintu na wayifyagira na kuherepeziwa. <verse eid="MAT 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45" />Shakapanu kagenda na kuwatola washamshera wamonga saba wadoda kuliku mweni na woseri wiza kumwingira muntu ayu. Su ntambu ya muntu ayu iwera idoda kuliku payiweriti kwanja. Ntambu ayi hayiwalawili wantu wa mashaka aga yawatenda vidoda.”<verse eid="MAT 12:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na walongu wakuwi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mariku 3:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luka 8:19-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46" />Yesu pakaweriti kankali kankuyowera na wantu, mawu na walongu wakuwi wasokiti. Wagolokiti kunja na waluwa kuyowera na yomberi. <verse eid="MAT 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47" />Su muntu yumu palii kamgambira Yesu, “Guloli, mawu gwaku na walongu waku wakunja wafira wayoweri na gwenga.”<verse eid="MAT 12:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48" />Yesu kawankula, “Hashi, mawu gwangu ndo gaa? Hashi, walongu wangu washina gaa?” <verse eid="MAT 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49" />Shakapanu kawalanguziya kwa liwoku lyakuwi wafundwa wakuwi na kulonga, “Mloli! Awa ndo mawu gwangu na walongu waneni! <verse eid="MAT 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50" />Muntu yoseri yakatenda vilii vyakafira Tati gwangu gwa kumpindi, ayu ndo mlongu gwangu na dada gwangu na mawu gwangu.”<verse eid="MAT 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13" />
  <para style="s">Mfanu gwa mkweta</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mariku 4:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luka 8:4-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1" />Lishaka liraa lilii Yesu kalawiti mnumba ilii na kugenda kumpeku kulitanda, su kalivaga kanja kufunda. <verse eid="MAT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2" />Lipinga likulu lya wantu limzingiti, su Yesu kakwena muuwatu na kalivaga na wantu waweriti wagolokiti pampeku pa litanda. <verse eid="MAT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3" />Yesu katakuliti kwa mifanu kuwagambira vitwatira vivuwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:3">“Kuweriti na muntu yakagenditi kukweta mbeyu. <verse eid="MAT 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4" />Pakaweriti kankukweta mbeyu mulirambu, mbeyu zimonga zitulukiriti munjira na wampongu wiziti na waziliya. <verse eid="MAT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5" />Zimonga zitulukiti palitalawu lyana litapaka lididini. Zimera kanongola toziya litapaka ligenditi pasi ndiri. <verse eid="MAT 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6" />Kumbiti mshenji paguwaliti gulunguziya vimeru vyavimeriti toziya mishigira yakuwi igenditi ndiri pasi, su vimeru viyuma. <verse eid="MAT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7" />Mbeyu zimonga zitulukiriti pa misontu, pazimera na kukula misontu izibabanika. <verse eid="MAT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8" />Kumbiti mbeyu zimonga zitulukiriti mulitapaka liherepa zimera na zikula na kulera mbeyu zivuwa zya zilii zawaziyaliti, zimonga mala miya na zimonga malongu sita na zimonga malongu matatu.”<verse eid="MAT 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9" />Na Yesu kamalalira kwa kulonga, “Yakana makutu kapikaniri!”<verse eid="MAT 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mana ya mifanu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mariku 4:10-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luka 8:9-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10" />Shakapanu wafundwa wamgenderiti Yesu na wamkosiya, “Iwera hashi gutakula kwa mifanu kwa wantu?”<verse eid="MAT 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11" />Yesu kawankula, “Mwenga mtelekerwa kuvimana vintu vya bada ya ufalumi wa kumpindi kumbiti womberi wavimana ndiri. <verse eid="MAT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12" />Kwa muntu yoseri yakawera na shintu hawamwongeri, kumbiti muntu yakahera shintu ata shilii shididini shakawera nashi hawampoki. <verse eid="MAT 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13" />Toziya ntakula nawomberi kwa mifanu ndo toziya waloli kumbiti hapeni wawoni na wapikaniri kumbiti hapeni werewi ama kuvimana. <verse eid="MAT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14" />Su gatimii galii gakatungiti Isaya mbuyi gwa Mlungu gatendeki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:14">‘Wantu awa hawapikiniri na kupikinira, kumbiti hapeni welewi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:14">Womberi hawaloli na kulola, kumbiti hapeni wawoni,<verse eid="MAT 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15" />Toziya mahala ga wantu awa gazizitika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">Waleka kupikanira mumakutu mwawu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">Wagonyiziya masu gawu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">Handa masu gawu megaloli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">Makutu gawu megapikiniri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">Mahala gawu megavimani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">Na womberi mewambuyiri neni, kalonga Mlungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">Na neni meniwaponiziyi.’”<verse eid="MAT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16" />Yesu katakula kayi, “Mbaka mwenga toziya masu genu gawona na makutu genu gapikanira. <verse eid="MAT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17" />Nuwagambirani kuwera wambuyi wavuwa wa Mlungu na wantu wavuwa waheri wafiriti nentu kuwona vilii vyamuviwona, kumbiti wasinda na kupikinira shilii shampikinira, kumbiti wasinda.”<verse eid="MAT 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankutakulira mana ya mfanu gwa mkweta</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Mariku 4:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luka 8:11-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18" />“Su mwenga mpikaniri mana ya mfanu agu gwa mkweta. <verse eid="MAT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19" />Wantu woseri yawapikanira ujumbi kuusu Ufalumi kumbiti werewa ndiri, walifana gambira mbeyu zyazitulukiriti panjira. Shetani kiza na kuwusiya shilii shawashikwetiti mumoyu mwawu. <verse eid="MAT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20" />Mbeyu zyazitulukiriti mumabuwi ndo wantu woseri yawauwanka ujumbi kwa nemeru pawaupikanira. <verse eid="MAT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21" />Kumbiti umwingira ndiri na kuwera na mshigira mngati mwakuwi na wendereya ndiri patali. Su ntabika na tabu paviza toziya ya ujumbi, womberi waleka palaa palii. <verse eid="MAT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22" />Mbeyu zyazitulukiriti mumitera ya misontu ndo wantu woseri yawaupikanira ujumbi, kumbiti lyoga kuusu makaliru gakuwi na zisitarehi za ulunda ubabanika ujumbi, na womberi hapeni waleri mabwajubwaju. <verse eid="MAT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23" />Na mbeyu zawazikwetiti mulitapaka lyana mbotu ndo wantu woseri yawaupikanira ujumbi na kwelewa, na ujumbi ulera zivuwa za zilii yawaziyaliti, wamonga walera miya na wamonga malongu sita na wamonga malongu matatu.”<verse eid="MAT 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfanu gwa magugu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24" />Yesu kawagambira wantu mfanu gwingi, Ufalumi wa kumpindi ulifana ntambu ayi. Muntu yumu kakwetiti mbeyu ziherepa mulirambu lyakuwi. <verse eid="MAT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25" />Pashiru pamu wantu pawagonjiti, mngondu gwakuwi kiziti na kukweta magugu pakati pa nganu na kagenda zakuwi. <verse eid="MAT 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26" />Shaka mbeyu za nganu pazimeriti na kwanja kupunda na magugu ganja kuwoneka. <verse eid="MAT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27" />Ntumintumi ulii yakawera na lirambu kamgendera na kumgambira, “Mtuwa gwenga gukwetiti mbeyu ziherepa mulirambu lyaku, hashi, vinu magugu aga galawa koshi?” <verse eid="MAT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28" />Yakana lirambu kawankula, “Mngondu ndo yakatenditi hangu. Wantumintumi wamkosiya, ‘Hashi, gufira tugendi twakagatupuli magugu?’ <verse eid="MAT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29" />Yomberi kawankula, ‘Ndala, toziya pamjonjonira magugu hamtupuli na nganu. <verse eid="MAT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30" />Mleki magugu na nganu gakuli pamuhera mpaka shaka sha kubenanga. Shakapanu hanuwagambiri watenda lihengu watupuli kwanja magugu na kugatawa mumatita na kugalunguziya. Kumbiti nganu muijojiniri na muituli muluhanja lwangu.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfanu gwa mbeyu ndidini nentu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mariku 4:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luka 13:18-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31" />Yesu kawagambira wantu mfanu gwingi, “Ufalumi wa kumpindi ulifana hangu. Muntu yumu katoliti mbeyu ndidini nentu na kagenditi kukweta mulirambu lyakuwi. <verse eid="MAT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32" />Mbeyu yeni iweriti ndidini nentu kuliku mbeyu zoseri, kumbiti payimeriti na kukula iwera mtera mkulu kuliku vyoseri vyavimeriti mulirambu mpaka wampongu wiza na kunyawa vitukulu vyawu mumitambi yakuwi.”<verse eid="MAT 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfanu gwa simika</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 13:20-21">Luka 13:20-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33" />Yesu kawagambira mfanu gwingi, “Ufalumi wa kumpindi ulifana hangu. Mdala yumu katoliti simika na kuhanganyiya pamuhera na vipimu vitatu vya ubumu, su ubumu woseri ututumuka.”<verse eid="MAT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutakula kwa mfanu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 13:20-21">Luka 13:20-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34" />Yesu kawagambiriti wantu goseri aga kwa mifanu. Kawagambira ndiri shintu shoseri pota kutakula mifanu, <verse eid="MAT 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35" />katenditi hangu su vyavitakulitwi na mbuyi gwa Mlungu vitendeki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:35">“Hantakuli kwa mfanu panyowera na womberi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:35">Hanuwagambiri vitwatira vyavimanika ndiri kwanjira kunyawa pasipanu.”<verse eid="MAT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankugutakula mfanu gwa magugu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36" />Yesu pakalilekiti lipinga lya wantu, kingira mnumba na wafundwa wakuwi wamgendera na wamkosiya, “Hashi, mfanu agu gutakula shishi?”<verse eid="MAT 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37" />Yesu kawankula, “Muntu yakakwetiti mbeyu ndo Mwana gwa Muntu, <verse eid="MAT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38" />na lirambu ndo pasipanu. Na mbeyu iherepa ndo wantu wa Ufalumi wa Mlungu. Magugu ndo wantu yawatenda vitwatira vya Shetani. <verse eid="MAT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39" />Mngondu yakakwetiti magugu ndo Shetani. Na shaka sha kubenanga ndo upeleru wa pasipanu na watenda lihengu ndo wantumintumi wa kumpindi wa Mlungu. <verse eid="MAT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40" />Magugu ntambu yawagajojinira na kugalunguziya pamotu, ndo ntambu hayilawiri kupelera kwa pasipanu. <verse eid="MAT 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41" />Mwana gwa Muntu hakawatumi wantumintumi wa kumpindi wakuwi kulawa Muufalumi wakuwi, woseri walii yawawatenda wantu watendi vidoda na wantu woseri yawatenda vitwatira vidoda, <verse eid="MAT 13:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42" />hawawawasili mumotu gwa Jehanamu na aku hawalili na kugaya menu. <verse eid="MAT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43" />Shapanu wantu yawamfiriziya Mlungu hawang'eleng'eti gambira mshenji Muufalumi wa Tati gwawu. Handa muwera na makutu, mpikaniri!<verse eid="MAT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44" />“Ufalumi wa kumpindi ulifana ntambu ayi. Muntu yumu kawoniti ulunda yaulififiti mulirambu. Su yomberi kanemeleriti nentu, kawufifiti kayi na kagenditi kuwuza vyoseri vyakawera navi na kawuyiti kuhemera lirambu lilii.”<verse eid="MAT 13:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfanu gwa Lulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45" />“Viraa, Ufalumi wa kumpindi ulifana hangu. Muntu yumu kaweriti kankusakula lulu iherepa, <verse eid="MAT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46" />na pakayiwoniti lulu yimu inamana nentu nkulu, kagenditi kuwuza vyoseri vyakaweriti navi na kuhemera lulu ilii.”<verse eid="MAT 13:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfanu gwa wavu wa kulowa somba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47" />“Viraa Ufalumi wa kumpindi ulifana hangu. Walowa wasomba wamu watandira wavu wawu mulitanda na walowa wasomba wa ntambu zoseri. <verse eid="MAT 13:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48" />Wavu pauweriti na wasomba nduu, wawunika pampeku pa litanda na kulivaga pasi kuwasyagula wasomba, wasomba waherepa wawatula mumajamanda gawu na wasomba wadoda wawasa. <verse eid="MAT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49" />Ntambu ayi hayiweri lishaka lya upeleru, shaka ashi wantumintumi wa kumpindi wa Mlungu hawawalaviyi wantu yawatenda vidoda kulawa kwa wantu waheri <verse eid="MAT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50" />na hawawasili mumotu gwa Jehanamu, su womberi hawalili na kugayagaya menu gawu.”<verse eid="MAT 13:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kalonga kuusu mafundu ga syayi na ga makashu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51" />Yesu kawakosiya, “Hashi, mwerewa vitwatira avi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:51">Wamwankula, “Yina.”<verse eid="MAT 13:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52" />Su yomberi kawagambira, “Kila mfunda gwa Malagaliru yakawera mfundwa Muufalumi wa kumpindi kalifana gambira muntu yakana numba yakatoliti vintu vya makashu na vya syayi muluwanja lya kutulila vintu.”<verse eid="MAT 13:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wankumlema Nazareti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mariku 6:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luka 4:16-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53" />Yesu pakamalaliti kuwagambira mifanu ayi, kawukiti pahala palii <verse eid="MAT 13:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54" />na kagenditi kushijiji kwakuwi. Aku kafunditi wantu mnumba ya Mlungu na woseri yawampikaniriti walikangashiti. Womberi wakosiya, “Hashi, kapatiti koshi luhala alu? Hashi kapata koshi mauzauza aga? <verse eid="MAT 13:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55" />Hashi, ayu mwana ndiri gwa msongola vintu na mawu gwakuwi wamshema Mariya na walongu wakuwi ashina Yakobu na Yosefu na Simoni na Yuda? <verse eid="MAT 13:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56" />Na wadada wakuwi walikala ndiri panu? Hashi, kagapata koshi goseri aga?” <verse eid="MAT 13:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57" />Su womberi wamlema Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:57">Yesu kawagambira, “Mbuyi gwa Mlungu hapeni wamjimiri mlushi mwakuwi na ukaya kwakuwi, kumbiti lushi zimonga wamjimira.” <verse eid="MAT 13:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58" />Toziya womberi wahera njimiru, su hapeni katendi mauzauza gavuwa palii.<verse eid="MAT 13:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14" />
  <para style="s">Kuhowa kwa Yohani Mbatiza</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mariku 6:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luka 9:7-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1" />Shaka shilii mkulu gwa Galilaya Herodi kapikaniriti visoweru vya Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2" />Nakaka ndo Yohani Mbatiza, ayu kazyuka kulawa kwa yawahowiti, “kawagambira maofisa, ayi ndo toziya kana likakala lwa kutenda mauzauza.”<verse eid="MAT 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3" />Herodi ndo yakalagaliriti kuwera Yohani wamkamuli, wamtawi pingu na kumtula mushibetubetu. Katenditi hangu toziya ya Herodiya mdala gwa Filipi mlongu gwakuwi. <verse eid="MAT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:4" />Toziya Yohani Mbatiza kaweriti kankumgambira Herodi, “Iherepa ndiri gwenga kumyuga Herodiya!” <verse eid="MAT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5" />Herodi kafiriti kumlaga Yohani Mbatiza, kumbiti katiliti wantu wa Shiyawudi toziya Yohani Mbatiza womberi wamwoniti kuwera mbuyi gwa Mlungu.<verse eid="MAT 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6" />Mumsambu gwa kulihola kwiwuka kwa Herodi, muhinga gwa Herodiya, kaviniti kulongolu kwa wahenga woseri. Herodi kanemeleriti nentu <verse eid="MAT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7" />su kamlagaliti, “Nulirapira, hanukupi shoseri shagunduwa!”<verse eid="MAT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8" />Mawu gwa muhinga ulii kamhimiziyiti muhinga gwakuwi kamgambiri tati gwakuwi kulonga, “Gunupi palaa panu muluseru mtuwi gwa Yohani Mbatiza!”<verse eid="MAT 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9" />Ata hangu mfalumi kahinginikiti, kumbiti toziya ya kulirapilira kwakuwi kulongolu kwa wahenga, kalagaliriti wampananiti mtuwi muhinga ulii. <verse eid="MAT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10" />Su kalagalira Yohani kadumulwi mtuwi mushibetubetu. <verse eid="MAT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11" />Mtuwi gwa Yohani wagujega muluseru na kumpanana muhinga ulii, nayomberi kagujega kwa mawu gwakuwi. <verse eid="MAT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12" />Wafundwa wa Yohani wiza, wayitoliti nshimba ya Yohani na kuyisira, shakapanu wagenditi kwa Yesu na kumgambira.<verse eid="MAT 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankulikutiziya shiboga lipinga likulu lya wantu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mariku 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luka 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yohani 6:1-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13" />Yesu pakapikaniriti shisoweru kuusu Yohani, kawukiti pahala palii muuwatu na kagenditi pahala pa gweka. Wantu wapikiniriti aga, wamgendera Yesu kulawa lushi zyawu na wamfata kwa magulu. <verse eid="MAT 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14" />Yesu pakasulukiti kulawa muuwatu na pakaliwoniti lipinga likulu lya wantu, Kawawoneriti lusungu na kawaponiziyiti woseri yawaweriti walwala.<verse eid="MAT 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15" />Pamihi, wafundwa wakuwi wamgendereti Yesu na walonga, “Saa zigenda kala na pahala panu pagweka. Guwalekeziyi wantu wagendi zawu na guwaleki wagendi muvijiji wakahemeri viboga.”<verse eid="MAT 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16" />Yesu kawagambira, “Hapeni wawuki, mwenga muwapanani vintu vya kuliya!”<verse eid="MAT 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17" />Womberi wamwankula, “Twana mabumunda muhanu na wasomba wawili hera.”<verse eid="MAT 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18" />Yesu kalonga, “Su munjegeli panu.” <verse eid="MAT 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19" />Kawagambira wantu walivagi pasi mumihamba, shakapanu katola mabumunda muhanu na wasomba wawili, kalola kumpindi kwa Mlungu, kalonga mayagashii Mlungu. Kagamega mabumunda na kawapanana wafundwa wakuwi na wafundwa wawapanana wantu. <verse eid="MAT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20" />Kila muntu kaliya na kwikuta. Shakapanu wafundwa wajojinira majamanda lilongu na mbili ga vyavisigaliti. <verse eid="MAT 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21" />Kwa wantu woseri yawaliyiti, wapalu hera waweriti elufu muhanu pota kuwawalanga wadala na wana.<verse eid="MAT 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankugendagenda pampindi pa mashi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mariku 6:45-52</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Yohani 6:15-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22" />Pala palii Yesu kawagambira wafundwa wakuwi wakweni muuwatu na wamlongoleri kuloka kumwambu kulitanda, shaka yomberi kankuwaaga wantu. <verse eid="MAT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23" />Pakawaagiti kala, mweni kakweniti kulugongu kugenda kumluwa Mlungu. Payisokiti pamihi, Yesu kaweriti gweka yakuwi kulii, <verse eid="MAT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:24" />na shaka ashi uwatu uweriti kala patali pa litanda, uweriti ugenda usegausega toziya lihega liweriti lyankuguyumbisiya.<verse eid="MAT 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25" />Payiweriti luhunjuhunju Yesu kawagendiriti wafundwa wakuwi, pakagendagenda pampindi pamashi. <verse eid="MAT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26" />Wafundwa wakuwi pawamwoniti pakagendagenda pampindi pamashi, watiliti nentu. Womberi washowangana pawalonga, “Shihoka ayu!”<verse eid="MAT 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27" />Pala palii Yesu kawagambira womberi, “Namtira, ndo neni!”<verse eid="MAT 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28" />Shakapanu Peteru katakula, “Mtuwa, handa nakaka ndo gwenga gung'ambiri neni nizi kwa gwenga pamashi.”<verse eid="MAT 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29" />Yesu kamgambira, “Gwizi!” Su Peteru kasuluka kulawa muuwatu na kamgendera Yesu pakagendagenda pampindi pamashi. <verse eid="MAT 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30" />Kumbiti pakawoniti liyega, kaweriti na lyoga su kanjiti kudidimila mumashi. Shakapanu kalila pakalonga, “Mtuwa! Gumponiziyi.”<verse eid="MAT 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31" />Palaa palii Yesu kalitalipisiya liwoku lyakuwi kamkola na kumgambira, “Ntambu yaguhera njimiru! Iwera hashi gwana lyoga?”<verse eid="MAT 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32" />Woseri wakwena muuwatu, na liyega linyamalira. <verse eid="MAT 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33" />Shakapanu wafundwa muuwatu wamguwira Yesu pawalonga, “Nakaka gwenga gwa Mwana gwa Mlungu!”<verse eid="MAT 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankumponiziya mlweri ku Genezareti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:53-56">Mariku 6:53-56</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34" />Waloka litanda na kusoka lushi lwa Genezareti, <verse eid="MAT 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35" />pahala wantu woseri wamumaniti Yesu. Su wawajega wantu yawalwala kulawa lushi zoseri za pakwegera na wamjegera Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36" />Wamluwa kawajimiri woseri yawalwaliti wapati kushinkula luwiniku lwa nguwu yakuwi na woseri yawashinkuliti waweriti wakomu.<verse eid="MAT 14:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15" />
  <para style="s">Mafundu ga wantu wagona</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 7:1-13">Mariku 7:1-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1" />Shakapanu Mafalisayu wamu na wafunda wa Malagaliru wamwiziriti Yesu kulawa Yerusalemu na wamkosiya, <verse eid="MAT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2" />“Iwera hashi, wafundwa waku wagajimira ndiri mafundu gawafunditi wazewi wetu? Wagulula ndiri weri mawoku gawu pakwanja kuliya!”<verse eid="MAT 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3" />Yesu kawankula, “Iwera hashi mwenga mjimira ndiri malagaliru ga Mlungu na kufata mafundu genu? <verse eid="MAT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4" />Mlungu kalonga, ‘Guwapanani ligoya tati gwaku na mawu gwaku,’ na ‘Yoseri yakamwigilanga tati gwakuwi ama mawu gwakuwi, kafiruwa kalaguwi.’ <verse eid="MAT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5" />Kumbiti mwenga mfunda handa muntu kana shintu sha kumpanana tati gwakuwi ama mawu gwakuwi kumbiti kalonga, ‘Shintu ashi numlavilira Mlungu,’ <verse eid="MAT 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:6" />su kafiruwa ndiri kumpanana ligoya tati gwakuwi ama mawu gwakuwi. Kwa ntambu ayi mwenga mushibeziya shisoweru sha Mlungu kwa kugajimira mafundu genu. <verse eid="MAT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7" />Mwawafyangu mwenga! Vyakatungiti Isaya mbuyi gwa Mlungu viwera nakaka kwa mwenga!<verse eid="MAT 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8" />‘Mlungu kalonga, wantu awa wanupa ligoya neni kwa visoweru vyawu hera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 15:8">Kumbiti myoyu yawu nakaka iwera patali na neni.<verse eid="MAT 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9" />Kunguwira kwawu kufaa ndiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 15:9">Toziya wafunda malagaliru ga wantu gambira ndo malagaliru ga neni!’ ”<verse eid="MAT 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vintu vyavimtenda muntu kaweri muhumba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 7:14-23">Mariku 7:14-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10" />Shakapanu Yesu kalishemiti lipinga lya wantu na kawagambira, “Mpikaniri na mwerewi! <verse eid="MAT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11" />Shintu shashimwingira muntu munshimba hapeni shimtendi muntu kaweri muhumba, kumbiti shilii shashimlawiti ndo shimtenda muntu kaweri muhumba.”<verse eid="MAT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12" />Shakapanu wafundwa wakuwi wamgendera na wamgambira, “Hashi, guvimana kuwera Mafalisayu wakukalalira pawapikaniriti visoweru vyagutakula?”<verse eid="MAT 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13" />Yesu kawankula, “Kila mtera gweni Tati gwangu kakumpindi kaguyaliti ndiri, hawagutupuli. <verse eid="MAT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:14" />Namtira kuusu womberi! Womberi ndo walongoziya wanalwisi na kana lwisi yumu pakamlonguziya kana lwisi muyaguwi, woseri hawapokeri mulirindi.”<verse eid="MAT 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15" />Peteru katakula, “Gutakuliri gagutakula kwa twenga.”<verse eid="MAT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16" />Yesu kawagambira, “Hashi, ata mwenga mwerewa ndiri kuliku wamonga? <verse eid="MAT 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17" />Shintu shoseri shashiyingira mumlomu mwa muntu, shigenda mumtima mwakuwi shakapanu shimlawa na shigenda mshowu. <verse eid="MAT 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18" />Kumbiti vitwatira vyavimlawa muntu mumlomu vilawa mumoyu na vitwatira avi ndo vyavimtenda muntu kaweri muhumba. <verse eid="MAT 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19" />Toziya mumoyu mlawa maholu gadoda ga ulagaji na uhumba na shimbegu na upitawu wa mpayu na mayigilangu. <verse eid="MAT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20" />Vitwatila avi ndo vyavimtenda muntu kaweri muhumba. Kumbiti kuliya shiboga pota na kunaviya mawoku ntambu yamlonga, hapeni kumtendi muntu kaweri muhumba.”<verse eid="MAT 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Moyu gwa mdala yumu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 7:24-30">Mariku 7:24-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21" />Yesu kawukiti pahala paliya na kagenditi pakwegera na lushi lwa Tiru na Sidoni. <verse eid="MAT 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22" />Mdala yumu yakalikariti mlushi lwa Kanaani kamwiziriti Yesu pakabotanga, “Mtuwa, Mwana gwa Dawudi, gumoneri lusungu! Muhinga gwangu kana shamshera yakamgaziya nentu.”<verse eid="MAT 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23" />Kumbiti Yesu kalonga ndiri shisoweru kwa yomberi. Wafundwa wakuwi wamgendera na wamgambira Yesu, “Gumgambiri mdala ayu kagendi zakuwi! Toziya kankutufatafata na kutenda umatu!”<verse eid="MAT 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24" />Shakapanu Yesu kawankula, “Wantuma hera kwa wantu wa Israeli yawagamiliti gambira kondolu.”<verse eid="MAT 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25" />Paliya mdala ulii kiza na kamsuntamalira palongolu pa magulu gakuwi pakalonga, “Mtuwa guntangi!”<verse eid="MAT 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26" />Yesu kamwankula, “Ifaa ndiri kutola shiboga sha wana na kuwawasila wang'ang'a.”<verse eid="MAT 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27" />Yomberi kamwankula, “Ayi ndo nakaka, Mtuwa kumbiti ata wang'ang'a waliyaga vyavisigaliti na kutulukira pasi kwa shitangawala sha Mtuwa gwawu.”<verse eid="MAT 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28" />Su Yesu kamwankula, “Gwenga mdala gwana njimiru nkulu! Shilii shagufira hashitendeki kwaku.” Na pala palii muhinga gwakuwi kawera mkomu.<verse eid="MAT 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankuwaponiziya wantu wavuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29" />Yesu kawukiti palii na kagenda pampeku pa litanda lya Galilaya. Kakwena kulugongu na kalivaga pasi. <verse eid="MAT 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30" />Lipinga likulu lya wantu limwizira pawamjegera wavibyeketu na wanalwisi na bebi na wantu wamonga wavuwa yawaweriti walweli, su wawatula palongolu pa magulu ga Yesu na yomberi kawaponiziya. <verse eid="MAT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31" />Lipinga lya wantu lilikangashiti nentu pawawoniti bebi katakula na wavibyeketu wagendagenda na yawalewelekiti wawera wakomu na wanalwisi wawona na wamkwisiti Mlungu gwa Israeli.<verse eid="MAT 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankuwapanana shiboga lipinga likulu lyamonga lya wantu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:1-10">Mariku 8:1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32" />Yesu kawashema wafundwa wakuwi na kalonga, “Nuwawonera lusungu wantu awa, toziya wawera na neni mashaka matatu na vinu wahera shintu shakuliya. Nfira ndiri kuwaleka wagendi zawu pota na kuliya shiboga, nawalembuka munjira.”<verse eid="MAT 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33" />Wafundwa wakuwi wamkosiya, “Hashi, hatupati koshi shiboga shitosha sha kulikutuziya lipinga lya wantu awa kushiwala aganu?”<verse eid="MAT 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34" />Yesu kawakosiya, “Hashi, mwanaga mabumunda maninga?” Womberi wamwankula, “Mabumunda saba na wasomba wadidini wadikawadika.”<verse eid="MAT 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35" />Yesu kalagalira lipinga lya wantu lilivagi pasi muvipinga vipinga. <verse eid="MAT 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36" />Shakapanu katola mabumunda saba galii na wasomba walii, kalonga mayagashii Mlungu, kamega mabumunda na kawapananiti wafundwa wakuwi na wafundwa wakuwi wawapanani wantu. <verse eid="MAT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37" />Wantu woseri waliyiti na kwikuta. Shakapanu wafundwa wajojinira vyavisigaliti wamemeziya majamanda saba. <verse eid="MAT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38" />Wantu woseri yawaliyiti, wapalu gweka yawu waweriti elufu msheshi pota kuwawalanga wadala na wana.<verse eid="MAT 15:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39" />Shakapanu Yesu kawaaga wantu, kakwena muuwatu na kagenda pahala kwingi wakushema Magadani.<verse eid="MAT 15:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16" />
  <para style="s">Wantu wafira lilangaliru</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:11-13">Mariku 8:11-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:54-56">Luka 12:54-56</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1" />Mafalisayu wamu na Masadukayu yawamgendiriti Yesu wafiriti kumuyambira, su wamgambiriti kawatenderi liuzauza kulanguziya kuwera Mlungu kapamuhera na yomberi.<verse eid="MAT 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2" />Kumbiti Yesu kawankula, “Mshenji paguzyeta mwenga mtakula, ‘Twankugenda kuwera na shaka shiherepa toziya kumpindi kuwera kusheri.’” <verse eid="MAT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3" />Na pamandawira putiputi mtakula, ‘Leru vula haitowi, toziya kumpindi kusheri na ntiti.’ Mwenga mushimana shaka kwa kulola kumpindi, kumbiti muvimana ndiri kuyimana ntambu ya shaka azi!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Malembu gamonga gahera visoweru vya Yesu musitali 2-3. </char></note> <verse eid="MAT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4" />“Shiyiwuku shikondola na shashihera uwaminika kulongolu kwa Mlungu! Mfira mauzauza, kumbiti hapeni mpananwi liuzauza lyoseri lilii ira hampananwi liuzauza lya Yona.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 16:4">Su kawaleka na kagenda zakuwi.<verse eid="MAT 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Simika ya Mafalisayu na Masadukayu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:14-21">Mariku 8:14-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5" />Wafundwa wakuwi pawalokiti kala kumwambu kulitanda, waliyaluwa kutola mabumunda. <verse eid="MAT 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6" />Yesu kawagambira, “Muweri masu, na mulikali weri na simika ya Mafalisayu na Masadukayu.”<verse eid="MAT 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7" />Wantumintumi wanjiti kulitakuziyana weni kwa weni, “Katakuliti hangu toziya tutoliti ndiri libumunda lyoseri.”<verse eid="MAT 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8" />Yesu kavimaniti shawatakula, su kawakosiya, “Mwana njimiru shiyasi gaa! Hashi, shamuyowera pakati penu kuusu kwahera libumunda lyoseri? <verse eid="MAT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9" />Hashi, mpaka vinu muvimana ndiri? Hashi, mulihola ndiri panugamegiti mabumunda muhanu toziya ya wantu elufu muhanu? Hashi, mjojiriti majamanda maninga ga mabumunda yagasigaliti? <verse eid="MAT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10" />Ama mabumunda saba gamuwagawiriti wantu elufu msheshi? Hashi, mjojiniriti majamanda maninga ga mabumunda yagasigariti? <verse eid="MAT 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11" />Iwezekana hashi, muvimana ndiri kuwera ntakuliti ndiri kuusu mabumunda? Mulikali weri na simika ya Mafalisayu na Masadukayu!”<verse eid="MAT 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12" />Shakapanu wafundwa wavimana handa kankuwagambira ndiri walikali weri na simika ya mabumunda kumbiti kulikala weri na mafundu ga Mafalisayu na Masadukayu.<verse eid="MAT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ndo gaa?</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:27-30">Mariku 8:27-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luka 9:18-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13" />Yesu kagenditi pakwegera na lushi lwa Kaisariya Filipi, kawakosiyiti wafundwa wakuwi, “Hashi, wantu wankutakula mwana gwa muntu ndo gaa?”<verse eid="MAT 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14" />Womberi wamwankula, “Wamonga watakula Yohani Mbatiza na wamonga watakula Eliya na wamonga watakula Yeremiya na wamonga walonga mbuyi gwa Mlungu.”<verse eid="MAT 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15" />Yesu kawakosiya, “Hashi, mwenga mlonga neni nagaa?”<verse eid="MAT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16" />Simoni Peteru kawankula, “Gwenga gwa Kristu, mwana gwa Mlungu yakawera mkomu.”<verse eid="MAT 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17" />Yesu kalonga, “Mbaka gwenga Simoni mwana gwa Yohani! Toziya unakaka awu kwahera muntu yakakugubutulira gwenga, kumbiti Tati gwangu gwa kumpindi ndo yakakugubutulira. <verse eid="MAT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18" />Na neni nukugambira gwenga Peteru, gwenga gwa libuwi na pampindi palibuwi ali hanyawi shipinga shangu sha wantu yawanjimira neni, ata makakala ga mulirindi lyalihera upeleru hapeni gakukanki. <verse eid="MAT 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19" />Hanukupi funguwu za Ufalumi wa kumpindi kwa Mlungu, kila shagutata pasipanu shitatitwi kala kumpindi kwa Mlungu na kila shaguvugula pasipanu shivugulitwi kala kumpindi kwa Mlungu”.<verse eid="MAT 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20" />Shakapanu Yesu kawalagalira wafundwa wakuwi nawamgambira muntu yoseri handa yomberi ndo Kristu.<verse eid="MAT 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankutakula kuusu kutabisiwa na kuhowa kwakuwi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:31-9:1">Mariku 8:31-9:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:21-27">Luka 9:21-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21" />Kwanjira shaka shili Yesu kanjiti kuwagambira pota na kufifa kwa wafundwa wakuwi, “Hang'endi Yerusalemu na aku hantabiki nentu kulawa kwa wazewi na watambika wakulu na wafunda wa Malagaliru. Hawanagi kumbiti lishaka lya tatu kwanjira panhowiti, hanzyuki.”<verse eid="MAT 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22" />Peteru kamtola Yesu kugenda kumpeku na kanjiti kumkalipira. “Nayiwera hangu Mtuwa! Shitwatila ashi hapeni shikupati.”<verse eid="MAT 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23" />Yesu kagalambuka na kamgambira Peteru, “Guwuki kulongolu kwa neni, Shetani! Gwenga gwa shidiwiru munjira yaneni, toziya maholu gaku aga galawa ndiri kwa Mlungu kumbiti galawa mumaholu ga muntu.”<verse eid="MAT 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24" />Shakapanu Yesu kawagambira wafundwa wakuwi, “Handa muntu yoseri yakafira kuwera ntumintumi gwangu, kalilemi mweni na kalutoli lupingika lwakuwi kanfati. <verse eid="MAT 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25" />Toziya muntu yakafira kugalopoziya makaliru gakuwi mweni hakagahovii, kumbiti muntu yoseri yakagahoviya makaliru gakuwi toziya ya neni hakagalopoziyi. <verse eid="MAT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26" />Hashi, muntu hakapati shishi pakawupata ulunda wa pasipanu poseri shakapanu pakagahoviya makaliru gakuwi? Ndala! Kwahera shintu, muntu shakaweza kulaviya su kapati ukomu. <verse eid="MAT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27" />Toziya Mwana gwa Muntu hakizi muukwisa wa Tati gwakuwi pamuhera na wantumintumi wa kumpindi wa Mlungu na hakampanani mafupu kila muntu ntambu yakatenditi.<verse eid="MAT 16:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28" />“Nakaka nukugambirani kwana wamonga mlaamu hapeni wahowi pamberi pa kumwona Mwana gwa Muntu pakiza Muufalumi wakuwi.”<verse eid="MAT 16:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kankugalambuka sheni</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:2-13">Mariku 9:2-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luka 9:28-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1" />Pagapititi mashaka sita Yesu kamtoliti Peteru na Yakobu na Yohani mlongu gakuwi kagenda nawa gweka yawu kulugongu lutalipa.<verse eid="MAT 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2" />Aku pawaweriti wakumlola, Yesu kagalambuka sheni, sheni shakuwi shiweriti ndaa gambira mshenji na nguwu zyakuwi ziwera neru mbuu.<verse eid="MAT 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3" />Shakapanu wafundwa watatu walii wawawoniti Musa na Eliya pawayowera na Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4" />Su Peteru kamgambira Yesu, “Mtuwa, iherepa nentu twenga twapanu, pagufira hanyawi visasa vitatu, shimu shaku na shamonga sha Musa na shamonga sha Eliya.”<verse eid="MAT 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5" />Pakaweriti kankali kankutakula hangu, liwundi lifufu limgubikira na liziwu lipikanika kulawa muliwundi ali palilonga, “Ayu ndo mwana gwangu yanumfira nentu nherepeziwa nayomberi, mumpikaniri.” <verse eid="MAT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6" />Wafundwa pawapikaniriti aga watiliti nentu, su wasuntama makukama. <verse eid="MAT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7" />Yesu kawagendera kawashinkula pakalonga, “Namtira, mgoloki!” <verse eid="MAT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8" />Pawaloliti wawona ndiri muntu gwingi kumbiti Yesu gweka yakuwi.<verse eid="MAT 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9" />Pawaweriti wankusuluka kulugongu Yesu kawaberiziya nawamgambira muntu vitwatira yawaviwoniti mpaka Mwana gwa Muntu pawamzyukisiya kulawa kwa wahowiti.<verse eid="MAT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10" />Shakapanu wafundwa wakuwi wamkosiya, “Iwera hashi wafunda wa Malagaliru wankutakula eti mpaka Eliya kizi huti?” <verse eid="MAT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11" />Yesu kawankula, “Nakaka, Eliya hakizi kunyawa vitwatira yoseri. <verse eid="MAT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12" />Nukugambirani kuwera Eliya kiza kala na wantu wammana ndiri, kumbiti wamtendera vyawafiriti weni. Mwana gwa Muntu hawambeziyi ntambu ira ayi mumawoku gawu.”<verse eid="MAT 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13" />Peni panu wafundwa wavimana kuwera yomberi kaweriti kankuwagambira weni kuusu Yohani Mbatiza.<verse eid="MAT 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankumponiziya mwana kana shamshera</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:14-29">Mariku 9:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luka 9:37-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14" />Pawawuyiti mulipinga lya wantu, muntu yumu kamgendera Yesu na kamsuntamalira, <verse eid="MAT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15" />na kalonga, “Mtuwa, gumwoneri lusungu mwana gwangu! Yomberi kana shisirika, kayi mwana gwangu katabika nentu mala zitangala kaguwira mumotu ama mumashi. <verse eid="MAT 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16" />Numjega kwa wafundwa waku, kumbiti waweza ndiri kumponiziya.”<verse eid="MAT 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17" />Yesu kawankula, “Shiyiwuku ashi shahera njimiru na shipotoka! Hanulikali na mwenga mpaka ndii? Munjegeri panu mwana ayu!” <verse eid="MAT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18" />Yesu kamkalipira shamshera ulii, na shamshera kamlawa na mwana ulii kawera mkomu palaa palii.<verse eid="MAT 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19" />Shakapanu wafundwa wakuwi wamgendera Yesu pahala pagweka wamkosiya, “Iwera hashi twenga tusinda kumwusiya shamshera ulii.”<verse eid="MAT 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20" />Yesu kawankula, “Toziya mwahera njimiru, nuwagambira nakaka pamuwera na njimiru gambira mbeyu ndidini nentu, hamuwezi kulugambira lugongu alu, ‘Guwuki panu gugendi palii!’ Na lugongu alu halugendi. Haguwezi kutenda shitwatila shoseri!” <verse eid="MAT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 17:21" />Kumbiti kwa kumluwa Mlungu na koya kuliya mweza kuwalaviya washamshera awa, kwahera shintu shingi shiweza.<verse eid="MAT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankuyowera kayi kuusu kuhowa kwakuwi.</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mariku 9:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Luka 9:43-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22" />Wafundwa pawaliwoniti pamuhera Galilaya, Yesu kawagambira, “Mwana gwa Muntu hawamupanani kwa wantu <verse eid="MAT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:23" />na hawamlagi, kumbiti lishaka lya tatu kwanjira kuhowa kwakuwi hakazyuki.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:23">Wafundwa waweriti na ushiwa nentu.<verse eid="MAT 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulipa zaka ya Numba nkulu ya Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24" />Yesu pamuhera na wafundwa wakuwi pawasokiti Kafarinaumu, watola mpiya za zaka za Numba nkulu ya Mlungu wamgenderiti Peteru na wamkosiya, “Hashi mfunda gwenu kalipa mpiya za zaka za Numba nkulu ya Mlungu?”<verse eid="MAT 17:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25" />Peteru kawankula, “Yina!” Su Peteru pakayingiriti mnumba, pamberi kanetakuli shisoweru shoseri, Yesu kamkosiya, “Simoni gwengapa guwona ashi, wafalumi wa pasipanu watola ushuru ama kodi kwa ashina gaa? Kulawa kwa wenikaya ama kwa wahenga?”<verse eid="MAT 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26" />Peteru kawankula, “Kulawa kwa wahenga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:26">Yesu kamgambira, “Iherepa!, Su wenikaya wawusika ndiri kulipa. <verse eid="MAT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27" />Kumbiti wantu awa nawatuwona twenga twawadoda. Su mgendi kulitanda mwakalopoli somba. Somba gwa kwanja kumlopola, gugubuturi mlomu gwakuwi na haguwoni mpiya zazitosha kulipira zaka yangu na mwenga. Guzitoli na gulipi kodi zyetu.”<verse eid="MAT 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18" />
  <para style="s">Mkulu ndo gaa?</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mariku 9:33-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luka 9:46-48</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1" />Shaka shilii wafundwa wamgenderiti Yesu kumkosiya, “Hashi, ndo gaa hakaweri mkulu Muufalumi wa kumpindi kwa Mlungu?”<verse eid="MAT 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2" />Su Yesu kamshema mwana yumu, kamgolosiya pakati pawu, <verse eid="MAT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3" />na kalonga, “Nukugambirani nakaka pamuwera ndiri gambira wana awa hapeni mwingiri nakamu Muufalumi wa kumpindi kwa Mlungu. <verse eid="MAT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4" />Yakawera mkulu Muufalumi wa kumpindi kwa Mlungu ndo ulii yakalisulusiya mweni na kuwera gambira mwana ayu. <verse eid="MAT 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5" />Na yoseri yakamshemera mwana gambira ayu, kanshemera neni.<verse eid="MAT 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vintu vyavimtenda muntu katendi vidoda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:42-48">Mariku 9:42-48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luka 17:1-2</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6" />“Yoseri yakamtenda yumu gwa wana wadidini awa katendi vidoda, iweri mbaka kwa muntu ulii kumtawalira musingu mwakuwi lwala na kumwasira mubahari. <figure style="fig" file="01 Millstone.jpg" size="col" ref="18:6">Wantu wawili wankusaga kwa lwala</figure> <verse eid="MAT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7" />Shondi pasipanu toziya ya vintu vyavimtenda muntu katendi vidoda! Vintu avi mpaka vilawiri, kumbiti shondi kwa ulii yakayijega kwawomberi!<verse eid="MAT 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8" />“Handa liwoku lyaku ama ligulu lyaku palikutenda gutendi vidoda, gulidumuli na gulyasi kutali! Iherepa nentu kwingira muukomu pota na liwoku ama ligulu kuliku kuwera na mawoku goseri na magulu goseri na wakwasili mumotu yagutiya ndiri mashaka goseri. <verse eid="MAT 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9" />Handa lisu lyaku palikutenda gutendi vidoda, gulikolopoli! Iherepa nentu muntu kwingira muukomu wa mashaka goseri paguwera na lisu limu kuliku kuwera na masu goseri na wakwasili mumotu gwa Jehanamu.<verse eid="MAT 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfanu gwa kondolu yakagamiriti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 15:3-7">Luka 15:3-7</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10" />“Mulikali weri namumbeziya yumu gwa wadidini awa. Nukugambirani, wantumintumi wawu wa kumpindi kwa Mlungu, shaka shoseri wapalongolu pa Tati gwangu kakumpindi. <verse eid="MAT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:11" />Mwana gwa Muntu kiziti kulopoziya shilii shashiyagamiriti.<verse eid="MAT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12" />“Mulihola hashi muntu pakawera na wakondolu miya na yumu pakayagamira hakatendi hashashi? Hakawaleki walii lilongu tisa na tisa palugongu na kugenda kumsakula ulii yakagamiriti. <verse eid="MAT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13" />Pakamwona, nukugambirani nakaka hakamnemeleri ulii kondolu yumu yakagamiriti kuliku lilongu tisa na tisa yawagamiliti ndiri. <verse eid="MAT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14" />Ntambu ira ayi Tati gwenu gwa kumpindi kafira ndiri ata yumu gwa wadidini kagamiri.<verse eid="MAT 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlongu pakatenda vidoda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 17:3">Luka 17:3</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15" />“Handa mlongu gwaku pakakukoseya, gumgenderi gwakamberiziyi. Gutendi hangu pamuwera gweka yenu. Pakakupikanira hagumpati mlongu gwaku. <verse eid="MAT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16" />Kumbiti pakakupikanira ndiri, gumtoli muntu yumu ama wawili pamuhera na gwenga, su muyoweri kwa wapitawu wawili ama watatu, Malembu Mananagala ntambu yagalembitwi. <verse eid="MAT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17" />Na pakashipikanira ndiri ashi, gutakuli kila shintu mushipinga sha wantu yawamjimira Yesu. Upeleru pakashipikanira ndiri shipinga ashi, gumloli gambira muntu yakamumana ndiri Mlungu ama mtola kodi.<verse eid="MAT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulewelera na kulekiziya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18" />“Su nukugambirani woseri, shamlewelera pasipanu shileweleritwi kala kumpindi kwa Mlungu na shamulekeziya pasipanu shilekeziwitwi kala kumpindi kwa Mlungu.<verse eid="MAT 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19" />“Nukugambirani kayi, wawili wenu pasipanu pawajimilirana kumluwa Mlungu shoseri, Tati gwangu gwa kumpindi hakawatenderi shitwatila ashi. <verse eid="MAT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20" />Wantu wawili ama watatu pawaliwona pamuhera kumluwa Mlungu mulitawu lyaneni, hanweri pamuhera na womberi.”<verse eid="MAT 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfanu gwa ntumintumi yakalegeziyiti ndiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21" />Shakapanu Peteru kamgenderiti Yesu na kumkosiya, “Mtuwa, hashi mlongu gwangu pakankoseya numulekiziyi mala ninga? Hashi, mala saba?”<verse eid="MAT 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22" />Yesu kamwankula, “Ndala, mala saba ndiri kumbiti miya msheshi na lilongu tisa, <verse eid="MAT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23" />toziya Ufalumi wa kumpindi ulifana na ntambu ayi. Kuweriti na mfalumi yumu yakafiriti kulola mawalanga ga wantumintumi wakuwi. <verse eid="MAT 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24" />Pakanjiti kutenda hangu, wamjegera muntu yumu yakaweriti wankumshonga mpiya elufu lilongu. <verse eid="MAT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25" />Ntumintumi ulii kaweriti ndiri na mpiya zitosha zya kulipa uwanda wakuwi, su mfalumi kalagaliriti kuwera yomberi wamuwuzi gambira ntumintumi pamuhera na mdala gwakuwi na wana wakuwi na vyoseri vyakawera navi su kalipi uwanda. <verse eid="MAT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26" />Ntumintumi ulii kasuntamala palongolu pa mfalumi na kamluwiti, ‘Gunheperi huti, hanukulipi kila shintu!’ <verse eid="MAT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27" />Mtuwa gwa ntumintumi ulii kamwoneriti lusungu, su kamlekeziya uwanda ulii na kamleka kagendi zakuwi.<verse eid="MAT 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28" />“Ntumintumi ulii pakawukiti, kaliwoniti na yumu gwa wantumintumi wayaguwi yakaweriti kankumshonga mpiya miya yimu. Su kamkamula yomberi na kanjiti kumkaba singu pakamgambira, ‘Gunipi shilii shagunkopiti!’ <verse eid="MAT 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29" />Ntumintumi myaguwi kamsuntamalira na kamluwa pakalonga, ‘Gunheperi wuti, hanukulipi uwanda waku woseri!’ <verse eid="MAT 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30" />Kumbiti yomberi kajimiriti ndiri, su kamtatira mushibetubetu mpaka pakalipa lideni lilii. <verse eid="MAT 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31" />Wantumintumi wayaguwi pawawoniti vitwatira vyavilawiliti, wahinginikiti nentu na wagenditi kumgambira Mfalumi kila shintu. <verse eid="MAT 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32" />Mfalumi kamshema ntumintumi ulii na kamgambira, ‘Gwenga gwa ntumintumi gufaa ndiri! Neni nukulegeziya toziya gunduwiti nukulegiziyi. <verse eid="MAT 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33" />Gufiruwitwi gwenga gumwoneri lusungu ntumintumi muyagu ntambu yanukuwoniriti lusungu gwenga.’ <verse eid="MAT 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34" />Mfalumi kakalariti nentu, kamlaviya ntumintumi ayu wamwazibu na kumtatira mushibetubetu mpaka pakalipiti uwanda woseri.”<verse eid="MAT 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35" />Na Yesu kamaliriti kwa kulonga, “Ndo Tati gwangu gwa kumpindi hakawatenderani ntambu ira ayi kila muntu pakati penu pakamlegeziya ndiri mlongu gwakuwi kulawa mumoyu mwakuwi.”<verse eid="MAT 18:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kankuberiziya kuusu kulekana</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:1-12">Mariku 10:1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1" />Yesu pakamaliliti kutakula visoweru avi, kawuka Galilaya kagenda mumkowa gwa Yudeya, kumwambu kulushemba Yoridani. <verse eid="MAT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2" />Wantu wavuwa wamgenderiti aku, na yomberi kawaponiziyiti walelwi.<verse eid="MAT 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3" />Mafalisayu wamu wamwizira, wafiriti kumgomiziya pawamkosiya, “Hashi, Malagaliru getu gatulekeziya muntu kumleka mdala gwakuwi kwa likosa lyoseri?”<verse eid="MAT 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4" />Yesu kawawankula, “Hashi, hamwenibetuli Mumalembu Mananagala handa Mlungu pakanjiti kumuumba muntu mpalu na mdala? <verse eid="MAT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5" />Su Mlungu kalonga, ‘Toziya ayi hakamleki mawu na tati gwakuwi, hakagendi na mdala gwakuwi, woseri wawili hawaweri yumu.’ <verse eid="MAT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6" />Su womberi hawaweri ndiri wawili, kumbiti hawaweri yumu. Shakalemetiziyiti Mlungu, muntu nakashitula gweka.”<verse eid="MAT 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7" />Kumbiti Mafalisayu wamkosiya, “Iwera hashi, Musa katupananiti Lilagaliru kwa muntu kumleka mdala gwakuwi kwa kumpanani malembu ga kumleka?”<verse eid="MAT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8" />Yesu kawankula, “Musa kalagalariti kuwaleka wadala wenu toziya mwelewa ndiri pawawafunda. Kumbiti iwera ndiri ntambu ayi mushaka Mlungu pakaumbiti. <verse eid="MAT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9" />Nukugambirani kuwera muntu yoseri yakamleka mdala gwakuwi paiwera katenda undiyandiya, na yomberi pakayuga mdala gwingi, su katenda undiyandiya.”<verse eid="MAT 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10" />Wafundwa wakuwi wamgambira, “Paviwera vitwatira vya mpalu na mdala vya ntambu ayi, mbaka kulikala pota kuyuga.”<verse eid="MAT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11" />Yesu kawankula, “Vitwatila avi viwawusu ndiri woseri yawaweza kuvijimira, kumbiti hera kwa woseri Mlungu yakawapanani wavimani. <verse eid="MAT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12" />Toziya kwana vintu vyamonga vyavimtenda muntu kayugi ndiri, wamonga wayiwukiti ntambu iraa ayi, na wamonga watendwa na wantu hapeni wayugi na wamonga walema kuyuga toziya ya Ufalumi wa kumpindi. Yoseri yakajimira mafundu aga, su kagajimili.”<verse eid="MAT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankuwatekelera wana wadidini</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mariku 10:13-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luka 18:15-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13" />Wantu wamu wamjegeriti Yesu wana wadidini su kawakisikiri na kuwaluwira kwa Mlungu, kumbiti wafundwa wawakalipira. <verse eid="MAT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14" />Yesu katakula, “Muwaleki wana wizi kwa neni, namuwalewelera toziya Ufalumi wa kumpindi ndo wa wantu gambira wana awa.”<verse eid="MAT 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15" />Kawakisikira womberi, shakapanu kawuka palii.<verse eid="MAT 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muntemba kalunda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mariku 10:17-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luka 18:18-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16" />Muntu yumu kamgendera Yesu kamkosiya, “mfunda, ntendi shintu gaa shiherepa su mpati ukomu wa mashaka goseri?”<verse eid="MAT 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17" />Yesu kamwankula, “Iwera hashi gunkosiya kuusu shitwatila shiheri? Kwana yumu hera yakawera muheri. Pagufira kwingira muukomu wa mashaka goseri gugajimili malagaliru ga Mlungu.”<verse eid="MAT 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18" />Yomberi kakosiya, “Malagaliru goshi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 19:18">Yesu kamwankula, “Nagulaga, nagutenda uhumba, nagwiwa, nagutakula upitawu wa mpayu kwa muntu yoseri, <verse eid="MAT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19" />guwapanani ligoya tati gwaku na mawu gwaku, na guwafiri wantu wamonga ntambu yagulifira gumweni.”<verse eid="MAT 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20" />Muntemba ulii kamgambira, “Malagaliru goseri nugajimira, ntendi shishi shimonga?”<verse eid="MAT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21" />Yesu kamgambira yomberi, “Handa pagufira guweri muheri nakaka, gugendi gwakawuzi vintu vyaku vyoseri na guwapanani mpiya wahushu na gwenga haguweri mlunda kumpindi kwa Mlungu, shakapanu gwizi gunfati.”<verse eid="MAT 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22" />Muntemba ulii pakapikaniriti aga, kagenda zakuwi pakakalala toziya kaweriti kalunda nentu.<verse eid="MAT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23" />Shakapanu Yesu kawagambira wafundwa wakuwi, “Nakaka nukugambirani mwenga, hayiweri vikamala nentu kwa mlunda kwingira Muufalumi wa kumpindi. <verse eid="MAT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24" />Nakaka nuwagambirani, hayiweri vikamala kwa mlunda kwingira Muufalumi wa Mlungu kuliku shigongolu shawashishema ntembu kwingira mushitoboli sha sindanu.”<verse eid="MAT 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25" />Wafundwa pawapikaniriti aga, walikangasha nentu. Su wamkosiya, “Hashi, ndo gaa yakaweza kulopoziwa?”<verse eid="MAT 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26" />Yesu kawalola na kawankula, “Ashi shikamala nentu kwa wantu, kumbiti kwa Mlungu shila shintu shikamala ndiri.”<verse eid="MAT 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27" />Shakapanu Peteru kalonga, “Guloli, twenga tuleka shila shintu na tukufata gwenga. Hashi, hatupati shishi?”<verse eid="MAT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28" />Yesu kawagambira, “Hamuweri na unakaka kuwera Mwana gwa Muntu pakalikala mushibanta sha shifalumi shikwisa muisi yasyayi, mwenga yamunfata neni, hamulivagi muvibanta vikwisa, kugakolamlima makabila lilongu na mbili ga Israeli. <verse eid="MAT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29" />Na yoseri yakalekiti numba ama mlongu ama mhasha ama tati ama mawu ama wana ama malambu toziya yaneni, hakapati mala miya nentu ya vilii yakavilekiti na hakalikali muukomu wa mashaka goseri. <verse eid="MAT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30" />Kumbiti wantu wavuwa yawawera wa kwanja vinu hawaweri wa kupelera, na woseri yawawera wakupelera vinu hawaweri wa kwanja.<verse eid="MAT 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20" />
  <para style="s">Watenda lihengu mulirambu lya mizyabibu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1" />“Ufalumi wa kumpindi ulifana hangu. Kuweriti na muntu yakalilawa mandawira putiputi kugenda kuwatula wantu watendi lihengu mulirambu lyakuwi lya mizyabibu. <verse eid="MAT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2" />Kapataniti nawomberi shibenamgongu sha lishaka limu, na kawajega wantu wamu mulirambu lyakuwi lya mizyabibu. <verse eid="MAT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3" />Kalawa saa tatu mandawira kagenda pahala pa soku kawawona wantu wamonga wagoloka paliya wahera lihengu. <verse eid="MAT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4" />Su kawagambira, ‘Mwenga mgendi mwakatendi lihengu mulirambu lya mizyabibu, neni hanuwapanani shibenamgongu.’ <verse eid="MAT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5" />Su womberi wagenda. Mweni kana lirambu kawuka kayi saa sita na saa tisa paluwala, katenditi ntambu iraa. <verse eid="MAT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6" />Payiweriti pakwegera na mshenji kuzyeta pakagenditi pahala pa soku, kawawoniti wantu wamonga wankali wankugoloka paliya. Yomberi kawakosiya, ‘Iwera hashi mgoloka panu paluwala poseri pota kutenda lihengu?’ <verse eid="MAT 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7" />Womberi wamwankula, ‘Kwahera muntu yakatupa lihengu twenga.’ Na yomberi kawagambira, ‘Mwenga mgendi na kutenda lihengu mulirambu lyaneni lya mizyabibu.’<verse eid="MAT 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8" />“Mshenji paguzyetiti yakana lirambu kiziti na kamgambiriti mtula mpiya gwakuwi, ‘Guwashemi watenda lihengu na guwapanani vibenamgongu vyawu, gwanjiti kuwapanana yanuwajegiti muupeleru na gumaliri kwa kuwapanana walii yanuwajegiti kwanja.’ <verse eid="MAT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9" />Wantu yawanjiti kutenda lihengu mshenji kuzyeta, gumpanani kila muntu shibenamgongu sha lishaka limu. <verse eid="MAT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10" />Su wantu walii yawaweriti wakwanja kwiza kutenda lihengu wiziti kutola mpiya zyawu, womberi waliholiti kuwera hawapati mpiya nentu kuliku womberi, kumbiti wapatiti vibenamgongu vyawu kila muntu. <verse eid="MAT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11" />Womberi watoliti mpiya zyawu na wanjiti kumuhinginiziya mtuwa yakawajegiti kutenda lihengu. <verse eid="MAT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12" />Watakula, ‘Wantu awa yaguwajegiti kutenda lihengu muupeleru, watenda lihengu lisaa limu hera, twenga tutenda lihengu kwanjira mandawira mpaka mshenji kuzyeta, tuhepelera mshenji gukalipa, su gwenga gutulipa twenga ntambu yaguwalipa womberi!’<verse eid="MAT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13" />“Mtuwa ulii kamwankula yumu gwawu, ‘Gupikaniri ganja, nukupunja ndiri shintu! Toziya gujimilirana na neni nukulipi shibenamgongu. <verse eid="MAT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14" />Vinu gutoli malipu gaku na gugendi ukaya. Nfira kumpanana muntu ayu yanumjegiti muupeleru kutenda lihengu, shibenamgongu ntambu yanukupanana gwenga. <verse eid="MAT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15" />Hashi, neni nekeziwa ndiri kutenda ntambu yanfira kutendera mpiya zangu? Ama gumonera weya toziya neni ntanga wantu?’ ”<verse eid="MAT 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16" />Yesu kamalira kwa kutakula, “Su wantu woseri yawawoneka wakuupeleru vinu, hawaweri wakwanja na wantu woseri yawawoneka wakwanja vinu, hawaweri wakuupeleru.”<verse eid="MAT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankuyowera mala ya tatu kuusu kuhowa kwakuwi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mariku 10:32-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luka 18:31-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17" />Yesu pakaweriti kankugenda Yerusalemu, kawatoliti wafundwa wakuwi lilongu na wawili pambwega na kuwagambira gweka yawu pawaweriti wankugendagenda. <verse eid="MAT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18" />Kawagambira, “Mpikaniri, twankugenda Yerusalemu, aku Mwana gwa Muntu hawambati na kumjega kwa Watambika wakulu na wafunda wa Malagaliru. Womberi hawamtozi kumlaga <verse eid="MAT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19" />na hawawapanani wantu wa isi zimonga, womberi hawamtenderi lidufiya na hawamkomi na hawamlagi kwa kumkong'ondera palupingika na lishaka lya tatu kwanjira pakahowiti hakazyuki.”<verse eid="MAT 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuluwa kwa mawu gwa Yakobu na Yohani</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:35-45">Mariku 10:35-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20" />Shakapanu mdala gwa Zebedayu kiziti kwa Yesu pamuhera na wana wakuwi wawili, kamsuntamalira na kumluwa shintu.<verse eid="MAT 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21" />Yesu kamkosiya, “Gufira shishi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:21">Mawu uliya kamwankula, “Gunagili neni kuwera wana waneni awa wawili hawalivagi yumu uwega waku wa kumliwu na yumonga uwega waku wa kumshigi, shaka paguwera Mfalumi.”<verse eid="MAT 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22" />Yesu kawankula wana walii, “Muvimana ndiri shamluwa. Hashi, muweza kulandira lutekeru lwa ntabibiku lwanfira kulandira neni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:22">Womberi wamwankula, “Tuweza.”<verse eid="MAT 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23" />Yesu kawagambira, “Nakaka hamlandiri lutekeru lwangu. Kumbiti neni hapeni ntakuli yoshi hakalivagi kumliwu ama kumshigi kwaneni. Shitwatira ashi ndo sha woseri yawatulilwa kala na Tati gwangu.”<verse eid="MAT 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24" />Wafundwa wamonga walii pawapikaniriti aga, wawakalaliti walongu wawili walii. <verse eid="MAT 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25" />Su Yesu kawashema woseri pamuhera na kawagambira, “Muvimana kuwera wakolamlima wa isi zimonga wankuwakola wantu wawu kwa makakala na walongoziya wawu wanauwezu nentu. <verse eid="MAT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26" />Kumbiti kwa mwenga naiwera gambira womberi pakati penu. Handa pakati penu kwana muntu yakafira kuwera mkulu, kaweri ntumintumi gwa wantu woseri. <verse eid="MAT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27" />Handa pakati penu kwana muntu yakafira kuwera gwa kwanja, kaweri ntumintumi gwenu. <verse eid="MAT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28" />Na neni Mwana gwa Muntu niziti ndiri wantenderi, kumbiti niziti kutenda na kuwulaviya ukomu wangu, su nuwalopoziyi wantu wavuwa.”<verse eid="MAT 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankuwaponiziya wanalwisi wawili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mariku 10:46-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luka 18:35-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29" />Yesu pamuhera na wantumintumi wakuwi pawaweriti wankuwuka lushi lwa Yeriku, lipinga likulu lya wantu limfatiti. <verse eid="MAT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30" />Su kuweriti na wanalwisi wawili walivaga pampeku pa njira, wapikaniriti kuwera Yesu kankupita peni paliya, su wanjiti kubotanga, “Mtuwa, Mwana gwa Dawudi! Gutuwoneri lusungu!”<verse eid="MAT 20:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31" />Lipinga lya wantu liwakalipira na kuwagambira wanyamali. Kumbiti womberi wongera kubotanga, “Mtuwa, Mwana gwa Dawudi! Gutuwoneri lusungu!”<verse eid="MAT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32" />Yesu kagoloka kawashema womberi. Su kawakosiya, “Mfira nuwatenderi shishi?”<verse eid="MAT 20:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33" />Womberi wamwankula, “Mtuwa, tuluwa kuwona!”<verse eid="MAT 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34" />Su Yesu kawawonera lusungu, kawashinkula masu gawu, na palaa paliya waweziti kuwona na wamfatiti.<verse eid="MAT 20:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kankwingira Yerusalemu kwa shereku</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mariku 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-38">Luka 19:28-38</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yohani 12:12-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1" />Yesu na wafundwa wakuwi pawaweriti pakwegera na Yerusalemu na kusoka Betifagi kulugongu lwa Mizeyituni, kawatumiti wantumintumi wakuwi wawili, <verse eid="MAT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2" />pakawagambira, “Mgendi mpaka kushijiji sha palongolu penu na hamumwoni punda na mwana gwakuwi wawatawa. Muwayopoli na munjegeri. <verse eid="MAT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3" />Handa muntu yoseri pakatakula shoseri, mumgambiri, ‘Mtuwa kawafira kawatenderi na shakapanu hawawalekeri.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4" />Shitwatira ashi shitendikiti su galii gagatakulitwi na mbuyi gwa Mlungu gatendeki,<verse eid="MAT 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5" />“Mlugambiri lushi lwa Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:5">Guloli, Mfalumi gwaku kankwiza kwa gwenga!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:5">Ndo mpoli na kakwena panani pa punda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:5">Na ndama, mwana gwa punda.”<verse eid="MAT 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6" />Su wafundwa wakuwi wagenda na watenda ntambu Yesu yakawalagaliriti, <verse eid="MAT 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7" />wamjega punda ulii na ndama gwakuwi, wayazilira nguwu zyawu panani pa punda na Yesu kakwena kalivaga pampindi pakuwi. <verse eid="MAT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8" />Lipinga lya wantu wayarika nguwu zawu munjira, na wantu wamonga wadumula maputira ga mitera na waiyalika panjira. <verse eid="MAT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9" />Lipinga lya wantu wamlongoleriti Yesu na wamonga wamfatiti kumbeli pawabotanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:9">“Kakwiswi Mwana gwa Dawudi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:9">Mlungu kamtekeleri yakiza mulitawu lya Mtuwa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:9">Kakwiswi Mlungu!”<verse eid="MAT 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10" />Yesu pakaweriti kankwingira Yerusalemu, lushi loseri luweriti na shelekusheleku. Wantu wakosiyiti, “Hashi, ayu ndo gaa?”<verse eid="MAT 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11" />Lipinga lya wantu liwankula, “Ayu ndo Yesu mbuyi gwa Mlungu, kalawa Nazareti isi ya Galilaya.”<verse eid="MAT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kagenda kwingira Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mariku 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luka 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yohani 2:13-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12" />Yesu kagenda kwingira Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu, kawawinga kunja wantu woseri yawaweriti wankuwuza na kuhemera vintu palii. Kazigalambuziya meza zawaweriti wankuvunjira mpiya na vigoda vya wantu yawaweriti wankuwuza wang'unda, <verse eid="MAT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13" />na kawagambira, “Galembwa Mumalembu Mananagala kuwera Mlungu kalonga, ‘Numba nkulu yaneni hayishemwi numba ya sala.’ Kumbiti mwenga muyitenda mpanga ya wapoka!”<verse eid="MAT 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14" />Wanalwisi na yawalewelekiti wamgendiriti Yesu Kunumba nkulu ya Mlungu na yomberi kawaponiziya. <verse eid="MAT 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15" />Su, watambika wakulu na wafunda wa Malagaliru wakalaliti pawawoniti vitwatira vya kulikangasha vyakatenditi na wana pawaweriti wankubotanga Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu pawalonga, “Kakwiswi Mwana gwa Dawudi!” <verse eid="MAT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16" />Su womberi wamkosiya Yesu, “Hashi, gupikinira ntambu yawalonga?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:16">Yesu kawankula, “Yina mpikanira. Hashi, hamwebetuli Malembu aga? ‘Guwafunditi wana na wana wanonu ntambu ya kukukwisa.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17" />Su, Yesu kawaleka na kagenda kunja kwa lushi na kagenda Betaniya na kalikaliti kulaa pashiru poseri.<verse eid="MAT 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankugupangira mtera gwa Kuyu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 11:12-14">Mariku 11:12-14</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 11:20-24">20-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18" />Yesu pakaweriti kankuwuya mlushi mandawira putiputi, kaweriti na njala. <verse eid="MAT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19" />Kaguwona mkuyu pampeku pa njira na kagugendera, kumbiti guweriti gwahera bwajubwaju loseri ira gwana mihamba hera. Su kagugambira mtera, “Hapeni guleri kayi mabwajubwaju!” Palaa palii mkuyu gulii guyuma.<verse eid="MAT 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20" />Wafundwa pawaguwoniti na walikangasha, pawalonga, “Iwera hashi mkuyu agu guyuma kanongola?” <verse eid="MAT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21" />Yesu kawankula, “Nakaka nuwagambirani, handa pamuwera na njimiru pota na lyoga, hamuwezi kutenda ntambu yantenditi kwa mkuyu agu na kwa hangu ndiri hera kumbiti ata hamuwezi kulugambira lugongu, ‘Gutupuki gukalidibiziyi gumweni mulitanda,’ na hayitendeki. <verse eid="MAT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22" />Handa pamjimira, hampananwi shoseri shamluwa kwa Mlungu.”<verse eid="MAT 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Likosiwu kuusu uwezu wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mariku 11:27-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luka 20:1-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23" />Yesu kingiriti Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu na kaweriti kankufunda. Watambika wakulu na wazewi wamwiziriti Yesu na kumkosiya, “Hashi, gutenda vitwatira avi kwa uwezu wa gaa? Hashi, ndo gaa yakakupanana uwezu awu?”<verse eid="MAT 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24" />Yesu kawankula, “Naneni hanuwakosiyi likosiwu limu na pamunankula, su naneni hanuwagambirani ntenda vitwatira avi kwa uwezu wa gaa. <verse eid="MAT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25" />Nuwakosiya, ‘Hashi, uwezu wa Yohani Mbatiza ulawiti kwagaa? Hashi, ulawiti kumpindi ama kwa wantu?’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:25">Kumbiti wanjiti kulitakuziyana weni, “Hatulongi ashi? Handa patutakula, ‘Ulawiti kwa Mlungu,’ yomberi hakatukosiyi, ‘Su, iwera hashi mumjimiriti ndiri Yohani?’ <verse eid="MAT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26" />Kumbiti patulonga, ‘Ulawiti kwa wantu,’ tutira lipinga lya wantu toziya wantu woseri wavimana kuwera Yohani kaweriti mbuyi gwa Mlungu.” <verse eid="MAT 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27" />Su, wamwankula Yesu, “Tuvimana ndiri.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:27">Yesu kawagambira, “Naneni viraa hapeni nuwagambiri ntenda vitwatira avi kwa uwezu wa gaa.<verse eid="MAT 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfanu gwa wana wawili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28" />“Vinu mwenga mulihola ashashi kwa shitwatira ashi? Kuweriti muntu yumu yakaweriti na wana wakuwi wawili. Yomberi kamgendiriti mkulu yumu na kulonga, ‘Mwana gwangu, leru gugendi gwakatendi lihengu mulirambu lya mizyabibu.’ <verse eid="MAT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29" />Yomberi kamwankula, ‘Hapeni ng'endi,’ kumbiti shakapanu kagenda kutenda lihengu. <verse eid="MAT 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30" />Shakapanu tati ulii kamgendera mwana gwakuwi yumonga kamgambiriti ntambu ilii. Yomberi kamwankula, ‘Yina tati hang'endi,’ kumbiti kagenditi ndiri. <verse eid="MAT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31" />Hashi, pa wawili awa gaa yakatenditi gakafiriti tati gwakuwi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">Womberi wamwankula, “Uliya mwana gwa kwanja.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">Su, Yesu kawagambira, “Nuwagambirani nakaka, watola kodi na wandiyandiya hawawalonguleri kugenda kwingira Muufalumi wa Mlungu. <verse eid="MAT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32" />Toziya Yohani Mbatiza kiziti kwa mwenga kawalanguziya njira ya kulikala ya kumfiriziya Mlungu na mwenga mumjimira ndiri, kumbiti watola kodi na wandiyandiya wamjimiriti. Ata pamwoniti goseri aga, mwenga mlekiti ndiri vidoda vyamtenda na kumjimira yomberi.”<verse eid="MAT 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfanu gwa watenda lihengu mulirambu lya mizyabibu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mariku 12:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luka 20:9-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33" />Yesu kalonga, “Mpikaniri mfanu gumonga. Kuweriti na muntu yakaweriti na lirambu, ndo mweni yakalimiti mizyabibu, katindiziya lipamanda na kabawa linegu lya kukamira zyabibu na kanyawiti liringu lya kulolelera. Shakapanu lirambu lya mizyabibu lilii kaliyazimira kwa walimaji, mweni kagenda mwanja gwa kutali. <verse eid="MAT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34" />Shaka sha kubenanga pashisokiti, kawatumiti wantumintumi wakuwi kwa walimaji walii, su watoli semu yakuwi yawabeniti. <verse eid="MAT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35" />Walimaji walii wawakamula wantumintumi wakuwi, yumu wamkomanga, yumonga wamlaga na yumonga wamlaga kwa kumgumanga mabuwi. <verse eid="MAT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36" />Muntu ulii kawatuma kayi wantumintumi wamonga wavuwa, kuliku wa kwanja, walimaji walii watenda ntambu ira ilii. <verse eid="MAT 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37" />Upeleru kamtuma mwana gwakuwi kugenda kwa womberi pakalihola, ‘Nakaka hawampikiniri mwana gwangu.’ <verse eid="MAT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38" />Kumbiti walimaji walii pawamwoniti mwana gwakuwi, walitakuziyana weni kwa weni, ‘Ayu ndo muhala gwakuwi. Mwizi tumlagi na uhala wakuwi hauweri watwenga!’ <verse eid="MAT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39" />Su, wambata na wamlaviya kunja kulirambu lilii lya mizyabibu na wamlaga.”<verse eid="MAT 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40" />Yesu kawakosiya, “Vinu, mweni kana lirambu lya mizyabibu pakiza, hakawatendi hashi walimaji walii?”<verse eid="MAT 21:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41" />Womberi wamwakula, “Hakawalagi woseri yawatenditi vidoda na lirambu lilii hakawapanani walimaji wamonga, ndo weni hawamupanani semu yakuwi yawavibena kwa shaka sha kubenanga.”<verse eid="MAT 21:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42" />Yesu kawagambira, “Hashi, hamwebetuli shawalembiti Mumalembu Managala?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">‘Libuwi lyawalilemiti wanyawa numba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">vinu liwera libuwi lyaliwera na mana nentu kuliku mabuwi goseri.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">Mtuwa ndo yakatenditi shitwatira ashi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">shitwatira sha kulikangasha nentu kwa twenga!’ ”<verse eid="MAT 21:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43" />Yesu kongera kutakula, “Su nuwagambirani, Ufalumi wa Mlungu hawawawusiyi kwa mwenga na kuwapanani wantu yawalera mabwajubwaju gaherepa. <verse eid="MAT 21:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44" />Yoseri yakaguwa pa libuwi ali hakamegeki vipandi vipandi na libuwi palimguwira muntu yoseri, halimupekesi.”<verse eid="MAT 21:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45" />Watambika wakulu na Mafalisayu pawapikaniriti mifanu ya Yesu na wavimaniti kuwera yomberi kaweriti kankuwalonga weni. <verse eid="MAT 21:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46" />Su wajeriti kusakula ntambu ya kumkamula Yesu. Kumbiti womberi watiriti lipinga lya wantu lyawamaniti kuwera Yesu ndo mbuyi gwa Mlungu.<verse eid="MAT 21:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22" />
  <para style="s">1 Mfanu gwa msambu gwa ndowa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 14:15-24">Luka 14:15-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1" />Yesu katakuliti nawomberi kayi kwa mfanu. <verse eid="MAT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2" />“Ufalumi wa kumpindi ulifana ntambu ayi. Kuweriti na mfalumi yakamtandiriti mwana gwakuwi mpalu msambu gwa ndowa. <verse eid="MAT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3" />Su, kawatumiti wantumintumi wakuwi wakawashemi walii yawashemiritwi wizi kumsambu, kumbiti walii yawashemiritwi walemiti kwiza. <verse eid="MAT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4" />Kawatuma kayi wantumintumi wamonga, pakatakula, ‘Muwagambiri yawawashemiriti kuwera msambu gwangu vinu gwa kala, wang'ombi wangu na wandama waherepa wawalikitula kala. Shila shintu shiwera kala, su mwizi mumsambu gwa ndowa!’ <verse eid="MAT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5" />Kumbiti wahenga yawashemiritwi walishera ndiri, su wendereyiti na vitwatira vyawu, yumu kagenditi kulirambu kwakuwi na yumonga kagenditi kutenda biyashala yakuwi, <verse eid="MAT 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6" />na wamonga wawakamula wantumintumi walii, wawakomanga na kuwalaga. <verse eid="MAT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7" />Mfalumi ulii kakalariti nentu, su kawatuma wanjagila wakuwi wakawalagi woseri yawatenditi hangu na kapambira motu lushi zyawu. <verse eid="MAT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8" />Shakapanu kawagambira wantumintumi wakuwi, ‘Msambu gwa ndowa gwa kala, kumbiti yawashemiritwi walema kwiza. <verse eid="MAT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9" />Vinu mgendi munjira pamwawona wantu woseri mwashemi wizi mumsambu gwa ndowa.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10" />Su wantumintumi walii wawuka na wagenda munjira, wawashemera wantu woseri yawawoniti, wadoda na waheri, numba yoseri ya msambu ivuwiti wahenga.<verse eid="MAT 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11" />“Mfalumi pakayingiriti kuwalola wahenga, kamwona muntu kavala ndiri nguwu ya ndowa. <verse eid="MAT 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12" />Mfalumi kamkosiya, ‘Ganja, gwingira hashi panu pota kuvala nguwu ya ndowa?’ Kumbiti yomberi kawankula ndiri. <verse eid="MAT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13" />Palaa palii mfalumi kawagambira wantumintumi, ‘Mumtawi magulu na mawoku, mwakamwasi kunja muntiti. Aku hakalili na kugayagaya menu gakuwi.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14" />Na Yesu kamalira kwa kutakula, “Yawashemiritwi wavuwa, kumbiti yawasyagulitwi ndo wadidini.”<verse eid="MAT 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mafundu kuusu kulipa kodi kwa Kayisari</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mariku 12:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luka 20:20-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15" />Shakapanu Mafalisayu wagenda zawu na waliholiti ntambu ya kumgomiziya Yesu kwa visoweru vyakuwi. <verse eid="MAT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16" />Su, womberi wawatuma wafundwa wawu pamuhera na wantumintumi wa shipinga sha Herodi kugenda kwa Yesu. Womberi walonga, “Mfunda, tuvimana handa gwenga gutakula nakaka. Gwenga gufunda nakaka kuusu mafiliru ga Mlungu kwa wantu, gutira ndiri shawalihola wamonga, toziya gulishera ndiri ukulu wa muntu. <verse eid="MAT 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17" />Su, gutugambiri, gwenga gulihola shishi? Lagaliru ama lagaliru ndiri kulipa kodi kwa Kaisari?”<verse eid="MAT 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18" />Kumbiti Yesu kavimana ukondola wawu yawalihola, su kawagambira, “Mwawafyangu mwenga! Iwera hashi mwankujera kungomiziya? <verse eid="MAT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19" />Munanguziyi mpiya zya kulipira kodi!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:19">Womberi wamlavilira ligwala lya mpiya, <verse eid="MAT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20" />na Yesu kawakosiya, “Sheni na malembu aga mumpiya ga gaa?”<verse eid="MAT 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21" />Womberi wamwankula, “Ga mfalumi gwa Rumi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:21">Su Yesu kawagambira, “Mumpanani Kayisari vyaviwera vya Kayisari na mumpanani Mlungu vyaviwera vya Mlungu.”<verse eid="MAT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22" />Pawapikaniriti hangu, walikangasha na wamleka wagenditi zawu.<verse eid="MAT 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mafundu kuusu kuzyuka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mariku 12:18-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luka 20:27-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23" />Lishaka liraa lilii, Masadukayu wamu ndo yawatakulaga wantu yawahowiti hapeni wazyuki, wamgenderiti Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24" />Su wamgambira, “Mfunda, Musa katakuriti kuwera muntu yakayugiti pakahowa pota kuleka mwana, ndo mlongu gwakuwi kamyugi mdala mkenja uliya, su kamleleri wana mlongu gwakuwi yakahowiti. <verse eid="MAT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25" />Vinu petu panu, paweriti na walongu saba. Mlongu mkulu kayugiti mdala na kahowiti pota kupata mwana, su mlongu gwakuwi kamuhala mkenja ulii. <verse eid="MAT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26" />Iwera ntambu ira kwa mlongu gwa pili na gwa tatu mpaka kwa woseri saba. <verse eid="MAT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27" />Lupeleru na mdala uliya kahowiti viraa. <verse eid="MAT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28" />Vinu, mulishaka lya kuzyuka kwa yawahowiti, hashi, mdala ayu hakaweri mdala gwa gaa? Toziya mkenja ayu kaweriti mdala wa walongu woseri saba.”<verse eid="MAT 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29" />Yesu kawankula, “Mwenga mwagamila nakaka! Mwagamila toziya mgamana ndiri Malembu Mananagala ama makakala ga Mlungu. <verse eid="MAT 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30" />Toziya yawahowiti pawazyuka, hawalifani gambira wantumintumi wa kumpindi kwa Mlungu na wantu hapeni wayugi ama kuyugwa. <verse eid="MAT 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31" />Kumbiti kuusu kuzyuka kwa yawahowiti, hashi, hamwenibetuli galaa Mlungu gakawagambiriti? Mlungu kawagambiriti, <verse eid="MAT 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32" />‘Neni ndo Mlungu gwa Aburahamu, ndo Mlungu gwa Isaka, ndo Mlungu gwa Yakobu!’ Yomberi Mlungu gwa wahowiti ndiri, ira Mlungu gwa wakomu.” <verse eid="MAT 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33" />Lipinga lya wantu palipikaniriti hangu walikangasha mafundu gakuwi.<verse eid="MAT 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lilagaliru likulu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Mariku 12:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luka 10:25-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34" />Mafalisayu pawapikaniriti handa Yesu kawawankula Masadukayu mpaka wasinditi kumkosiya kayi, su womberi waliwoniti pamuhera. <verse eid="MAT 22:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35" />Yumu gwawu, mfunda gwa Malagaliru, kamkosiya Yesu kwa kufira kumgomiziya, <verse eid="MAT 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36" />“mfunda, lilagaliru lyoshi ndo likulu Mumalagaliru?”<verse eid="MAT 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37" />Yesu kamwankula, “Gumfiri Mtuwa Mlungu gwaku kwa moyu gwaku gwoseri, kwa rohu yaku yoseri na kwa mahala gaku goseri.” <verse eid="MAT 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38" />Ali ndo lilagaliru likulu lya kwanja. <verse eid="MAT 22:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39" />Na lya pili lilifana na ali, “Gumfiri gwapakwegera gwaku ntambu yagulifira gumweni.” <verse eid="MAT 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40" />Malagaliru goseri ga Musa na malembu ga wambuyi wa Mlungu gankulitumbira malagaliru mawili aga.<verse eid="MAT 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Likosiwu kuusu Kristu Mlopoziya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mariku 12:35-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luka 20:41-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41" />Mafalisayu pawaweriti pamuhera, Yesu kawakosiiti, <verse eid="MAT 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42" />“Mwenga mulihola hashi kuusu Kristu Mlopoziya? Hashi, yomberi ndo gwa shiyiwuku shagaa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:42">Wamwankula, “Shiyiwuku sha Dawudi.”<verse eid="MAT 22:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43" />Yesu kawagambira, “Su, iwezekana hashi kwa likakala lya Rohu Mnanagala Dawudi kamshemi yomberi ‘Mtuwa’? Dawudi katakuliti,<verse eid="MAT 22:43" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44" />‘Mtuwa kamgambiriti Mtuwa gwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 22:44">Gulivagi uwega waneni wa kumliwu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 22:44">Mpaka nuwatuli wangondu waku pasi pa magulu gaku.’<verse eid="MAT 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45" />Payiwera Dawudi kamshemiti yomberi ‘Mtuwa,’ su iwezakana hashi kuwera Kristu ndo gwa shiyiwuku sha Dawudi?”<verse eid="MAT 22:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46" />Kwahera muntu yoseri yakaweziti kumwankula Yesu na kwanjira lishaka lilii kwahera yakajeriti kayi kukosiya shoseri.<verse eid="MAT 22:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kankuwaberiziya wantumintumi kuusu wafunda wa Malagaliru na Mafalisayu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mariku 12:38-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:37-52">Luka 11:37-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Luka 20:45-47</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1" />Shakapanu Yesu kaligambira lipinga lya wantu pamuhera na wafundwa wakuwi, <verse eid="MAT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2" />“Wafunda wa Malagaliru na Mafalisayu wanauwezu wa kutakulira Malagaliru ga Musa. <verse eid="MAT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3" />Su mfiruwa kujimila na kutenda shoseri shawawagambireni, kumbiti namtenda vyawawatenda weni, toziya watenda ndiri vilii vyawafunda. <verse eid="MAT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4" />Watawa visanka vitopa na kuwatwika wantu, kumbiti weni wasinda ata kutalipisiya shala wapati kupapa. <verse eid="MAT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5" />Womberi wankutenda matendu gawu goseri su wantu wagawoni, wankuvala tepi zilembwa malagaliru kusheni kwawu na mumawoku na wongera mishirashira mumahabiti gawu. <verse eid="MAT 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6" />Wafira kulikala pahala paligoya mumsambu na kulikala viti vya ligoya munumba ya Mlungu. <verse eid="MAT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7" />Wafira wawalamsiyi kwa ligoya pahala pa soku na wafira wantu wawashemi, ‘Mfunda.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8" />Kumbiti mwenga namshemwa ‘mfunda,’ toziya mfunda gwenu yumu hera, na woseri mwenga mwawalongu. <verse eid="MAT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9" />Ama namumshema muntu yoseri ‘Tati’ pasipanu, toziya mwana Tati yumu hera kumpindi. <verse eid="MAT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10" />Namshemwa ‘Walonguziya,’ toziya mwana mlonguziya yumu hera ndo Kristu Mlopoziya. <verse eid="MAT 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11" />Yakawera mkulu pakati penu mpaka kaweri ntumintumi gwenu. <verse eid="MAT 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12" />Yakalikwisa hawamsulusiyi na yakalisulusiya mweni, hakakwiswi.”<verse eid="MAT 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankuukalipira ufyangu wawu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:40">Mariku 12:40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:39-42">Luka 11:39-42</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 11:44">44</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 11:52">52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:47">Luka 20:47</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13" />“Shondi wafunda wa Malagaliru na Mafalisayu, mwawafyangu mwenga! Mwankutata mlyangu gwa Ufalumi wa kumpindi palaa wantu pawafiriti kwingira, kumbiti maweni mwenga mwingira ndiri na muwajimira ndiri wantu yawajera kwingira. <verse eid="MAT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:14" />Shondi wafunda wa Malagaliru na Mafalisayu, mwawafyangu mwenga! Mwankuwayonga wakenja nakuwapoka numba zawu na mwankulilanguziya kusali sala ntali! Toziya ya hangu hampati azabu nkulu nentu!”<verse eid="MAT 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15" />“Shondi wafunda wa Malagaliru na Mafalisayu, mwawafyangu mwenga! Mwankugenda mwanja mulitanda na paisi su mpati muntu yumu yakajimira ntambu yamjimira. Pamumpata, mumtenda mala mbili kaweri muntu gwa kugenda mumotu gwa jehanamu kuliku maweni mwenga.”<verse eid="MAT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16" />Shondi walongoziya mwana lwisi! Mwenga mfunda muntu pakalilapira kwa Numba nkulu ya Mlungu, kulilapira aku shintu ndiri, kumbiti pakalirapa kwa zahabu Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu, kulirapira aku kumkola. <verse eid="MAT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17" />Mwenga mwanalwisi wazigizigi! Shoshi shana mana nentu, zahabu ama Numba nkulu ya Mlungu yayitenda zahabu iweri nanagala? <verse eid="MAT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18" />Kayi mfunda, muntu pakalirapira pashitalawanda sha kutambikira, shintu ndiri, kumbiti pakalirapira kwa lifupu lyawalituliti pashitalawanda sha kutambikira, kulirapa aku hakumkoli. <verse eid="MAT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19" />Mwenga mwawa lwisi! Shoshi sha mana nentu, lifupu lilii, ama pashitalawanda sha kutambikira peni patendaga lifupu liweri linanagala? <verse eid="MAT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20" />Muntu yakalilapira kwa pashitalawanda sha kutambikira kalirapa kwa pahala pa kutambikira na mafupu goseri gawatuliti pahala pa kutambikira. <verse eid="MAT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21" />Na yakalirapira kwa Numba nkulu ya Mlungu, kalilapira kwa Numba nkulu ya Mlungu na Mlungu yakalikala amu, <verse eid="MAT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22" />na yoseri yakalirapira kumpindi kwa Mlungu, su kalilapira kwa shibanta sha shifalumi sha Mlungu na kwa Mlungu yakalivagira. <verse eid="MAT 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23" />“Shondi wafunda wa Malagaliru na Mafalisayu, mwawafyangu mwenga! Mwankuwatoza wantu shintu shimu muvintu lilongu, ata kuusu viungu vya likolu gambira mahamba ganunkira weri na binzari na jira na kumbiti mleka kujimira mafundu ga mana ga Malagaliru, gambira vitendu viheri na lusungu na njimiru. Vitwatila avi vya mana ndo mfiruwa kuvitenda pota na kulyaluwa vyamonga. <verse eid="MAT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24" />Mwenga walongoziya mwana lwisi! Mwankulaviya wavingozi mu vyakulanda, kumbiti mwankumira shingongolu yawamshema ntembu!<verse eid="MAT 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25" />“Shondi wafunda wa Malagaliru na Mafalisayu, mwawafyangu mwenga! Mwankugulula lwindi na bakuli kwa kunja, kumbiti mngati kumema vintu vyampatiti kwa wakwepula na malema. <verse eid="MAT 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26" />Mfalisayu lwisi! Gugulula uhakata huti yawuwera mulwindi na kunja hakuweri kuherepa viraa.<verse eid="MAT 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27" />“Shondi wafunda wa Malagaliru na Mafalisayu, wafyangu mwenga! Muwera gambira mapumba gawatyelemekiti shokaa ndo yeni kwa kunja gawonikana gaherepa, kumbiti mngati imema mifupa ya mawuti na kila ntambu ya kudoda. <verse eid="MAT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28" />Viraa virii kwa kunja mwenga muwoneka mwawaheri, kumbiti mumyoyu mwenu kumema ufyangu na udoda.<verse eid="MAT 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankutunga kutozwa kwawu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 11:47-51">Luka 11:47-51</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29" />“Shondi wafunda wa Malagaliru na Mafalisayu, mwawafyangu mwenga! Mwankunyawira mapumba ga wambuyi wa Mlungu na kugalembera mapumba ga wantu waheri, <verse eid="MAT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:30" />na mlonga, ‘Handa twenga metulikali shaka sha wagogolu wetu metulitangiti ndiri nawomberi kuwalaga wambuyi wa Mlungu!’ <verse eid="MAT 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31" />Su mpitaulira kuwera maweni mwenga ndo wiwuka wawu woseri yawawalagiti wambuyi wa Mlungu! <verse eid="MAT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32" />Su, mumalili shilii shawanjiti wagogolu wenu! <verse eid="MAT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33" />Mwenga wanjoka na wana wa wanjoka! Mwenga namulihola kuwera muweza kushapira kutozwa kwingira mumotu gwa Jehanamu. <verse eid="MAT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34" />Su neni nuwagambirani kuwera hanuwajegeri mwenga wambuyi wa Mlungu. Na wantu wana luhala na wafunda wa Malagaliru ga Musa, hamuwalagi wamu wawu na kuwapingika wamonga na kuwasyatanga ntomondu wamonga munumba za Mlungu na kuwawinga kulawa lushi na lushi. <verse eid="MAT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35" />Vilawilu vya kutoza kwa kuwalaga wantu woseri waheri haiweri kwa mwenga, kwanjira kulagwa kwa Abeli muntu muheri mpaka kulagwa kwa Zakariya mwana gwa Barakiya, Zakariya ndo mweni yamumlagiti pakati pa Numba nkulu ya Mlungu na pashitalawanda sha kutambikira. <verse eid="MAT 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36" />Nakaka nuwagambireni, kutozwa kwa wantu woseri yawawalaga wayawu hakuweri kwa shiyiwuku sha mashaka aga!<verse eid="MAT 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ntambu yakalufiriti lushi lwa Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 13:34-35">Luka 13:34-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37" />“Yerusalemu! Shondi shondi Yerusalemu bamu! Guwalaga wambuyi wa Mlungu, guwagumanga kwa mabuwi walii yawatumitwi kwakuwi! Shaka zivuwa nfira kuwatula wana waku mumawoku mwangu gambira nkuku pakavigupika vyana vyakuwi kwa mbapatiru zyakuwi, kumbiti gwenga gunema! <verse eid="MAT 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38" />Su, Numba nkulu ya Mlungu yaku hailekwi ushiwa. <verse eid="MAT 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39" />Nukugambirani kwanjira vinu, hapeni gumoni kayi mpaka pagutakula, ‘Mlungu gumtekeleri yomberi yakiza mulitawu lya Mtuwa.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kankutakula kuusu kubomolangwa kwa Numba nkulu ya Mlungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Mariku 13:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luka 21:5-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1" />Yesu kalawiti Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu, pakaweriti kankugenda zakuwi, wafundwa wakuwi wamgenderiti wamlanguziya majengu ga Numba nkulu ya Mlungu.<verse eid="MAT 24:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2" />Yesu kawagambira, “Yina, muweza kugalola goseri aga! Nakaka nuwagambirani, kwahera hata libuwi limu halisigali panu pampindi pa libuwi limonga, kila libuwi haliwusiwi.”<verse eid="MAT 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ntabika na ndabiri</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mariku 13:3-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luka 21:7-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3" />Yesu pakalivagiti palugongu lwa Mizeyituni, wafundwa wakuwi wamgenderiti kwa bada, su wamkosiya, “Gutugambiri, hashi vitwatira avi havilawili ndii? Na hashilawiri shishi kulanguziya ndo shaka sha kwiza kwaku na shaka sha upeleru pasipanu.”<verse eid="MAT 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4" />Yesu kawankula,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 24:4">“Mulikali weri, muntu nakiza kuwapayirani. <verse eid="MAT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5" />Wantu wavuwa hawalawili na kulonga kila yumu, ndo Kristu Mlopoziya na hawawazyangi wantu wavuwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6" />Hampikaniri kuusu ngondu pakwegera na visoweru vya ngondu, kumbiti namulihola. Toziya vitwatira mpaka vilawiri, kumbiti upeleru weni wankali kwiza. <verse eid="MAT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7" />Isi yimu hailikomangi na isi yimonga na ufalumi wumu hawulikomangi na ufalumi umonga. Panu na palii hapaweri na njala na malendemeru ga isi kila pahala. <verse eid="MAT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8" />Vitwatila vyoseri avi vilifana gambira kutama pakwanja pakulera mwana.<verse eid="MAT 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9" />“Shakapanu hawawalaviyani su wawatabisiyi na kuwalaga. Isi zoseri haziwakalaliri toziya ya litawu lyaneni. <verse eid="MAT 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10" />Mushaka ashi wantu wavuwa hawaleki myoyu yawu, hawagambulikani weni kwa weni na kukalalirana weni kwa weni. <verse eid="MAT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11" />Hawalawili wambuyi wa upayira, pawapotuziya wantu wavuwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12" />Su vitwatira vifaa ndiri havyongereki, mafiliru ga wantu wavuwa hauweri tisutisu. <verse eid="MAT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13" />Kumbiti muntu yakahepelera mpaka lupeleru hakalopoziwi. <verse eid="MAT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14" />Na Shisoweru Shiwagira sha Ufalumi wa Mlungu hashibweruwi pasipanu poseri muwukapitawu kwa wantu wa makabila goseri na upeleru hawizi.<verse eid="MAT 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uhushu mkulu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:14-23">Mariku 13:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luka 21:20-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15" />“Su, hamuwoni ‘Shintu shidoda shashihalabisiya’ shakatakuliti Danieli mbuyi gwa Mlungu, shigoloka pahala pananagala.” Yakabetula kavimani mana yakuwi! <verse eid="MAT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16" />Panu, yawawera Yudeya su watugili muvigongu. <verse eid="MAT 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17" />Yakawera pashitwiku sha numba nakasuluka kutola shintu mnumba mwakuwi. <verse eid="MAT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18" />Yakaweriti kulirambu nakawuya kumbeli kutola nguwu yakuwi. <verse eid="MAT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19" />Shondi shondi wamawu yawawera na yinda na walii yawanoniziya mumashaka galii! <verse eid="MAT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20" />Mumluwi Mlungu, su kutuga kwa mwenga nakuwera mashaka ga mpepu ama lishaka lya Kwoyera! <verse eid="MAT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21" />Toziya mushaka ashi hakuweri na uhushu mkulu ndoweni wankali kulawira, kwanjira kunyawa kwa pasipanu mpaka leru, wala hapeni ilawiri kayi. <verse eid="MAT 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22" />Kumbiti Mlungu kagapunguriti kala shiyasi sha mashaka aga, mekatendi ndiri, kwahera muntu yoseri mekalikali. Toziya ya wantu yawasyagulitwi, Mlungu hakagapunguli mashaka aga.<verse eid="MAT 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23" />“Su, muntu yoseri pakawagambirani, ‘Guloli Kristu Mlopoziya kapanu’ ama ‘Kapalii!’ Namjimira. <verse eid="MAT 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24" />Hawalawili ashina Kristu wa upayira na wambuyi wa upayira, hawatendi mauzauza makulu na gakulikangasha su wawazyangi payiwezekana ata yawasyagulitwi na Mlungu. <verse eid="MAT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25" />Mpikanili! Nuwagambirani pamberi pa shaka kwiza.<verse eid="MAT 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26" />“Ama, pawawagambirani, ‘Mloli, ka kushiwala!’ Namgenda aku, ama pawalonga, ‘Mloli, kalififa panu!’ Namjimira. <verse eid="MAT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27" />Mwana gwa Muntu hakizi gambira gulangala gambira lumeta kulyera kulawa kwagulawa mshenji mpaka kwaguzyeta mshenji.<verse eid="MAT 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28" />“Palii paweriti na shashifuwiti, ndo pawajojinika wandapu.”<verse eid="MAT 24:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwiza kwa Mwana gwa Muntu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mariku 13:24-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luka 21:25-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29" />“Palaa palii, pa mashaka ga kutabisiya, mshenji haguweri ntiti, na lyezi haliweri ndiri na ulangala na ntondu hazituluki kulawa kulyera na likakala lya kumpindi halilibegizii. <verse eid="MAT 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30" />Shakapanu, lilangaliru lya Mwana gwa Muntu halilawiri kulyera na wantu woseri wa pasipanu hawalili pawamwona Mwana gwa Muntu pakiza mumawundi ga kumpindi pamuhera na makakala makulu. <verse eid="MAT 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31" />Mliru mkulu gwa mbalapi hagupikaniki na yomberi hakawatumi wantumintumi wa kumpindi wakuwi muwega za msheshi za pasipanu na hawawajojiniri wantu kulawa lupeleru lumu lwa pasipanu mpaka lupeleru lumonga lwa pasipanu.<verse eid="MAT 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfanu gwa Mkuyu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mariku 13:28-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luka 21:29-33</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32" />“Mleki mtera gwa mkuyu guwafundi. Mitambi ya mitera payiyanja kutomola mahamba, muvimani kuwera shaka sha kutowa vula shapakwegera. <verse eid="MAT 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33" />Ntambu ira ayi mwenga pamwona vitwatira vyoseri avi, muvimani handa shaka shapakwegera nentu. <verse eid="MAT 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34" />Muliholi kuwera vitwatira vyoseri avi havilawili pamberi pa kuhowa wantu yawalikala vinu. <verse eid="MAT 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35" />Kumpindi kwa Mlungu na pasipanu hazipiti, kumbiti visoweru vyaneni hapeni vipiti.<verse eid="MAT 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwahera muntu yakavimana lishaka ama lisaa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:32-37">Mariku 13:32-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:26-30">Luka 17:26-30</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 17:34-36">34-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36" />“Kwahera muntu yoseri yakavimana lishaka ama lisaa paviza, ama wantumintumi wa kumpindi kwa Mlungu ama Mwana. Tati gweka yakuwi ndo yakavimana. <verse eid="MAT 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37" />Kwiza kwa Mwana gwa Muntu hakuweri gambira shilii shashilawiriti mushaka sha Nuhu. <verse eid="MAT 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38" />Mumashaka galii pamberi pa wantu kuhowa mumafuriku waweriti wankuliya na kulanda, wantu waweriti wankuwayuga na kuyugwa mpaka Nuhu pakingiriti muuwatu, <verse eid="MAT 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39" />wavimaniti ndiri hashilawiri shishi mpaka mafuliku pagiziti na kuwajola woseri. Ntambu ayi hayiweri pakiza Mwana gwa Muntu. <verse eid="MAT 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40" />Shaka ashi wantu wawili hawaweri mulirambu, yumu hakatolwi na yumonga hakalekwi. <verse eid="MAT 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41" />Wadala wawili hawaweri wankuwaga usaka palwala, yumu hakatolwi na yumonga hakalekwi.<verse eid="MAT 24:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42" />“Su gulikali weri, toziya guvimana ndiri lishaka lya kwiza Mtuwa gwenu. <verse eid="MAT 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43" />Handa yakana numba mekavimani shaka sha kwiza kwa mpoka, mekalikali masu na mekaleki ndiri mpoka kabomolangi numba yakuwi. <verse eid="MAT 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44" />Su na mwenga viraa muweri kala, toziya Mwana gwa Muntu hakizi mulisaa lyagulimana ndiri.”<verse eid="MAT 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ntumintumi yakaaminika ama ntumintumi yakaminika ndiri</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 12:41-48">Luka 12:41-48</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45" />“Yesu kendeleyiti kutakula, Ndo gaa ntumintumi yakaaminika na kana luhala, ndo mtuwa gwakuwi hakamtuli pampindi pa wantu wakuwi, kawapanani shiboga kwa shaka shakuwi? <verse eid="MAT 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46" />Mbaka ntumintumi uliya mweni mtuwa gwakuwi pakiza hakamwoni kankutenda hangu. <verse eid="MAT 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47" />Nukugambirani nakaka, hakamtuli ntumintumi ayu kagolokeri ulunda wakuwi woseri. <verse eid="MAT 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48" />Kumbiti handa ndo ntumintumi kadoda, hakaligambiziyi mweni kuwera mtuwa gwakuwi hakakawi kuwuya, <verse eid="MAT 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49" />na hakanji kuwakomanga wantumintumi wayaguwi na kanja kuliya na kulanda pamuhera na waloweru. <verse eid="MAT 24:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50" />Shakapanu mtuwa gwakuwi ntumintumi ulii pakizaku lishaka lyankali kulimana na shaka shakashimana ndiri. <verse eid="MAT 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51" />Mtuwa hakamwazibu nentu na kumtula shipinga shimu na wafyangu. Aku hakalili na kugayagaya menu gakuwi.”<verse eid="MAT 24:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25" />
  <para style="s">Mfanu gwa walii lilongu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1" />“Shaka ashi Ufalumi wa kumpindi ulifana hangu. Kuweriti na walii lilongu yawatoliti koloboyi zawu na wagenditi kumwanka mpalu gwa ndowa. <verse eid="MAT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2" />Wamuhanu wamu waweriti na mahala na wamuhanu wamonga waweriti wazigizigi. <verse eid="MAT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3" />Wazigizigi walii watoliti koloboyi zyawu pota kutola mafuta ga motu ga shigubukiru. <verse eid="MAT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4" />Kumbiti wanaluhala walii watoliti mafuta ga motu gatosha msupa zyawu. <verse eid="MAT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5" />Mpalu gwa ndowa kakawiti kwiza, su walii woseri wanjiti kusizira na wagonjiti.<verse eid="MAT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6" />“Paiweriti kala lugonu kuweriti mashowanganu, ‘Aya aya mpalu gwa ndowa! Mgendi mwakamwanki!’ <verse eid="MAT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7" />Walii lilongu walii wimuka na wazitandira koloboyi zyawu. <verse eid="MAT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8" />Shakapanu wazigizigi walii wawagambira wanaluhala walii, ‘Mtupungulili mafuta ga motu, toziya koloboyi zya twenga zankugenda kutenda tiya.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9" />Wanaluhala walii wawankula, ‘Ndala, toziya mafuta ga motu gatutosha ndiri twenga pamuhera na mwenga. Mgendi kuvikolija mwakahemeri maweni.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10" />Su wazigizigi walii pawagenditi kuhemera mafuta ga motu, mpalu gwa ndowa kasoka. Na walii wamuhanu walii yawaweriti kala wingiriti pamuhera na mpalu gwa ndowa mnumba ya msambu na shakapanu ligomi litatwa.<verse eid="MAT 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11" />“Shakapanu walii wamonga walii wawuya. Su womberi wabotanga, ‘Mtuwa, mtuwa! Gutuvuguliri ligomi!’ <verse eid="MAT 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12" />Nayomberi hakawankuli, ‘Ndala, nuwamana ndiri mwenga!’ ”<verse eid="MAT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13" />Na Yesu kamalaliriti kwa kutakula, “Mulikali weri, toziya muvimana ndiri lishaka ama lisaa.”<verse eid="MAT 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfanu gwa wantumintumi watatu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 19:11-27">Luka 19:11-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14" />“Shaka shilii Ufalumi wa Mlungu haulifani hangu. Kweniti muntu yumu yakafiriti kugenda mwanja, kawashema wantumintumi wakuwi na kawatula waloleri ulunda wakuwi. <verse eid="MAT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15" />Kamupiti kila muntu kulawirana na uwezu wakuwi, yumu kamupiti mihaku muhanu ya mpiya na yumonga kamupiti mihaku miwili ya mpiya na yumonga kamupiti muhaku gumu gwa mpiya. Su kawuka kagenda mwanja. <verse eid="MAT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16" />Ntumintumi yakawankiti mihaku muhanu ya mpiya kazitendera lihengu mpiya zilii kapata mota mihaku muhanu imonga. <verse eid="MAT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17" />Ntambu iraa ayi ntumintumi yakawankiti mihaku miwili ya mpiya kapatiti mota mihaku imonga miwili ya mpiya. <verse eid="MAT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18" />Kumbiti ntumintumi yakawankiti muhaku gumu gwa mpiya kagutula, kagenda kabawa lirindi mulitapaka, kazififa mpiya zya Mtuwa gwakuwi.<verse eid="MAT 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19" />“Pashaka shivuwa mtuwa gwa wantumintumi woseri kawuyiti na kutenda mawalanga pamuhera nawomberi. <verse eid="MAT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20" />Ntumintumi yakatoliti mihaku muhanu ya mpiya kiza kajega mihaku imonga ya mpiya. Kalonga, ‘Mtuwa guloli!’ Gunupiti mihaku muhanu ya mpiya, panu kwana mihaku muhanu imonga yaiyongelekiti. <verse eid="MAT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21" />Mtuwa kalonga, ‘Gutenda weri, gwenga gwamuheri na ntumintumi gwaminika! Guwera mwaminika mushitwatira shididiki, su hanikutuli guloleri vitwatira vikulu. Gwizi tunemeleli pamuhera!’<verse eid="MAT 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22" />“Shakapanu ntumintumi yakawankiti mihaku miwili ya mpiya kiziti na kulonga, ‘Mtuwa, gunupiti mihaku miwili ya mpiya. Guloli! Panu pana mihaku miwili imonga yaiyongelekiti.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23" />Mtuwa gwakuwi kalonga, ‘Gutenda weri, gwenga gwamuheri na ntumintumi mwaminika!’ Gwenga gwaminika mushitwatila shididiki, hanukutuli guloleri vitwatira vikulu. Gwizi panu tunemeleli pamuhera!<verse eid="MAT 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24" />“Shakapanu ntumintumi yakawankiti muhaku gumu gwa mpiya kiza na kulonga, ‘Mtuwa, nuvimana kuwera gwenga gwa muntu gukalipa, gubena shilii shaguyala ndiri na gujonjonira vyagukwetiti ndiri. <verse eid="MAT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25" />Ntiriti, su ng'enditi na nugufifa muhaku gwa mpiya zyaku.’<verse eid="MAT 25:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26" />“Mtuwa gwakuwi kamgambira, ‘Gwenga gwa ntumintumi mdoda na mleri! Guvimana handa neni mbena pota na kuyala na njojinira pota na kukweta. <verse eid="MAT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27" />Sawa, ifiruwitwi gutuli mpiya ya neni mubenki na neni mentoliti mpiya zyangu pamuhera na mbotu yakuwi! <verse eid="MAT 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28" />Vinu, mumpoki mpiya azi mumpanani ulii yakana mihaku lilongu ya mpiya. <verse eid="MAT 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29" />Toziya muntu yoseri yakawera na shintu hawamupanani na kumwongera, kumbiti ulii yakahera shintu, ata shididini shilii shakaweriti nashu hawampoki. <verse eid="MAT 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30" />Na kuusu ntumintumi ulii yakahera mana, mumwasi kunja muntiti, aku hakalili na kuyagaya menu gakuwi.’”<verse eid="MAT 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutoza kuupeleru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31" />“Mwana gwa Muntu ndomweni Mfalumi pakiza muukwisa wakuwi pamuhera na wantumintumi wa kumpindi wakuwi wananagala, hakalivagi mushibanta shakuwi sha shifalumi muukwisa wakuwi. <verse eid="MAT 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32" />Wantu wa isi zoseri hawajojiniki kulongolu kwakuwi. Na yomberi hakawatuli muvipinga viwili, gambira mlolera mifugu ntambu yakawatulaga gweka wakondolu kulawa mushipinga sha wambuzi. <verse eid="MAT 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33" />Hakawatuli wantu yawatenda ntambu yakafiriti Mlungu uwega wakuwi wa kumliwu na yawatenditi vidoda uwega wakuwi wa kumshigi. <verse eid="MAT 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34" />Shakapanu Mfalumi hakawagambiri wantu walii wa uwega wakuwi wa kumliwu, Mwizi, mwenga mtekeleritwi na Tati gwangu! Mwizi na muwuwanki ufalumi yawakutandirani kwanjira pakunyawa pasipanu. <verse eid="MAT 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35" />Pahweriti na njala mwenga munupiti shiboga, panyumuluwiti mwenga mnupiti mashi, nweriti muhenga mwenga mshemera ukaya kwenu, <verse eid="MAT 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36" />nweriti shivula hera munvalasiya, nweriti ndwala mwenga munwaziya, nweriti wantatira mushibetubetu mwenga mwiza kutyangira.”<verse eid="MAT 25:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37" />“Shakapanu wantu yawamfiriziya Mlungu hamwankuli, ‘Mtuwa, tukuwona koshi gwana njala na twenga tukupiti shiboga, ama guweriti guyumuluwa na twenga tukulandasiya mashi? <verse eid="MAT 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38" />Ndii tukuwoniti gwamuhenga na twenga tukushemera ukaya, ama gwashivula na twenga tukuvalasiya? <verse eid="MAT 25:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39" />Tukuwoniti ndii gulwala ama gwamushibetubetu na twenga twiza kukulola?’ <verse eid="MAT 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40" />Mfalumi hakawankuli, ‘Nukugambirani nakaka, kila shintu shamumtendiriti yumu gwa wapusu wangu awa muntendera neni!’<verse eid="MAT 25:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41" />“Shakapanu hakawagambiri walii yawaweriti uwega wa kumshigi, ‘Muwuki kulongolu kwa neni, mwenga mpangirwiti na Mlungu! Mgendi mumotu gwa gutenda tiya ndiri gwawamtandiriti Shetani na wantumintumi wakuwi! <verse eid="MAT 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42" />Nweriti na njala, mwenga mnupa ndiri shiboga, nweriti nyumluwa, mwenga mnupa ndiri mashi. <verse eid="MAT 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43" />Nweriti namuhenga, mwenga munshemiriti ndiri ukaya kwenu, nweriti shivula hera, mwenga munvalasiya ndiri, nweriti ndwaliti na wantatira mushibetubetu, mwenga mwiza ndiri kuntyangira.’<verse eid="MAT 25:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44" />“Shakapanu wamwankula, ‘Ndii, Mtuwa, tukuwoniti gwana njala ama guyumluwa, na gwamuhenga ama gwashivula ama gulwala ama gwamushibetubetu, na twenga twiza ndiri kukutanga?’ <verse eid="MAT 25:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45" />Mfalumi hakawankuli, ‘Nuwagambirani, kila pamlemiti kumtanga yumu gwa wapusu awa, mlemiti kuntanga neni.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46" />Shakapanu womberi, hawagendi muntabiku ya mashaka goseri, kumbiti wantu yawamfiriziya Mlungu hawagendi muukomu wa mashaka goseri.”<verse eid="MAT 25:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26" />
  <para style="s">Mpangu gwa kumlaga Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mariku 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luka 22:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yohani 11:45-53</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1" />Shaka Yesu pakamalariti kufunda vitwatira vyoseri avi, kawagambiriti wafundwa wakuwi, <verse eid="MAT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2" />“Pamashaka mawili muvimana, hapaweri na msambu gwa Pasaka, na Mwana gwa Muntu hawamkamuli su wampingiki mulupingika.” Msambu gwa Pasaka guweriti gwa kulihola ntambu Waisraeli pawawalopoziya kulawa muufalumi wa Farawu.<verse eid="MAT 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3" />Shakapanu watambika wakulu pamuhera na wazewi waliwoniti pamuhera muukumbi wa Kayafa, Mkulu gwa Watambika. <verse eid="MAT 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4" />Wasakuliti ntambu ya kumkamula Yesu kwa bada su wamlagi. <verse eid="MAT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5" />Womberi watakuliti, “Shitwatira ashi nashitendeka shaka sha msambu gwa Pasaka toziya wantu hawatendi ndewu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wankumswaga lipaki Kubetaniya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mariku 14:3-9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yohani 12:1-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6" />Yesu kaweriti Betaniya, ukaya kwa Simoni, muntu yakalwaliti ungumbula. <verse eid="MAT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7" />Yesu pakaweriti kankuliya shiboga, mdala yumu kamgenderiti pakaweriti na supa ya alabasta yayimemiti utuli wa mpiya zivuwa, kammiminira mumtuwi mwakuwi. <verse eid="MAT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8" />Wafundwa wakuwi pawawoniti hangu, wakalala na wamkosiya, “Iwera ashi kwananga goseri aga?” <verse eid="MAT 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9" />“Utuli awu meuwuzwi kwa mpiya zivuwa na kuwapanani wahushu!”<verse eid="MAT 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10" />Yesu kavimati shawashiyowera su kawagambira, “Iwera ashi mwankumgaziya mdala ayu? Shakantendiriti ndo shiherepa kwaneni. <verse eid="MAT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11" />Wantu wahushu mwanawu mashaka goseri, kumbiti neni hapeni hweri na mwenga mashaka goseri. <verse eid="MAT 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12" />Shakatenditi mdala ayu kumiminira utuli awu munshimba mwangu su katandira kusilwa kwaneni. <verse eid="MAT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13" />Vinu nuwagambirani nakaka, poseri pawabwera Shisoweru Shiwagira pasipanu, shitwatira shakatenditi mdala ayu hashitakulwi, na wantu hawamuholi.”<verse eid="MAT 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda kankujimila kumgalambuka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Mariku 14:10-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luka 22:3-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14" />Shakapanu yumu gwa wantumintumi lilongu na mbili, litawu lyakuwi Yuda Isikariyoti su kagenda kwa watambika wakulu <verse eid="MAT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15" />na kawakosiyiti, “Hamnupi shishi handa panumgalambuki Yesu kwa mwenga?” Womberi wamuwalangiriti magwala ga shaba malongu matatu na kumupa. <verse eid="MAT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16" />Na kwanjira shaka shilii Yuda kaweriti kankusakula lupenyu luherepa lwa kumgalambuka Yesu kwa womberi.<verse eid="MAT 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankuliya shiboga sha Pasaka pamuhera na wantumintumi wakuwi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mariku 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-13">Luka 22:7-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yohani 13:21-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17" />Lishaka lya kwanja pamberi pa msambu gwa mabumunda galekerwa ndiri simika, wafundwa wamgenderiti Yesu na kumkosiya, “Gufira twakakutandiri koshi shiboga sha Pasaka?”<verse eid="MAT 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18" />Yesu kawagambira, “Mgendi mlushi kwa muntu yumu ayu mwakamgambiri, ‘Mfunda kalonga, Shaka shangu shisoka, handiyi shiboga sha Pasaka pamuhera na wafundwa wangu, ukaya kwaku.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19" />Wafundwa watenda handa Yesu ntambu yakawagambiriti watandiri shiboga sha Pasaka.<verse eid="MAT 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20" />Shaka payiweriti pamihi, Yesu na wantumintumi wakuwi lilongu na wawili walivaga kuliya shiboga. <verse eid="MAT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21" />Pawaweriti wankuliya Yesu kalonga, “Nuwagambirani yumu gwenu hakang'alambuki.”<verse eid="MAT 26:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22" />Wantumintumi wahinginika nentu wanja kulikosiya yumu yumu, “Mtuwa hashi ndo neni?”<verse eid="MAT 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23" />Yesu kawankula, “Yakashwika ndolonji mubakuli pamuhera na neni ndo hakang'alambuki. <verse eid="MAT 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24" />Mwana gwa Muntu hakahowi gambira Malembu Mananagala ntambu yagatakula, kumbiti oli wakuwi muntu ayu yakamgalambuka Mwana gwa Muntu! Iweri mbaka kwa muntu ayu handa mekayiwuki ndiri!”<verse eid="MAT 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25" />Yuda mgalambuka kamkosiya, “mfunda ndo neni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:25">Yesu kamwankula, “Yina, gwenga ndo gutakula.”<verse eid="MAT 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shiboga sha Mtuwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mariku 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-23">Luka 22:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Wakorintu 11:23-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26" />Pawaweriti wankuliya, Yesu katoliti libumunda, kalonga mayagashii Mlungu, kalimega na kawapanana wafundwa wakuwi, pakalonga, “Mtoli mlii, ayi ndo nshimba ya neni.”<verse eid="MAT 26:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27" />Shakapanu katola lwindi na kalonga mayagashii Mlungu, kawapanani pakalonga, “Mlandi woseri mwenga, <verse eid="MAT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28" />agu ndo mwazi gwangu, gwagulanguziya lipatanu lya Mlungu kwa wantu wakuwi, mwazi gwaguyitika kwajili ya wantu wavuwa kuwalekiziya vidoda. <verse eid="MAT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29" />Nuwagambirani, hanandi kayi ndiri divayi ya mzyabibu mpaka lishaka lilii pananda divayi yasyayi pamuhera na mwenga Muufalumi wa Tati gwangu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30" />Shakapanu womberi wimbiti lwimbu na wawuka wagenditi kulugongu lwa Mizeyituni.<verse eid="MAT 26:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankutunga handa Peteru hakamlemi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mariku 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luka 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yohani 13:36-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31" />Shakapanu Yesu kawagambira, “Leru pashiru panu mawoseri mwenga hamtugi na kundeka neni, ntambu ya Malembu Mananagala galonga, ‘Mlungu kalonga, hakamlagi mlolera mifugu na wakondolu wa shipinga hawapalanganyiki.’ <verse eid="MAT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32" />Kumbiti panzyukaku, hanuwalongoleri kugenda ku Galilaya.” <verse eid="MAT 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33" />Peteru kamgambira Yesu, “Neni hapeni nukuleki gwenga ata woseri pawakulema!”<verse eid="MAT 26:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34" />Yesu kamgambira Peteru, “Nukugambira, pashiru pamberi njogolu hakeniwiki, hagunemi mala ntatu kuwera gumana ndiri neni.”<verse eid="MAT 26:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35" />Peteru kamwankula, “Ata panfiruwa kuhowa pamuhera na gwenga, hapeni nukulemi nakamu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:35">Na wafundwa wamonga woseri watakula ntambu iraa ayi.<verse eid="MAT 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankusali mushiwunga sha Getisemani</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mariku 14:32-42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luka 22:39-46</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36" />Shakapanu Yesu kagenditi pamuhera na wafundwa wakuwi pahala pawapashemapu Getisemani na kawagambira, “Mulivagi panu neni ng'enda palongolu palii na kuluwa.” <verse eid="MAT 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37" />Kawatola Peteru na wana wawili wa Zebedayu, kanja kuhinginika na kushashatika, <verse eid="MAT 26:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38" />na kawagambira womberi, “Moyu guntama nentu sambira nfuwi. Mulivagi panu na mwikali masu pamuhera naneni.”<verse eid="MAT 26:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39" />Su kagenda kulongolu kidogu, kasuntama makukama na kuluwa, “Tati gwangu, handa payiwezekana, guwusiyi lwindi alu lwa ntabikui kwaneni! Ntambu yanfira ndiri neni, kumbiti gutendi ntambu yagufira gumweni.”<verse eid="MAT 26:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40" />Shakapanu kawawuyira wafundwa watatu walii na kawawona wagonja mpota na kamgambira Peteru, “Muweza ndiri kulikala masu pamuhera na neni ata lisaa limu? <verse eid="MAT 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41" />Mulikali masu na mluwi namwingira mumajerwa. Moyu gwa muntu gufira gutenda gakafira Mlungu, kumbiti makakala ga muntu gatosha ndiri.”<verse eid="MAT 26:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42" />Yesu kagenditi kayi na kaluwa, “Tati gwangu, handa payiwezekana ndiri lwindi lwa ntabiku luwuki pota neni kululanda, su vyagufiriti guvitendi.” <verse eid="MAT 26:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43" />Kawuyiti kayi na kuwawona wantumintumi wagonja mpota, masu gawu gaweriti gana mbota nentu.<verse eid="MAT 26:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44" />Yesu kawaleka kayi, kagenda zyakuwi na kuluwa mala ya tatu, pakaluwa ntambu iraa ilii. <verse eid="MAT 26:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45" />Shakapanu kawawuyira wafundwa na kuwagambira, “Hashi mwankali mwakugonja mpota na kwoyera? Mloli! Lisaa lyeni lisoka lya Mwana gwa Muntu kukamulwa kwa makakala mumawoku ga wantu yawana vidoda. <verse eid="MAT 26:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46" />Mwimuki, tugendeni zyetu. Mloli, panu kwana muntu ulii yakafira kung'alambuka!”<verse eid="MAT 26:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wankumkamula</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mariku 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luka 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yohani 18:3-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47" />Yesu kaweriti kankali kankutakula shaka Yuda yumu gwa wantumintumi lilongu na mbili, pakasokiti. Liziti lipinga likulu lya wantu wavuwa yawawera na magumba pamuhera na vindonga, womberi watumitwi na watambika wakulu pamuhera na wazewi. <verse eid="MAT 26:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48" />Yuda kawapiti lipinga lya wantu lilangaliru pakatakula, “Muntu yanumnona ndo yamumfira, su mumkamuli!”<verse eid="MAT 26:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49" />Yuda kamgendera Yesu na kamlamsiya, “Mfunda, ponga iweri na gwenga, su kamkisikira.”<verse eid="MAT 26:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50" />Yesu kamgambira, “Ganja gutendi kanongola shagwiziriti!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:50">Wantu walii su wiziti na wamkamula Yesu na wamtawa. <verse eid="MAT 26:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51" />Yumu gwa wantumintumi wa Yesu kasomola ligumba lyakuwi na kamdumula likutu lya ntumintumi gwa Mtambika mkulu. <verse eid="MAT 26:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52" />Yesu kamgambira, “Guwuziyi ligumba lyalu mumuhaku, toziya yoseri yakalutendera ligumba, hakahowi kwa ligumba. <verse eid="MAT 26:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53" />Muvimana ndiri kuwera neni menumluwi Tati gwangu kantangi, nayomberi mekanjegeri majeshi makulu malongu na mbili ga wantumintumi wa kumpindi kuntanga? <verse eid="MAT 26:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54" />Kumbiti hagaweri hashi, nakaka Malembu Mananagala gagalembitwi kuwera gafiruwa kulawira?”<verse eid="MAT 26:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55" />Shakapanu Yesu kaligambira lipinga lya wantu, “Iwera hashi munizira na magumba na vindonga kunkamula gambira neni mkwapula? Kila lishaka nweriti Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu panfunda na munkamula ndiri. <verse eid="MAT 26:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56" />Kumbiti goseri aga galawira su Malembu Mananagala ga wambuyi wa Mlungu gatendeki.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:56">Shakapanu wafundwa woseri wamleka su watuga.<verse eid="MAT 26:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kapalongolu pa shiyotera motu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:53-65">Mariku 14:53-65</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54">Luka 22:54</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:55">55</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13">Yohani 18:13</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:14">14</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57" />Wantu awa yawamkamuliti Yesu wamjegeriti kunumba kwa Kayafa, Mtambika mkulu, wamjojinikira wafunda wa Malagaliru na wazewi. <verse eid="MAT 26:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58" />Peteru kamfwatiti kwa kutali mpaka kuluwaga lwa Mtambika mkulu na kingiriti kuzyetu pakutozera kalivaga pamuhera na walolera ligomi, su kapati kulola vitwatira ntambu yaviwera. <verse eid="MAT 26:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59" />Watambika wakulu na shiyotera motu shoseri sha Wayawudi, shisakuliti upitawu wa kupaya kuusu Yesu wapati kumlaga, <verse eid="MAT 26:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60" />kumbiti wantu wavuwa watakuliti ukapitawu wa upayira kuusu yomberi. Pamuhera na hangu wapata ndiri shintu shoseri. Lupeleru wiziti wantu wawili <verse eid="MAT 26:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:61" />na walonga, “Muntu ayu katakuriti, ‘Weza kubomolanga Numba nkulu ya Mlungu na hanyawi kwa mashaka matatu.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 26:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62" />Mtambika mkulu kagoloka na kamgambira Yesu, “Hashi, guwawankula ndiri wantu awa wakutakulira shishi gwenga?” <verse eid="MAT 26:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63" />Kumbiti Yesu kanyamala jii. Mtambika mkulu kamgambira kayi, “Nukulapira kwa Mlungu mkomu, gutugambiri handa gwenga ndo gwa Kristu Mlopoziya, Mwana gwa Mlungu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:63" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64" />Yesu kamwankula, “Yina, gwenga gutakula. Kumbiti nuwagambirani mwawoseri mwenga, kwanjira shaka ashi hamumwoni Mwana gwa Muntu kalivaga uwega wa kumliwu wa Mlungu yakawera na makakala goseri na pakiza mumawundi ga kumpindi!”<verse eid="MAT 26:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65" />Panu Mtambika mkulu kapapula nguwu yakuwi na katakula, “Kamuhigilanga Mlungu! Tufira ndiri ukapitawu umonga! Vinu mpikanira mayigiranga gakuwi! <verse eid="MAT 26:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:66" />Mwenga mulihola hashi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:66">Womberi wamwankula, “Kana makosa su kafiruwa kahowi.”<verse eid="MAT 26:66" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67" />Shakapanu wamtemera mata kusheni na wamkoma na womberi wamuwakula.<verse eid="MAT 26:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68" />Na walonga, “Kristu gututungiri! Ndo gaa yakakuwakuliti!”<verse eid="MAT 26:68" /></para>
  <para style="s">Peteru kankumlema Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">Mariku 14:66-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luka 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yohani 18:15-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69" />Peteru kaweriti kalivagiti kunja kuzyetu ntumintumi mdala pakamgenderiti na kulonga “Gwenga guweriti pamuhera na Yesu gwa Galilaya.”<verse eid="MAT 26:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70" />Kumbiti Peteru kabera palongolu pa woseri. Kalonga, “Nuvimana ndiri vintu vyagutakula.” <verse eid="MAT 26:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71" />Pakaweriti kankulawa paligomi lya kuzyetu, ntumintumi mdala yumonga kamwona Peteru na kawagambira wantu yawaweriti paliya, “Muntu ayu kaweriti pamuhera na Yesu gwa Nazareti.”<verse eid="MAT 26:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72" />Peteru kabera kayi na kuwankula, “Nulirapa kuwera nummana ndiri muntu ayu!”<verse eid="MAT 26:72" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73" />Katepu hera wantu yawaweriti wagoloka paliya wamgenderiti Peteru na watakula, “Nakaka ntambu yagutakula ilanguziya gwenga gwa muntu wa Galilaya!”<verse eid="MAT 26:73" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74" />Shakapanu Peteru kalonga, “Nulirapa kuwera nuwagambirani nakaka! Mlungu gwangu kanazibu handa neni panuwapayira! Nummana ndiri muntu ayu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:74">Katepu njogolu kaweka, <verse eid="MAT 26:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75" />na Peteru kaliholiti visoweru vyakagambiritwi na Yesu, “Pamberi pa njogolu keniwiki, hagunemi mala ntatu kuwera gumana ndiri neni.” Kalawa kunja na kagenda kulila nentu.<verse eid="MAT 26:75" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27" />
  <para style="s">Yesu wankumjega kwa Pilatu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:1">Mariku 15:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-2">Luka 23:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-32">Yohani 18:28-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1" />Mandawira putiputi watambika wakulu woseri na wazewi waliwoniti pamuhera watenditi mpangu gwa kumlaga Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2" />Womberi wamtawa pingu na wamjega kwa Pilatu mkulu gwa mkowa yakasyagulitwi na mlongoziya gwa sirikali ya Rumi.<verse eid="MAT 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhowa kwa Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="ACT 1:18-19">Matendu 1:18-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3" />Yuda mgalambuka, pakawoniti kuwera Yesu wamtoza kala, yomberi moyu gumtamiti nentu na kawawuzilira watambika wakulu pamuhera na wazewi magwala malongu matatu galii ga mpiya. <verse eid="MAT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4" />Kalonga, “Neni ntenda vidoda kwa kumgalambuka muntu yakahera likosa, wamlagi!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:4">Womberi wamwankula, “Gatuwusu shishi twenga? Aga ndo gaku gumweni!”<verse eid="MAT 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5" />Yuda kaziyasa mpiya zilii Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu, kalawa kunja kagenda kulilaga mulugoyi.<verse eid="MAT 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6" />Watambika wakulu wazitola mpiya zilii na walonga, “Azi ndo mpiya zya mwazi na ifaa ndiri kuzitula mluhanja lwa Numba nkulu ya Mlungu.” <verse eid="MAT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7" />Pawajimilirana kala kuusu mpiya azi, womberi wazitumiya kuhemera lirambu lya ukaka, liweri pahala pa kusilira wahenga. <verse eid="MAT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8" />Ndo mana mpaka leru lirambu ali walishema, “Lirambu lya Mwazi.”<verse eid="MAT 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9" />Su visoweru vyakatakuliti Yeremiya mbuyi gwa Mlungu vitendeki, “Watoliti magwala malongu matatu ga mpiya, shyasi sha wantu wa Israeli wapangiti kumlipira yomberi, <verse eid="MAT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10" />na wahemelera lirambu la ukaka, Mtuwa ntambu yakanagaliriti.”<verse eid="MAT 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pilatu kankumkosiya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:2-5">Mariku 15:2-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:3-5">Luka 23:3-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:33-38">Yohani 18:33-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11" />Yesu wamgolosiyiti palongolu pa mkulu gwa mkowa, ndomweni yakamkosiyiti. Su Pilatu kamkosiya, “Hashi, gwenga ndo mfalumi gwa Wayawudi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:11">Yesu kamwankula, “Gwenga gulonga.” <verse eid="MAT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12" />Kumbiti Yesu kankula ndiri shintu, watambika wakulu na wazewi pawaweriti wankumsitaki.<verse eid="MAT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13" />Su Pilatu kamkosiya, “Hashi, gupikinira ndiri masitaka goseri aga gawalaviya kwa gwenga?”<verse eid="MAT 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14" />Kumbiti Yesu kawankula ndiri ata shisoweru shimu, ata mkulu gwa mkowa ayu kalikangasha nentu.<verse eid="MAT 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wankumtoza kulagwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mariku 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luka 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yohani 18:39-19:16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15" />Iweriti shitiba shawu mushaka sha msambu gwa Pasaka mkulu gwa mkowa kumvugulira mtatirwa yumu yawamfiriti. <verse eid="MAT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16" />Shaka ashi kuweriti na muntu yumu yakamanikaniti nentu yawamtatiriti mushibetubetu litawu lyakuwi Baraba. <verse eid="MAT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17" />Su wantu pawaliwoniti pamuhera, Pilatu kawakosiya, “Mfira numulaviyi yoshi pakati pa wawili awa, Baraba ama Yesu yawamshema Kristu Mlopoziya?” <verse eid="MAT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18" />Yomberi kavimaniti weri kuwera walongoziya wa Shiyawudi wamjegiti Yesu kwakuwi kwajili ya weya.<verse eid="MAT 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19" />Pilatu pakaweriti kalivaga pashigoda sha kutoza, mdala gwakuwi kamjegeriti ujumbi, “Naguliyingiziya mulisitaka lya muntu ayu muheri, toziya leru ntabika nentu mukulota kuusu yomberi.”<verse eid="MAT 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20" />Watambika wakulu na wazewi waligambiriti lipinga lya wantu wamluwi Baraba wamvuguliri na Yesu wamlagi. <verse eid="MAT 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21" />Kumbiti Pilatu kalikosiya lipinga lya wantu, “Hashi, yoshi pakati pa wawili awa yamfira nukuvugulirani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:21">Womberi wamwankula, “Baraba!”<verse eid="MAT 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22" />Pilatu kawakosiya, “Vinu ntendi ashashi kuusu Yesu yawamshema Kristu Mlopoziya?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:22">Woseri wamwankula, “Gumpingiki palupingika!”<verse eid="MAT 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23" />Kumbiti Pilatu kakosiya, “Hashi, yomberi katenda likosa gaa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:23">Shakapanu womberi wanjiti kushowangana, “Wampingiki palupingika!”<verse eid="MAT 27:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24" />Pilatu pakawoniti kuwera kafanikiwa ndiri shoseri na kwana vidoda viweriti vyankwanja katoliti mashi na kaganaviya mawoku gakuwi palongolu pa lipinga lya wantu na kalonga, “Neni nahera lawama kuhowa kwa muntu ayu. Na shitwatila ashi mtendi maweni.”<verse eid="MAT 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25" />Lipinga lyoseri lya wantu limwankula, “Mwazi gwakuwi guweri kwa twenga na kwa wananguta wetu.”<verse eid="MAT 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26" />Shakapanu Pilatu kamvugulira Baraba kulawa mushibetubetu, kumbiti Yesu pawamsyatanga kala ntomondu, kamlaviyiti wampingiki mulupingika.<verse eid="MAT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wanjagila wakumtendera lijonga Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:16-20">Mariku 15:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yohani 19:2-3</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27" />Shakapanu wanjagila wa Pilatu wamtola Yesu wamwingiziya mumakawu makulu ga numba zya wanjagila wa Shirumi na wamjojinikira shipinga shoseri. <verse eid="MAT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28" />Wamvula nguwu zyakuwi na wamvalisiya lihabiti lya langi nsheri. <verse eid="MAT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29" />Su wapota lijenjeri lya misontu na wamvalisiya mumtuwi mwakuwi na wamtulira ludenki muliwoku lyakuwi lya kumliwu na wasuntama palongolu pakuwi na wamtendera lijonga. Womberi wamlamsiya, “Mwika Mfalumi gwa Wayawudi.” <verse eid="MAT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30" />Wamtemera mata na walutola ludenki lulii na wamkoma nalu mumtuwi. <verse eid="MAT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31" />Pawamaliriti kala kumtendera lijonga, wamvula lihabiti lilii na wamvalisiya nguwu zakuwi. Su wamjega yomberi kumpinjika mulupingika.<verse eid="MAT 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wankumpingika</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mariku 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luka 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yohani 19:17-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32" />Pawaweriti wankugenda wamwona muntu yumu litawu lyakuwi Simoni yakalawiriti lushi lwa Kureni na wanjagila wamlazimisha kulutola lupingika lwa Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33" />Pawasokiti pahala pawapashema Goligota, mana yakuwi, “Pahala pa vipalakasa vya mtuwi.” <verse eid="MAT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34" />Wamupa muhanganu gwa Divayi na mtera gukaripa, kumbiti Yesu pakailawaliriti kalema kulanda.<verse eid="MAT 27:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35" />Wampingika palupingika, shakapanu waligawirana nguwu zyakuwi kwa kugalambula simbi. <verse eid="MAT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36" />Pa aga walivaga panu waweriti wankumlolera. <verse eid="MAT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37" />Pampindi pa mtuwi gwakuwi mulupingika watula lisitaka limwusu yomberi lyawalembiti, “Ayu ndo Yesu, Mfalumi gwa Wayawudi.” <verse eid="MAT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38" />Shakapanu wawapingika wakwepula wawili pamuhera na Yesu, yumu uwega wa kumshigi kwakuwi na yumonga uwega wa kumliwu kwakuwi.<verse eid="MAT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39" />Wantu yawaweriti wankupita pahala paliya wamwigilanga Yesu na kutikisiya mituwi yawu pawalonga, <verse eid="MAT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40" />“Gwenga gulitumbiti kuyibomolanga Numba nkulu ya Mlungu na kuinyawa kwa mashaka matatu! Vinu gulilopoziyi gumweni handa gwenga gwa Mwana gwa Mlungu, su gusuluki palupingika!”<verse eid="MAT 27:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41" />Ntambu iraa ayi watambika wakulu na wafunda wa Malagaliru na wazewi wamtendiriti lijonga, <verse eid="MAT 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:42" />“Kawalopoziyiti wamonga, kumbuti kasinda kulipoziya mweni! Hashi, yomberi mfalumi ndiri gwa Israeli? Vinu kasuluki palupingika na twenga hatumjimiri. <verse eid="MAT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43" />Kamtumbiliti Mlungu na kutakula eti yomberi ndo Mwana gwa Mlungu. Su tuleki tumloli Mlungu kamlopoziyi handa kamfira nakaka!”<verse eid="MAT 27:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44" />Ntambu iraa ayi na wakwepula walii yawawapingikiti pamuhera na Yesu wamuhigiranga viraa.<verse eid="MAT 27:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhowa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mariku 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luka 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yohani 19:28-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45" />Kwanjira saa sita mpaka saa tisa paliwala, pasipanu poseri paweriti na ntiti saa ntatu. <verse eid="MAT 27:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46" />Payiweriti saa tisa Yesu kalira kwa liziwu likulu, “Eloyi, Eloyi lama sabakitani?” Mana yakuwi, “Mlungu gwangu, Mlungu gwangu iwera ashi gundeka?”<verse eid="MAT 27:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47" />Wantu wamu yawagolokiti palii pawapikaniriti hangu, walonga, “Kankumshema Eliya!” <verse eid="MAT 27:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48" />Yumu gwawu katuga katola lidodoki, kalijwika mudivayi isheshema, kayitula mulupeleru lwa ludenki na wajera kumupa yomberi kalandi.<verse eid="MAT 27:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49" />Kumbiti wamonga walonga, “Guheperi, tuloli handa Eliya kankwiza kumlopoziya!”<verse eid="MAT 27:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50" />Yesu kalira kayi kwa liziwu likulu, su kahowa.<verse eid="MAT 27:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51" />Shakapanu lipaziya lya Numba nkulu ya Mlungu lyalilekaniziya pahala pananagala nentu, lidegeka vipandi viwili kulawa kunani mpaka pasi. Pasipanu pabegiziwa na matalawu gapantika, <verse eid="MAT 27:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52" />na mapumba gagubutuka na wantu wa Mlungu wavuwa yawahowiti wazyukusiwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53" />Womberi walawa mumapumba na Yesu pakazyukiti kala kulawa kwa wahowiti, womberi wagenditi Yerusalemu lushi lunanagala, wawonikaniti na wantu wavuwa.<verse eid="MAT 27:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54" />Mkulu gwa wawanjagila na wanjagila yawaweriti wankumlolera Yesu, wawoniti kubegiziwa pasipanu na vitwatira vyoseri vyavilawiriti, watiriti nentu na walonga, “Nakaka muntu ayu kaweriti Mwana gwa Mlungu!”<verse eid="MAT 27:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55" />Kuweriti na wadala wavuwa palii, pawalola kwa kutali. Wadala awa ndo walii yawamfatiti Yesu kulawa Galilaya na wamtangiti. <verse eid="MAT 27:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56" />Pakati pawu paweriti Mariya Magidalena na Mariya mawu gwa Yakobu na mlongu gwakuwi yawamshema Yosefu, pamuhera na mdala gwa Zebedayu.<verse eid="MAT 27:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wankumsira</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mariku 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luka 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yohani 19:38-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57" />Payiweriti pamihi, kiziti muntu yumu kalunda mwenikaya gwa Arimatayu litawu lyakuwi Yosefu na yomberi kaweriti mfundwa gwa Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58" />Kamgenderiti Pilatu na kaluwa mawuti ga Yesu. Pilatu kalagalira wamupi Yosefu mawuti galii. <verse eid="MAT 27:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59" />Su Yosefu katola mawuti galii, kagatindiziya sanda iherepa, <verse eid="MAT 27:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60" />na Kagatula mulipumba lya mpanga lyakuwi, lyakalisongoliti palitalawu. Su kalibiringa litalawu likulu pamlyangu gwa lipumba na kagenda zyakuwi. <verse eid="MAT 27:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61" />Mariya Magidalena na Mariya gwingi ulii yawaweriti walivaga palii pawalola lipumba.<verse eid="MAT 27:61" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lipumba lyankulolerwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62" />Shirawu yakuwi, lishaka lya Kwoyera, watambika wakulu na Mafalisayu wamgendiriti Pilatu, <verse eid="MAT 27:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63" />na walonga, “Mtuwa, tulihola kuwera mpayu ulii katakuliti pamberi pa kuhowa kwakuwi kalongiti, ‘Pa mashaka matatu hanzyuki.’ <verse eid="MAT 27:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64" />Su gulagaliri lipumba lyakuwi waliloleri weri mpaka lishaka lya tatu, su wafundwa wakuwi hapeni wawezi kwiza kugatola mauti gakuwi na kuwagambira wantu kuwera kazyuka. Kupayira aku hakuweri kudoda kuliku kupayira kwa kwanja.”<verse eid="MAT 27:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65" />Pilatu kawagambira, “Muwatoli walolera, mgendi na kulolera lipumba ntambu yamuweza.”<verse eid="MAT 27:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66" />Su wagenda na kulolera lipumba walimatira litalawu na kuwaleka wanjagila waloleri.<verse eid="MAT 27:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28" />
  <para style="s">Kuzyuka kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 16:1-10">Mariku 16:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luka 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yohani 20:1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1" />Palipititi lishaka lya Kwoyera, mandawira putiputi lishaka lya jumapili, Mariya Magidalena na Mariya yumonga ulii, wagenditi kulilola lipumba. <verse eid="MAT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2" />Palaa palii kulawira kutikinyika kukulu kwa isi, ntumintumi gwa kupindi gwa Mtuwa kiziti kulawa kumpindi, kalibiringisiya libuwi lilii na kalivagira. <verse eid="MAT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3" />Kawonikaniti gambira umemi na nguwu zyakuwi ziweriti neru mbuu. <verse eid="MAT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4" />Walolera lipumba waweriti na lyoga likulu ata wawera gambira wantu yawahowa.<verse eid="MAT 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5" />Ntumintumi gwa kumpindi kawagambira wadala walii, “Namtira mwenga! Nuvimana kuwera mwankumsakula Yesu yawampingikiti. <verse eid="MAT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6" />Kwahera panu, toziya Kazyuka ntambu yakalongiti. Mwizi mloli pahala pawamtuliti. <verse eid="MAT 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7" />Su mgendi kanongola vinu na mwakawagambiri wafundwa wakuwi, ‘Kazyuka kulawa kwawahowiti na kankuwalongolera kugenda ku Galilaya, aku hamumuwoni yomberi!’ Muliholi shanuwagambirani.”<verse eid="MAT 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8" />Wadala awa walawiti kanongola mulipumba, watuga kugenda kuwagambira wafundwa wakuwi, pawawera na lyoga na nemeleru nkulu.<verse eid="MAT 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9" />Vumu Yesu kaliwona nawomberi na kuwagambira, “Mwakashina?” Womberi wamwizira na kumsuntamalira pamagulu gakuwi na wamguwira. <verse eid="MAT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10" />Yesu kawagambira “Namtira! Mgendi mwakawagambiri walongu wangu wagendi Galilaya, aku hawamoni.”<verse eid="MAT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shawatakuliti walolera lipumba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11" />Wadala walii pawaweriti wankugenda zawu, walolera wamu wa lipumba wagenditi mlushi kuwagambira watambika wakulu wa numba ya Mlungu kuusu vitwatira vyoseri vyavilawiliti. <verse eid="MAT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12" />Su waliwona pamuhera na wazewi watenda mpangu, wawapanani wanjagila walii mpiya zivuwa nentu <verse eid="MAT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:13" />na wawagambira, “Mwenga mtakuli kuwera wafundwa wakuwi wiziti pashiru wawiwa mawuti gakuwi twenga patugonjiti. <verse eid="MAT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14" />Na mkulu gwa mkowa pakavimana visoweru avi, twenga hatuyoweri nayu na mwenga hapeni mpati matatizu. <verse eid="MAT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15" />Walolera lipumba walii wazitola mpiya na watenda shilii shawawagambira watendi. Shisoweru ashi sheneyiti kwa wayawudi mpaka leru.<verse eid="MAT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankuwalawira wantumintumi wakuwi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mariku 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luka 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yohani 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Matendu 1:6-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16" />“Wafundwa lilongu na yumu wagenditi Galilaya pahala Yesu pakawagambiriti wagendi. <verse eid="MAT 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17" />Womberi pawamwoniti Yesu wamguwira, tembera wamonga waweriti na lyoga.”<verse eid="MAT 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18" />Yesu kiziti pakwegera na kawagambira, “Wanupa uwezu woseri kumpindi na pasipanu. <verse eid="MAT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19" />Su mgendi kwa wantu wa makabila goseri kila pahala na muwatendi waweri wafundwa wangu, muwabatizi mulitawu lya Tati na Mwana na Rohu Mnanagala, <verse eid="MAT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20" />na muwafundi womberi kujimila kila shintu shanuwalagalira mwenga. Na neni hanweri na mwenga mashaka goseri mpaka kupelera kwa pasipanu.”<verse eid="MAT 28:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28" />
</usx>